GB-CAM,12,2020-12-01,52.3679759,-0.2555737,"<div id=""html_2fb96a700f2e0bf1374725cc669ff0f5"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Rusts Lane, Alconbury</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal property flooding was reported in this area during the December 2020 event. (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Pumps designed to alleviate surface&ndash;water run&ndash;off at Rusts Lane (a Cambridgeshire Highways asset) failed during the event; this failure contributed to the inability to convey surface water away from the area and worsened local flooding. (p14)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of residential properties to a depth of about 750mm; additional outbuilding and garden flooding. Pumps at Rusts Lane (a Cambridgeshire Highways asset) failed to convey surface water, contributing to the local flooding. Residents reported being displaced from their homes for periods over 6 months. [TAB] (p15)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>LLFA/RMA attended to investigate reports of flooding; Cambridgeshire Highways ordered cleaning of pumps at Rusts Lane to address flooding issues. [TAB] (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>22 residential properties; depth c.750mm; displacement over 6 months (High Street and Rusts Lane) [TAB] (p15)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Rusts Lane, Alconbury",England,"Internal property flooding was reported in this area during the December 2020 event. (p11)
