GB-CAM,12,2020-12-01,52.3784371,-0.2690705,"<div id=""html_f6d18491dee452b07196a7c46aa7d2b1"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Butchers Close, Alconbury Weston</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Acted as a flow path for surface water run&ndash;off from Vinegar Hill; floodwater flowed between properties in the Butcher's Close area and contributed to water entering nearby properties (report notes a historic ditch in this area had been filled). (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Butchers Close, Alconbury Weston",England,Acted as a flow path for surface water run–off from Vinegar Hill; floodwater flowed between properties in the Butcher's Close area and contributed to water entering nearby properties (report notes a historic ditch in this area had been filled). (p12),,GB-CAM_12_2020-12-01.html,GB-CAM_12_2020-12-01,Alconbury flooding December 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Alconbury and Alconbury Weston,021/Cambridgeshire County/021/2020/Cambridgeshire County/Alconbury-December-2020-Flood-Investigation-Version-1.1.pdf
