GB-KEN,11,2019-06-10,51.343935,0.2640454,"<div id=""html_aad8f10545203420c5ef090bc92dd296"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Southfields Road, West Kingsdown</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overland flows from the fields south of London Road contributed to flooding at the lowest point of Southfields Road, causing internal flooding to a property located there. [TAB] (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Received overland run&ndash;off that flowed from the A20 London Road and Ash Tree Close following the evening intensification of rainfall; run&ndash;off caused flooding impacts as it moved through residential areas. (p6)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property flooded [TAB] (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Southfields Road, West Kingsdown",England,"Overland flows from the fields south of London Road contributed to flooding at the lowest point of Southfields Road, causing internal flooding to a property located there. [TAB] (p2)
