GB-MIK,1,2018-05-27,52.0344382,-0.7556351,"<div id=""html_55444e35bf6c50b21e977e3a29b0f145"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Shackleton Place, Milton Keynes Unitary Authority</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Indicators of flooding were observed in Shackleton Place (figures show surface&ndash;water&ndash;related impacts). (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding accumulation observed at the roundabout of Hatton Avenue and Shackleton Place; indicators of flooding recorded during inspection. (p25)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A residential property on the street experienced water ingress with large appliances and numerous household items removed outside; visible debris and ongoing cleanup indicate property damage and disruption to residents. [IMG] (p28)</p></div></div></body></div>",Milton Keynes,"Shackleton Place, Milton Keynes Unitary Authority",England,"Indicators of flooding were observed in Shackleton Place (figures show surface–water–related impacts). (p7)
