GB-MIK,1,2018-05-27,52.133069,-0.7808483,"<div id=""html_c3518c694745d1aa8cebe33d384e2097"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Orchard Way, Stoke Goldington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Recorded very intense rainfall during 27 May 2018 and the investigation records indicators consistent with surface water / flash flooding impacting the locality. [TAB] (p36)</p></div></div></body></div>",Milton Keynes,"Orchard Way, Stoke Goldington",England,Recorded very intense rainfall during 27 May 2018 and the investigation records indicators consistent with surface water / flash flooding impacting the locality. [TAB] (p36),,GB-MIK_1_2018-05-27.html,GB-MIK_1_2018-05-27,Milton Keynes Unitary Authority flooding 27 May 2018,FWMA Section 19 Report: Flood Event: May 2018,081/Milton Keynes/081/2018/Milton Keynes/Milton Keynes/10/18.pdf
