GB-MIK,1,2018-05-27,52.1648634,-0.707555782097275,"<div id=""html_8e49a80661c189d8301517c0d0984a5e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Olney</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A reported flood incident was recorded in Olney during the event. [TAB] (p15)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 reported incident [TAB] (p15)</p></div></div></body></div>",Milton Keynes,Olney,England,A reported flood incident was recorded in Olney during the event. [TAB] (p15),1 reported incident [TAB] (p15),GB-MIK_1_2018-05-27.html,GB-MIK_1_2018-05-27,Milton Keynes Unitary Authority flooding 27 May 2018,FWMA Section 19 Report: Flood Event: May 2018,081/Milton Keynes/081/2018/Milton Keynes/Milton Keynes/10/18.pdf
