GB-DUD,1,2016-06-08,52.45994,-2.1160498,"<div id=""html_3f2d24b78e38691ff1eb6577b6f284f6"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Lye Station</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Temporary closure of the railway station due to flooding. (p14)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 railway station closed (p14)</p></div></div></body></div>",Dudley,Lye Station,England,Temporary closure of the railway station due to flooding. (p14),1 railway station closed (p14),GB-DUD_1_2016-06-08.html,GB-DUD_1_2016-06-08,Dudley flooding 08 Jun 2016 - 16 Jun 2016,Flood Investigation Report for June 2016,038/Dudley/038/2016/Dudley/dudley-metropolitan-borough-council-flood-investigation-report-for-june-2016-public-version-mar-15.pdf
