GB-DBY,1,2023-10-18,52.97109,-1.307171,"<div id=""html_c915fa5c3f67932128350ad594455179"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ilkeston</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Ilkeston is cited as an area with higher population density within eastern Derbyshire where higher concentrations of internally flooded properties occurred during the Storm Babet event, linked to watercourse overtopping and surface water flooding (with some sewer&ndash;related incidents where infrastructure was overwhelmed). (p3)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,Ilkeston,England,"Ilkeston is cited as an area with higher population density within eastern Derbyshire where higher concentrations of internally flooded properties occurred during the Storm Babet event, linked to watercourse overtopping and surface water flooding (with some sewer–related incidents where infrastructure was overwhelmed). (p3)",,GB-DBY_1_2023-10-18.html,GB-DBY_1_2023-10-18,Derbyshire flooding 18 Oct 2023 - 21 Oct 2023,Derbyshire County Council Section 19 Investigation Report – Storm Babet 18/10/23 – 21/10/23,034/Derbyshire County/034/2023/Derbyshire County/section-1-introduction-final-storm-babet-dcc-section-19-report.pdf
