ntial properties (across the High Brooms area including Brook Road, Dougall Close and Sandhurst Close) [PAG] (p23)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Dougal Close, High Brooms",England,"Flooding was reported affecting residential properties on the cul–de–sac; KFRS and KCC responded to incidents in the area. [TAB] (p7)
