GB-KEN,19,2017-07-19,51.12975507079864,0.26356769975754935,"<div id=""html_0b1dc7b9ec27a217c047091fbe4d3448"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Mount Pleasant</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Listed in KCC figures as one of the main areas affected by the 2017 floods (19 July 2017). Localised inundation of properties occurred during the event; fire crews attended to pump properties and provide humanitarian assistance as waters receded. [IMG] (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,Mount Pleasant,England,Listed in KCC figures as one of the main areas affected by the 2017 floods (19 July 2017). Localised inundation of properties occurred during the event; fire crews attended to pump properties and provide humanitarian assistance as waters receded. [IMG] (p8),,GB-KEN_19_2017-07-19.html,GB-KEN_19_2017-07-19,Tunbridge Wells flooding 19 Jul 2017,Flood Investigation Report: Flooding Affecting the Tunbridge Wells Area on 19 July 2017,063/Kent/Tunbridge-Wells-Section-19-report.pdf
GB-KEN,19,2017-07-19,51.1433292,0.2840623,"<div id=""html_f2a410bea8aae219af16352658b0173d"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Sherwood</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The Sherwood area contained locations marked as flooded in 2017; three closely spaced residential streets (Brook Road, Dougall Close and Sandhurst Close) were shown as flood locations near Royal Victoria Place, indicating localized surface&ndash;water/urban flooding along that corridor. [IMG] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 locations (Brook Road; Dougall Close; Sandhurst Close) [IMG] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,Sherwood,England,"The Sherwood area contained locations marked as flooded in 2017; three closely spaced residential streets (Brook Road, Dougall Close and Sandhurst Close) were shown as flood locations near Royal Victoria Place, indicating localized surface–water/urban flooding along that corridor. [IMG] (p9)",3 locations (Brook Road; Dougall Close; Sandhurst Close) [IMG] (p9),GB-KEN_19_2017-07-19.html,GB-KEN_19_2017-07-19,Tunbridge Wells flooding 19 Jul 2017,Flood Investigation Report: Flooding Affecting the Tunbridge Wells Area on 19 July 2017,063/Kent/Tunbridge-Wells-Section-19-report.pdf
GB-BDF,1,2020-12-23,52.1363806,-0.4675041,"<div id=""html_2a08acaacd9b85b3cdf9f36369cc0326"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Bedford</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Wider area within the borough experienced surface water flooding around the Keysoe Row East area on 23/12/2020, including two residential properties that suffered internal flooding due to heavy rainfall, blocked culvert and overland flow; a major incident was declared for the wider area on 25/12/2020. (p2)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>two residential properties (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,Bedford,England,"Wider area within the borough experienced surface water flooding around the Keysoe Row East area on 23/12/2020, including two residential properties that suffered internal flooding due to heavy rainfall, blocked culvert and overland flow; a major incident was declared for the wider area on 25/12/2020. (p2)",two residential properties (p2),GB-BDF_1_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_1_2020-12-23,"Keysoe Row East, Keysoe Row flooding 23 Dec 2020",Section 19 Flood Investigation Report: Keysoe Row East,005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Keysoe-Row-East/July/2021.pdf
GB-BDF,1,2020-12-23,52.2442973,-0.4035977,"<div id=""html_23601b5e20ed308002f86efd8e76668b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Keysoe Row East, Keysoe Row</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Two residential properties suffered internal flooding. One property had water seeping through a wall from an adjacent drainage ditch; the other had water encroaching through the garden and patio door from an adjacent pond and fields. Flooding was driven by overland flow from fields, surface water ponding and local ditches/culvert issues. [IMG] (p1)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Two residential properties experienced internal flooding on 23/12/2020. One property had water seeping through a wall from an adjacent drainage ditch (with elevated groundwater thought to have contributed). The other property had water encroaching through the garden and patio door from an adjacent pond and overland flow from surrounding fields; a blocked culvert beneath the road caused the pond to back up and overtop its banks. (p2)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Two residential properties (p1)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Two residential properties (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,"Keysoe Row East, Keysoe Row",England,"Two residential properties suffered internal flooding. One property had water seeping through a wall from an adjacent drainage ditch; the other had water encroaching through the garden and patio door from an adjacent pond and fields. Flooding was driven by overland flow from fields, surface water ponding and local ditches/culvert issues. [IMG] (p1)
Two residential properties experienced internal flooding on 23/12/2020. One property had water seeping through a wall from an adjacent drainage ditch (with elevated groundwater thought to have contributed). The other property had water encroaching through the garden and patio door from an adjacent pond and overland flow from surrounding fields; a blocked culvert beneath the road caused the pond to back up and overtop its banks. (p2)","Two residential properties (p1)
Two residential properties (p2)",GB-BDF_1_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_1_2020-12-23,"Keysoe Row East, Keysoe Row flooding 23 Dec 2020",Section 19 Flood Investigation Report: Keysoe Row East,005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Keysoe-Row-East/July/2021.pdf
GB-BDF,1,2020-12-23,52.2380679,-0.4165707,"<div id=""html_20e8745f95e927e7f2d3a935eff83fcb"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Keysoe Row</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Two residential properties experienced internal flooding: one had water seeping through a wall from an adjacent drainage ditch; the other had water encroach through the garden and patio door from adjacent pond/fields driven by overland flow and surface water ponding. [IMG] (p1)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Two residential properties (p1)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,Keysoe Row,England,Two residential properties experienced internal flooding: one had water seeping through a wall from an adjacent drainage ditch; the other had water encroach through the garden and patio door from adjacent pond/fields driven by overland flow and surface water ponding. [IMG] (p1),Two residential properties (p1),GB-BDF_1_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_1_2020-12-23,"Keysoe Row East, Keysoe Row flooding 23 Dec 2020",Section 19 Flood Investigation Report: Keysoe Row East,005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Keysoe-Row-East/July/2021.pdf
GB-CAM,5,2014-08-01,52.2991084,-0.3911861,"<div id=""html_24606b17941d1ed2cec0680879b7c73a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Thrapston Road, Kimbolton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A section of Thrapston Road was shown within the reported flood area (blue overlay on the map), indicating localised inundation affecting the road and immediate adjacent areas; reported by a resident. [IMG] (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Five properties flooded internally and the road itself was flooded. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>5 properties [TAB] (p3)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Thrapston Road, Kimbolton",England,"A section of Thrapston Road was shown within the reported flood area (blue overlay on the map), indicating localised inundation affecting the road and immediate adjacent areas; reported by a resident. [IMG] (p2)
