GB-DBY,8,2023-10-18,53.0139355,-1.7374501,"<div id=""html_b877c2f2cd8133e6834d2f26995884c8"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>School Lane, Ashbourne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding affected the School Lane area, prompting the Environment Agency to consider raising defences, raising access ramps/embankments and to investigate lowering a downstream bank to allow flood water into the floodplain earlier to reduce flood levels. (p6)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"School Lane, Ashbourne",England,"Flooding affected the School Lane area, prompting the Environment Agency to consider raising defences, raising access ramps/embankments and to investigate lowering a downstream bank to allow flood water into the floodplain earlier to reduce flood levels. (p6)",,GB-DBY_8_2023-10-18.html,GB-DBY_8_2023-10-18,Derbyshire flooding 18 Oct 2023 - 21 Oct 2023,Derbyshire County Council Section 19 Investigation Report – Storm Babet 18/10/23 – 21/10/23,034/Derbyshire County/034/2023/Derbyshire County/section-8-post-event-response-and-recovery-final-storm-babet-dcc-section-19-report.pdf
