GB-DBY,8,2023-10-18,53.2779259,-1.2543447,"<div id=""html_ceb387cd40b636e5e9627e66a3685ea0"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Creswell Road, Clowne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Twin culvert beneath Creswell Road has blockages that restrict flow; planned clearing is required to reduce flooding from the adjacent watercourse. (p6)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Creswell Road, Clowne",England,Twin culvert beneath Creswell Road has blockages that restrict flow; planned clearing is required to reduce flooding from the adjacent watercourse. (p6),,GB-DBY_8_2023-10-18.html,GB-DBY_8_2023-10-18,Derbyshire flooding 18 Oct 2023 - 21 Oct 2023,Derbyshire County Council Section 19 Investigation Report – Storm Babet 18/10/23 – 21/10/23,034/Derbyshire County/034/2023/Derbyshire County/section-8-post-event-response-and-recovery-final-storm-babet-dcc-section-19-report.pdf
