GB-DBY,8,2023-10-18,53.118504,-1.556618,"<div id=""html_c9a2e2dce7dd3381074ed09902143570"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Derbyshire</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>County&ndash;wide impacts from Storm Babet: site visits and flood investigations were undertaken; over 400 structures/assets affected were inspected by Derbyshire County Council; a strategic recovery group was set up and Community Information Officers were deployed by the Environment Agency. Water companies investigated drainage networks, wastewater treatment works, pumping stations and combined sewer overflow facilities. (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Communities across the county were affected by flooding during the event(s), prompting council&ndash;led investigations (e.g., Ashton&ndash;on&ndash;Trent), guidance publication by district/town councils and plans to improve county&ndash;wide flood risk management and community resilience. [PAG] (p7)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,Derbyshire,England,"County–wide impacts from Storm Babet: site visits and flood investigations were undertaken; over 400 structures/assets affected were inspected by Derbyshire County Council; a strategic recovery group was set up and Community Information Officers were deployed by the Environment Agency. Water companies investigated drainage networks, wastewater treatment works, pumping stations and combined sewer overflow facilities. (p2)
Communities across the county were affected by flooding during the event(s), prompting council–led investigations (e.g., Ashton–on–Trent), guidance publication by district/town councils and plans to improve county–wide flood risk management and community resilience. [PAG] (p7)",,GB-DBY_8_2023-10-18.html,GB-DBY_8_2023-10-18,Derbyshire flooding 18 Oct 2023 - 21 Oct 2023,Derbyshire County Council Section 19 Investigation Report – Storm Babet 18/10/23 – 21/10/23,034/Derbyshire County/034/2023/Derbyshire County/section-8-post-event-response-and-recovery-final-storm-babet-dcc-section-19-report.pdf
