GB-BNS,1,2019-11-07,53.52975251012114,-1.3867092296305277,"<div id=""html_0ac4b5d8430f435e6ffd3da4f8cbcd1b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Low Valley</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Identified as one of two main areas impacted by flooding. Low Valley was included in a Flood Warning for the River Dove (from Aldham Bridge to Low Valley) and was subject to the borough&#8217;s flood response measures during the event. (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of residential properties in the Low Valley area (including a caravan site and properties on Cotterdale Gardens). (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding to multiple residential addresses and at least one business: Cotterdale Gardens (16 residential properties flooded internally), Ings Road (15 residential properties flooded internally) and Station Road (34 residential properties flooded internally and 1 business flooded internally). [TAB] (p7)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>15 properties; 16 properties (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>16 properties; 15 properties; 34 properties; 1 business [TAB] (p7)</p></div></div></body></div>",Barnsley,Low Valley,England,"Identified as one of two main areas impacted by flooding. Low Valley was included in a Flood Warning for the River Dove (from Aldham Bridge to Low Valley) and was subject to the borough’s flood response measures during the event. (p4)
Internal flooding of residential properties in the Low Valley area (including a caravan site and properties on Cotterdale Gardens). (p5)
Internal flooding to multiple residential addresses and at least one business: Cotterdale Gardens (16 residential properties flooded internally), Ings Road (15 residential properties flooded internally) and Station Road (34 residential properties flooded internally and 1 business flooded internally). [TAB] (p7)","15 properties; 16 properties (p5)
