Evidence of flooding on Commercial Road and Fore Street; vehicle bow waves from passing vehicles caused internal flooding of properties. (p8)","46 properties (p5)
approximately 50 properties (Commercial Road and Fore Street) (p8)",GB-CON_5_2019-12-19.html,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19,Hayle flooding 19 Dec 2019,Flood Investigation Report for the Hayle event of 19 December 2019,027/Cornwall/027/2019/Cornwall/section-19-report-for-hayle.pdf
