GB-CON,5,2019-12-19,50.1905572,-5.4124635,"<div id=""html_2f7e770f88c6a4a7a58b0ab587ecd967"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Cross Street, Hayle</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water present on the road between Cross Street and the Cornubis Public House as part of main road flooding in central Hayle. (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,"Cross Street, Hayle",England,Surface water present on the road between Cross Street and the Cornubis Public House as part of main road flooding in central Hayle. (p8),,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19.html,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19,Hayle flooding 19 Dec 2019,Flood Investigation Report for the Hayle event of 19 December 2019,027/Cornwall/027/2019/Cornwall/section-19-report-for-hayle.pdf
GB-CON,5,2019-12-19,50.1764124,-5.4084439,"<div id=""html_691208bfbf1cd8f80062f97a2a475c43"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Strawberry Lane, Hayle</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Runoff from an upland daffodil field travelled down Strawberry Lane as part of the flow route during the event, continuing down Trevassack Hill toward Burnthouse Lane and Humphrey Davy Lane. (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,"Strawberry Lane, Hayle",England,"Runoff from an upland daffodil field travelled down Strawberry Lane as part of the flow route during the event, continuing down Trevassack Hill toward Burnthouse Lane and Humphrey Davy Lane. (p9)",,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19.html,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19,Hayle flooding 19 Dec 2019,Flood Investigation Report for the Hayle event of 19 December 2019,027/Cornwall/027/2019/Cornwall/section-19-report-for-hayle.pdf
GB-CON,5,2019-12-19,50.1904283,-5.4100351,"<div id=""html_3e660064b5354d0f8dd3ad03662847e9"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Lower Church Street, Hayle</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flowed down Lower Church Street, overtopping the kerb and coming close to reaching the thresholds of houses. (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,"Lower Church Street, Hayle",England,"Surface water flowed down Lower Church Street, overtopping the kerb and coming close to reaching the thresholds of houses. (p8)",,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19.html,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19,Hayle flooding 19 Dec 2019,Flood Investigation Report for the Hayle event of 19 December 2019,027/Cornwall/027/2019/Cornwall/section-19-report-for-hayle.pdf
GB-CON,5,2019-12-19,50.1824224,-5.4065278,"<div id=""html_db6dfc320f0092f6c27fa92cdc0a586d"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Burnthouse Lane, Hayle</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Substantial runoff travelled northwards along Burnthouse Lane during the event; material including large stones was mobilised and transported downstream towards Humphrey Davy Lane. (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,"Burnthouse Lane, Hayle",England,Substantial runoff travelled northwards along Burnthouse Lane during the event; material including large stones was mobilised and transported downstream towards Humphrey Davy Lane. (p9),,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19.html,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19,Hayle flooding 19 Dec 2019,Flood Investigation Report for the Hayle event of 19 December 2019,027/Cornwall/027/2019/Cornwall/section-19-report-for-hayle.pdf
GB-CON,5,2019-12-19,50.1878557,-5.4099141,"<div id=""html_fc502b9fe907e6c2150eaba0fdb0d321"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Humphry Davy Lane, Hayle</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Runoff and substantial flow passed onto Humphrey Davy Lane during the event; large stones were observed on the lane (carried from Burnthouse Lane), a drain at the corner of Trevithick Crescent and Humphrey Davy Lane became blocked, and evidence of a combined sewer overflow was observed so water was unable to drain away. (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,"Humphry Davy Lane, Hayle",England,"Runoff and substantial flow passed onto Humphrey Davy Lane during the event; large stones were observed on the lane (carried from Burnthouse Lane), a drain at the corner of Trevithick Crescent and Humphrey Davy Lane became blocked, and evidence of a combined sewer overflow was observed so water was unable to drain away. (p9)",,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19.html,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19,Hayle flooding 19 Dec 2019,Flood Investigation Report for the Hayle event of 19 December 2019,027/Cornwall/027/2019/Cornwall/section-19-report-for-hayle.pdf
