GB-CON,5,2019-12-19,50.1867853,-5.4088502,"<div id=""html_3c4e3ac30f2c485541bc346a5821089f"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Trevithick Crescent, Hayle</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The drain at the corner of Trevithick Crescent and Humphrey Davey Lane became blocked with material, preventing drainage of water running down Humphrey Davey Lane and contributing to local surface water flooding. (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,"Trevithick Crescent, Hayle",England,"The drain at the corner of Trevithick Crescent and Humphrey Davey Lane became blocked with material, preventing drainage of water running down Humphrey Davey Lane and contributing to local surface water flooding. (p9)",,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19.html,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19,Hayle flooding 19 Dec 2019,Flood Investigation Report for the Hayle event of 19 December 2019,027/Cornwall/027/2019/Cornwall/section-19-report-for-hayle.pdf
