GB-CON,5,2019-12-19,50.2208769,-5.3857959,"<div id=""html_5f8189e31db91b09e1da04485d32e1d0"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Gwithian</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Gwithian was reported as flooded during the event (manager updated at 11:00 that Gwithian was flooded). [TAB] (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties in Gwithian were flooded (impact from the same heavy&ndash;rain/surface&ndash;water runoff event). [PAG] (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Runoff from a field (attributed to works by pipe&ndash;laying contractors for South West Water) caused flooding to some properties; the incident was treated separately from Hayle though it was concurrent. (p10)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Some properties in Relubbus, Angarrack and Gwithian were impacted by flooding during the extreme rainfall event. (p12)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 properties [PAG] (p5)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,Gwithian,England,"Gwithian was reported as flooded during the event (manager updated at 11:00 that Gwithian was flooded). [TAB] (p2)
