2 properties [PAG] (p5)",GB-CON_5_2019-12-19.html,GB-CON_5_2019-12-19,Hayle flooding 19 Dec 2019,Flood Investigation Report for the Hayle event of 19 December 2019,027/Cornwall/027/2019/Cornwall/section-19-report-for-hayle.pdf
