GB-CON,5,2019-12-19,50.1386373,-5.4029337,"<div id=""html_280b0acba984ffdc6e04440dc4479901"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Relubbus</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding occurred in the nearby areas of Relubbus and Angarrack associated with the same runoff/town flooding event. (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The road through Relubbus, land outside properties and gardens flooded; one property flooded internally. Residents pumped surface water into the Relubbus Stream to avoid further internal property flooding. Flooding was likely driven by intense rainfall combined with agricultural runoff. (p10)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Some properties in Relubbus, Angarrack and Gwithian were impacted by flooding during the extreme rainfall event. (p12)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>one property (p10)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,Relubbus,England,"Flooding occurred in the nearby areas of Relubbus and Angarrack associated with the same runoff/town flooding event. (p5)
