GB-LAN,9,2015-12-01,53.8509186,-2.2208391405389625,"<div id=""html_7361734317705fe20968b20f527ec457"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Barrowford</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding affected residential properties. A blockage was identified in an open channel at the inlet to a culverted watercourse and a defect was found in a second nearby culverted watercourse, which were associated with flooding at this location. [TAB] (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>11 properties [TAB] (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Barrowford,England,"Internal flooding affected residential properties. A blockage was identified in an open channel at the inlet to a culverted watercourse and a defect was found in a second nearby culverted watercourse, which were associated with flooding at this location. [TAB] (p17)",11 properties [TAB] (p17),GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01,Pendle flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Pendle District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/pendle-final-report.pdf
