GB-LAN,9,2015-12-01,53.8567728,-2.1691238,"<div id=""html_59f9bd7429e35cafa5370871d220003b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Colne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding affected properties in the Burnley Road area; properties experienced internal inundation during the December 2015 event. [TAB] (p21)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>6 properties [TAB] (p21)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Colne,England,Internal flooding affected properties in the Burnley Road area; properties experienced internal inundation during the December 2015 event. [TAB] (p21),6 properties [TAB] (p21),GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01,Pendle flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Pendle District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/pendle-final-report.pdf
GB-LAN,9,2015-12-01,53.914757,-2.1356368,"<div id=""html_1d049eed319a8276979d3e3c37b96cb7"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Earby</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of residential properties after the New Cut overtopped its banks; floodwater was unable to enter the Victoria Clough inlet, flowed down the disused railway embankment and through Lane Ends, then flooded properties around Albion Road and Skipton Road. [TAB] (p22)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>69 properties [TAB] (p22)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Earby,England,"Internal flooding of residential properties after the New Cut overtopped its banks; floodwater was unable to enter the Victoria Clough inlet, flowed down the disused railway embankment and through Lane Ends, then flooded properties around Albion Road and Skipton Road. [TAB] (p22)",69 properties [TAB] (p22),GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01,Pendle flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Pendle District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/pendle-final-report.pdf
GB-LAN,9,2015-12-01,53.8251246,-2.2943857,"<div id=""html_9b94ff98b51f7bc3e9a66a293bc10bd3"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Higham</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of a residential property when the River Calder overtopped its banks at Higham. (p25)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p25)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Higham,England,Internal flooding of a residential property when the River Calder overtopped its banks at Higham. (p25),1 property (p25),GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01,Pendle flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Pendle District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/pendle-final-report.pdf
GB-LAN,9,2015-12-01,53.8980448,-2.1497719,"<div id=""html_fcef3a200d837945cb2ef24323c3b79a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Kelbrook</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of a residential property. [TAB] (p26)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property [TAB] (p26)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Kelbrook,England,Internal flooding of a residential property. [TAB] (p26),1 property [TAB] (p26),GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_9_2015-12-01,Pendle flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Pendle District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/pendle-final-report.pdf
