GB-KEN,15,2020-08-15,51.340694,0.7408379,"<div id=""html_e0e2acea6c7576b1cf11110c540b2e5e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Crown Quay Lane, Sittingbourne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flood waters were reported on the road during the 15 August 2020 event, causing roadway inundation. (p5)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Crown Quay Lane, Sittingbourne",England,"Flood waters were reported on the road during the 15 August 2020 event, causing roadway inundation. (p5)",,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15.html,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15,Sittingbourne flooding 15 Aug 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Sittingbourne,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Sittingbourne.pdf
GB-KEN,15,2020-08-15,51.3374864,0.7554747,"<div id=""html_fab1b3f7e2f2e3111bcaf42934361fbb"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Woodberry Drive, Snipeshill</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Soakaways became full during the intense rainfall on 15 August 2020, contributing to surface water accumulation and local flooding/runoff along overland flow paths. [PAG] (p5)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Of 24 gullies on Woodberry Drive, 3 were recorded as full in post&ndash;event gully&ndash;cleansing records (these full gullies were at the junction with Elm Grove and not in the area that flooded). [PAG] (p5)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Woodberry Drive, Snipeshill",England,"Soakaways became full during the intense rainfall on 15 August 2020, contributing to surface water accumulation and local flooding/runoff along overland flow paths. [PAG] (p5)","Of 24 gullies on Woodberry Drive, 3 were recorded as full in post–event gully–cleansing records (these full gullies were at the junction with Elm Grove and not in the area that flooded). [PAG] (p5)",GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15.html,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15,Sittingbourne flooding 15 Aug 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Sittingbourne,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Sittingbourne.pdf
GB-KEN,15,2020-08-15,51.3367451,0.8013698,"<div id=""html_3fc6edb19e8e72c74c53609b5720b44e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Swale</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The Swale area was affected by flooding related to the intensive localised storm on 15 August 2020; the report also references a previous flood affecting the Swale on 29 May 2018 and notes many of the same areas were affected. [MUL] (p1)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,Swale,England,The Swale area was affected by flooding related to the intensive localised storm on 15 August 2020; the report also references a previous flood affecting the Swale on 29 May 2018 and notes many of the same areas were affected. [MUL] (p1),,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15.html,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15,Sittingbourne flooding 15 Aug 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Sittingbourne,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Sittingbourne.pdf
GB-KEN,15,2020-08-15,51.339737,0.7342319,"<div id=""html_89b32c5c63ff959d6d496c04571d3865"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Sittingbourne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>An intensive localised storm on 15 August 2020 produced heavy rainfall that caused surface water/flash flooding across Sittingbourne; the report notes many of the areas affected in this event had also been affected during the May 2018 flood. (p1)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The event produced very intense, highly localised rainfall in Sittingbourne on 15th August 2020, leading to a surface&ndash;water flood situation in the town (report identifies high localized runoff and surface water flood risk overwhelming normal drainage capacity). [TAB,PAG] (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Intense, short&ndash;duration rainfall overwhelmed the drainage network across the urban area; surface water collected in low points causing flooding on multiple streets (including Coombe Drive, Lansdowne Road, St Michaels Road, Crown Quay Lane, Lime Grove, Woodberry Drive and The Street) and inundation of properties at low points. (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A short, intense rainstorm on 15 August 2020 produced extensive surface water/urban flooding in Sittingbourne: intense overland flows collected in topographic low points, and highway drainage and surface water sewers were overwhelmed, resulting in flooding to streets and properties. Floodwater drained away once rainfall ceased. (p6)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,Sittingbourne,England,"An intensive localised storm on 15 August 2020 produced heavy rainfall that caused surface water/flash flooding across Sittingbourne; the report notes many of the areas affected in this event had also been affected during the May 2018 flood. (p1)
The event produced very intense, highly localised rainfall in Sittingbourne on 15th August 2020, leading to a surface–water flood situation in the town (report identifies high localized runoff and surface water flood risk overwhelming normal drainage capacity). [TAB,PAG] (p4)
Intense, short–duration rainfall overwhelmed the drainage network across the urban area; surface water collected in low points causing flooding on multiple streets (including Coombe Drive, Lansdowne Road, St Michaels Road, Crown Quay Lane, Lime Grove, Woodberry Drive and The Street) and inundation of properties at low points. (p5)
A short, intense rainstorm on 15 August 2020 produced extensive surface water/urban flooding in Sittingbourne: intense overland flows collected in topographic low points, and highway drainage and surface water sewers were overwhelmed, resulting in flooding to streets and properties. Floodwater drained away once rainfall ceased. (p6)",,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15.html,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15,Sittingbourne flooding 15 Aug 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Sittingbourne,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Sittingbourne.pdf
GB-KEN,15,2020-08-15,51.3378408,0.7582946,"<div id=""html_173782355f7df287d750e3c7e4b200ae"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Snipeshill</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Central Snipehill shows a cluster of residential properties impacted by property flooding (map orange dots indicate affected dwellings). [IMG] (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,Snipeshill,England,Central Snipehill shows a cluster of residential properties impacted by property flooding (map orange dots indicate affected dwellings). [IMG] (p2),,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15.html,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15,Sittingbourne flooding 15 Aug 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Sittingbourne,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Sittingbourne.pdf
GB-KEN,15,2020-08-15,51.3329943,0.7651554,"<div id=""html_fc4c18a09a96a8480f0fff7cb29ed004"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Bapchild</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding on The Street in Bapchild causing one property to be internally flooded and two properties to experience external flooding. [IMG,TAB] (p2)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property internally flooded; 2 properties externally flooded [IMG,TAB] (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,Bapchild,England,"Flooding on The Street in Bapchild causing one property to be internally flooded and two properties to experience external flooding. [IMG,TAB] (p2)","1 property internally flooded; 2 properties externally flooded [IMG,TAB] (p2)",GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15.html,GB-KEN_15_2020-08-15,Sittingbourne flooding 15 Aug 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Sittingbourne,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Sittingbourne.pdf
