The Palmersford roundabout was flooded as upstream water levels rose following surcharge of the downstream A31 culvert and backing up of the Uddens; floodwaters from the roundabout then entered the adjacent Gladelands site. [PAG] (p12)
The large culvert beneath the A31 Palmersford roundabout was identified as a critical drainage asset to manage flood risk; it was recommended that the culvert be cleared and desilted regularly to reduce blockages that contributed to the December 2013 flooding. (p15)
Roundabout and approaching carriageway were heavily flooded; water covered the full width of the road making the junction/roundabout impassable to vehicles and creating a transport hazard. [PAG] (p21)
Carriageway and roundabout area submerged by standing surface water making the road impassable; traffic management in place (road closed sign, cones) and police attendance. [IMG,PAG] (p22)",,GB-DOR_1_2013-12-24.html,GB-DOR_1_2013-12-24,Dorset flooding 24 Dec 2013,Gladelands Flood Study: Ferndown,037/Dorset/037/2020/Dorset/Dec 2013 Gladelands Flood Study.pdf
GB-DOR,1,2013-12-24,50.8153887,-1.8725018,"<div id=""html_915cb2a04f35f0709904c3b540a8609c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Priory Road, Ferndown</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater reached rear gardens of properties on Priory Road; peak flood levels in those gardens were estimated by correlation with Lidar/topography. (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>two properties; 13.0&ndash;14.0mAOD (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Dorset,"Priory Road, Ferndown",England,Floodwater reached rear gardens of properties on Priory Road; peak flood levels in those gardens were estimated by correlation with Lidar/topography. (p9),two properties; 13.0–14.0mAOD (p9),GB-DOR_1_2013-12-24.html,GB-DOR_1_2013-12-24,Dorset flooding 24 Dec 2013,Gladelands Flood Study: Ferndown,037/Dorset/037/2020/Dorset/Dec 2013 Gladelands Flood Study.pdf
GB-DOR,1,2013-12-24,50.74737687263831,-2.4192394577688887,"<div id=""html_04636edafa1fb8d4d12877de94bee65e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Dorset</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A flood event on 24 December 2013 in Ferndown (within Dorset) led to flooding of residential park homes on the Gladelands site. (p5)</p></div></div></body></div>",Dorset,Dorset,England,A flood event on 24 December 2013 in Ferndown (within Dorset) led to flooding of residential park homes on the Gladelands site. (p5),,GB-DOR_1_2013-12-24.html,GB-DOR_1_2013-12-24,Dorset flooding 24 Dec 2013,Gladelands Flood Study: Ferndown,037/Dorset/037/2020/Dorset/Dec 2013 Gladelands Flood Study.pdf
GB-DOR,1,2013-12-24,50.8022391,-1.8905903,"<div id=""html_09f0e9abd0b4be2e2452c12d3abd897b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ferndown</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The Gladelands site in Ferndown was affected by the 24 December 2013 flood, with residential park homes flooded. (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The Gladelands site in Ferndown experienced flooding when overland flows and elevated downstream water levels caused floodwater to enter and collect in low&ndash;lying areas, resulting in property flooding and evacuations. (p14)</p></div></div></body></div>",Dorset,Ferndown,England,"The Gladelands site in Ferndown was affected by the 24 December 2013 flood, with residential park homes flooded. (p5)
