Flooding at the junction with South Street (sewerage system surcharged) affected the pedestrian area and a number of shops and businesses. A collapsed drain cover was reported and surface water flowed towards Alfred Square. (p9)",2 commercial properties; ankle–deep floodwater [TAB] (p2),GB-KEN_13_2020-08-28.html,GB-KEN_13_2020-08-28,Deal flooding 28 Aug 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Deal,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Deal.pdf
