GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2331484,-1.433942,"<div id=""html_9e8f782a65c6e724021fe0807335d5f0"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Queen's Park</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The River Hipper enters the community at Queen's Park; a business at Queen's Park suffered internal flooding associated with the river flooding during Storm Babet. (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The River Hipper overflowed its banks at Queens Park and Ravenside Retail Park, inundating local businesses. Watermarks indicate internal flood depths of approximately 0.7 m at a Queens Park business and approximately 0.8 m at a business in Ravenside Retail Park; some buildings in Ravenside avoided internal flooding due to being at higher elevation. (p55)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 business (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>ten businesses; approx. 0.7 m internal depth at a Queens Park business; approx. 0.8 m internal depth at a Ravenside Retail Park business (p55)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,Queen's Park,England,"The River Hipper enters the community at Queen's Park; a business at Queen's Park suffered internal flooding associated with the river flooding during Storm Babet. (p51)
The River Hipper overflowed its banks at Queens Park and Ravenside Retail Park, inundating local businesses. Watermarks indicate internal flood depths of approximately 0.7 m at a Queens Park business and approximately 0.8 m at a business in Ravenside Retail Park; some buildings in Ravenside avoided internal flooding due to being at higher elevation. (p55)","1 business (p51)
