GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2294324,-1.4539544,"<div id=""html_fa2b96140b3c604840461d357e63b542"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Walton Road, Brampton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties near Walton Road suffered internal flooding associated with the storm event; all flooded properties are within 75 m of the River Hipper. (p19)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties near Walton Road were internally flooded during Storm Babet as part of the main group of 18 properties inundated close to the River Hipper; the area sits on the river floodplain and was inundated by river flows. [PAG,IMG] (p20)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residential properties on Walton Road suffered internal flooding during Storm Babet as high flows in the River Hipper overtopped or inundated adjacent areas. Properties affected are within c.75 m of the river and were part of the main group of 18 internally flooded properties in the community. [PAG,IMG] (p22)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The River Hipper exceeded its channel at multiple locations in the community. At Chapel Lane West the river breached its banks and flowed north up the street to ~92.7 mAOD, causing internal flooding (residents reported waist&ndash;high water at the south end of Chapel Lane West). Floodwater entered gardens and properties (including five homes on Walton Road) and properties at Grove Cottages. [IMG,PAG] (p23)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>18 properties flooded (collective for Chatsworth Road and Walton Road): 17 residential semi&ndash;detached; 1 commercial; 8 on the Hipper north bank; 10 on the Hipper south bank (p19)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>18 properties (group near Chatsworth Road and Walton Road were internally flooded) [PAG,IMG] (p20)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>18 properties (across Chatsworth Road, Walton Road, Chapel Lane West and Grove Cottages) [PAG,IMG] (p22)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>18 properties; 5 properties on Walton Road [IMG,PAG] (p23)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Walton Road, Brampton",England,"Properties near Walton Road suffered internal flooding associated with the storm event; all flooded properties are within 75 m of the River Hipper. (p19)
Properties near Walton Road were internally flooded during Storm Babet as part of the main group of 18 properties inundated close to the River Hipper; the area sits on the river floodplain and was inundated by river flows. [PAG,IMG] (p20)
