The River Hipper exceeded its channel at multiple locations in the community. At Chapel Lane West the river breached its banks and flowed north up the street to ~92.7 mAOD, causing internal flooding (residents reported waist–high water at the south end of Chapel Lane West). Floodwater entered gardens and properties (including five homes on Walton Road) and properties at Grove Cottages. [IMG,PAG] (p23)","18 properties flooded (collective for Chatsworth Road and Walton Road): 17 residential semi–detached; 1 commercial; 8 on the Hipper north bank; 10 on the Hipper south bank (p19)
