GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2311482,-1.4536732,"<div id=""html_a4bbaf3d5ed214df84aa10af19bfbe83"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Bobbin Mill Lane, Brampton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Areas around Bobbin Mill Lane are shown within or adjacent to the Storm Babet recorded flood outline and some homes on Bobbin Mill Lane are identified as having high long&ndash;term risk of surface water flooding; the recorded event indicates the lane/nearby properties were affected by flood inundation or high surface water during Storm Babet. [PAG,IMG] (p20)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Bobbin Mill Lane, Brampton",England,"Areas around Bobbin Mill Lane are shown within or adjacent to the Storm Babet recorded flood outline and some homes on Bobbin Mill Lane are identified as having high long–term risk of surface water flooding; the recorded event indicates the lane/nearby properties were affected by flood inundation or high surface water during Storm Babet. [PAG,IMG] (p20)",,GB-DBY_4_2023-10-19.html,GB-DBY_4_2023-10-19,Derbyshire flooding 19 Oct 2023 - 21 Oct 2023,Derbyshire County Council Section 19 Investigation Report – Storm Babet 18/10/23 – 21/10/23,034/Derbyshire County/034/2023/Derbyshire County/section-4-don-and-rother-catchment-final-storm-babet-dcc-section-19-report.pdf
GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2313915,-1.4564367,"<div id=""html_d5614ffa092bb2aaba6a56ec79fe5d4c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Chapel Lane West, Chesterfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties on Chapel Lane West experienced internal flooding associated with Storm Babet and elevated flows in the River Hipper; these properties formed part of the group of 18 internally flooded properties in the community. [PAG,IMG] (p22)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>At Chapel Lane West the River Hipper breached its banks and flowed northward up the street to about 92.7 mAOD. River water was the dominant flood source at Chapel Lane West, with additional contribution from surface water runoff from Chatsworth Road (either direct runoff or surcharging of the surface water network). [IMG,PAG] (p23)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>18 properties (across Chatsworth Road, Walton Road, Chapel Lane West and Grove Cottages) [PAG,IMG] (p22)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Part of the 18 properties flooded internally in the area were on Chapel Lane West [IMG,PAG] (p23)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Chapel Lane West, Chesterfield",England,"Properties on Chapel Lane West experienced internal flooding associated with Storm Babet and elevated flows in the River Hipper; these properties formed part of the group of 18 internally flooded properties in the community. [PAG,IMG] (p22)
