GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.23109277554166,-1.4538302796738358,"<div id=""html_b6cd9ffb7f65ba236a86e97b1d22820f"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Grove Cottages, Chesterfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Grove Cottages experienced internal flooding during Storm Babet linked to high River Hipper flows; they were part of the set of 18 properties internally flooded in the community. [PAG,IMG] (p22)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties at Grove Cottages flooded internally. The flow route is unconfirmed but is likely to have been via drainage holes in the riverside wall or from surface&ndash;water from the highway. [IMG,PAG] (p23)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>18 properties (across Chatsworth Road, Walton Road, Chapel Lane West and Grove Cottages) [PAG,IMG] (p22)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>part of 18 properties that flooded internally [IMG,PAG] (p23)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Grove Cottages, Chesterfield",England,"Grove Cottages experienced internal flooding during Storm Babet linked to high River Hipper flows; they were part of the set of 18 properties internally flooded in the community. [PAG,IMG] (p22)
Properties at Grove Cottages flooded internally. The flow route is unconfirmed but is likely to have been via drainage holes in the riverside wall or from surface–water from the highway. [IMG,PAG] (p23)","18 properties (across Chatsworth Road, Walton Road, Chapel Lane West and Grove Cottages) [PAG,IMG] (p22)
