Overtopping of the River Hipper inundated a low spot on Factory Street, flooding the road and the Lidl car park; a public house on Factory Street was internally flooded. The low spot at the entrance to Lidl (on Factory Street) experienced flood depths likely exceeding 0.5 m. [PAG,IMG] (p30)","1 non–residential property [TAB] (p28)
