GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.226432,-1.4238532,"<div id=""html_2b6bcfebb577e84fe277a82c5e9e2cba"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Sherwood Street, Chesterfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residential properties on/adjacent to Sherwood Street were within the recorded Storm Babet flood extent following overtopping/flooding from the River Rother; properties experienced internal flooding during the event. [IMG] (p33)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of residential properties on Sherwood Street. A commercial depot at the end of Sherwood Street flooded. Residents reported initial ingress via a manhole and then through air bricks and floors into properties. [PAG] (p36)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residents reported floodwater initially emerging at a manhole and then entering rear gardens by penetrating through the flood wall (reported infiltration) and entering properties via air bricks and subsequently through floors. (Post&ndash;event EA surveys did not detect infiltration.) (p37)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding occurred behind the embankment at Sherwood Street requiring pumping (pumping required on the Sunday morning during the event). (p38)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>103 properties (Chesterfield South community total) [IMG] (p33)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>part of 103 homes; 1 commercial depot [PAG] (p36)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Sherwood Street, Chesterfield",England,"Residential properties on/adjacent to Sherwood Street were within the recorded Storm Babet flood extent following overtopping/flooding from the River Rother; properties experienced internal flooding during the event. [IMG] (p33)
