Residents reported floodwater initially emerging at a manhole and then entering rear gardens by penetrating through the flood wall (reported infiltration) and entering properties via air bricks and subsequently through floors. (Post–event EA surveys did not detect infiltration.) (p37)
Flooding occurred behind the embankment at Sherwood Street requiring pumping (pumping required on the Sunday morning during the event). (p38)","103 properties (Chesterfield South community total) [IMG] (p33)
