GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2960072,-1.3243764,"<div id=""html_5efac6ac79571ff0c9c5953c31f793e8"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Smithy Brook Road, Renishaw</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Storm Babet caused inundation along Smithy Brook Road adjacent to Smithy Brook and its culverted sections; this area coincides with the main group of residential properties in Renishaw that experienced internal flooding. [IMG] (p38)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The area along Smithy Brook (which flows through the north of the village) and adjacent streets including Smithy Brook Road coincides with Flood Zone 3 and the Storm Babet recorded flood outline; flooding of properties adjacent to Smithy Brook occurred during the event. [PAG,IMG] (p39)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal property flooding during Storm Babet affecting properties on Smithy Brook Road; floodwaters from Smithy Brook / surface water entered properties, including businesses and residences. [IMG,PAG] (p40)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater traversed westwards along Smithy Brook Road after overtopping at the Smithy Brook culvert inlet; properties on the street included four businesses that experienced internal flooding. [TAB] (p41)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Pooling occurred east of the road after overtopping of Smithy Brook; flow then ran westwards downslope along Smithy Brook Road flooding four businesses and carrying floodwater toward the Main Road junction. [PAG] (p42)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>39 properties (village&ndash;wide internal flooding including area adjacent to Smithy Brook Road) [IMG] (p38)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>39 properties [PAG,IMG] (p39)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>4 businesses [IMG,PAG] (p40)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>4 businesses [TAB] (p41)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>four businesses [PAG] (p42)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Smithy Brook Road, Renishaw",England,"Storm Babet caused inundation along Smithy Brook Road adjacent to Smithy Brook and its culverted sections; this area coincides with the main group of residential properties in Renishaw that experienced internal flooding. [IMG] (p38)
