GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.29581,-1.3285086,"<div id=""html_3cd500a01fb8769c43ce6c2d7c874ede"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Main Road, Renishaw</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Recorded flood extents from Storm Babet and Flood Zone 3 overlap the area around Main Road. Emmett Carr Brook is culverted beneath Main Road where it joins Smithy Brook, and flood extents adjacent to Main Road contributed to internal flooding of nearby residential properties. [PAG,IMG] (p39)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding was recorded in the area during Storm Babet; the recorded flood outline is concentrated near Main Road and adjacent to local watercourses, placing nearby properties at risk. [IMG] (p40)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of residential properties on Main Road (A6135) during the Renishaw event driven by overtopping at culvert inlets and culvert blockages. [TAB,PAG] (p41)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater flowed onto the Main Road near the junction with Smithy Brook Road, then eastwards along the Main Road (A6135) flooding six homes. (p42)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>39 properties [PAG,IMG] (p39)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>7 homes [TAB,PAG] (p41)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>six homes (p42)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Main Road, Renishaw",England,"Recorded flood extents from Storm Babet and Flood Zone 3 overlap the area around Main Road. Emmett Carr Brook is culverted beneath Main Road where it joins Smithy Brook, and flood extents adjacent to Main Road contributed to internal flooding of nearby residential properties. [PAG,IMG] (p39)
