GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2402211,-1.4214265,"<div id=""html_f68ebe7d737491418fb65abaf7aff4b7"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Holbeck Close, Tapton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Area around Holbeck Close falls within the Storm Babet recorded flood outline following the River Rother; floodwaters affected the immediate built&ndash;up area and infrastructure adjacent to the river during the event. [PAG,IMG] (p45)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Area adjacent to Holbeck Close is shown as high surface&ndash;water flood risk and lies within the recorded Storm Babet flood outline, indicating it was affected by the flooding. [PAG,IMG] (p47)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Non&ndash;residential properties in the industrial area around Holbeck Close flooded as part of the localised impact from the River Rother. (p48)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Non&ndash;residential properties in the industrial area around Holbeck Close suffered internal flooding due to the River Rother overtopping and flow routes associated with the event. [PAG,IMG] (p49)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>17 non&ndash;residential properties (total shared with Brimington Road) (p48)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>part of 17 non&ndash;residential properties (combined total for Brimington Road and Holbeck Close) [PAG,IMG] (p49)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Holbeck Close, Tapton",England,"Area around Holbeck Close falls within the Storm Babet recorded flood outline following the River Rother; floodwaters affected the immediate built–up area and infrastructure adjacent to the river during the event. [PAG,IMG] (p45)
