GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2275061,-1.4066476,"<div id=""html_04606c4d8050a3a768674823cb6a49c9"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Spital Lane, Chesterfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of properties during Storm Babet as part of the wider central Chesterfield flooding. (p50)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding at the confluence of the River Rother and River Hipper: properties on Spital Lane experienced internal flooding. [PAG] (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties adjacent to Spital Brook/River Rother around Spital Lane experienced internal flooding and were included in the River Rother at Central Chesterfield flood warning issued on 20 Oct 2023. [PAG,IMG] (p53)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A small number of properties on Spital Lane were internally flooded during the event as rivers and overwhelmed drainage contributed to inundation. (p54)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties on Spital Lane were internally flooded when Spital Brook overflowed adjacent to the lane; the brook borders these properties before joining the River Rother. (p56)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Part of 49 homes and 30 businesses flooded in central Chesterfield (p50)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>three homes; four businesses [PAG] (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 homes; 4 non&ndash;residential properties (p56)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Spital Lane, Chesterfield",England,"Internal flooding of properties during Storm Babet as part of the wider central Chesterfield flooding. (p50)
