GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2249102,-1.4154206,"<div id=""html_e69834638f7e65c9f72ccc5faa19ab53"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Hasland Road, Chesterfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>River Rother passed beneath Hasland Road and caused internal flooding to properties at this location. [PAG] (p50)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties at Hasland Road suffered internal flooding when the River Rother passed beneath the road during Storm Babet. [PAG,IMG] (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties along Hasland Road adjacent to the River Rother experienced internal flooding and were included in the River Rother at Central Chesterfield flood warning on 20 Oct 2023. [PAG,IMG] (p53)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A small number of properties on Hasland Road were internally flooded as part of the wider community flooding driven by the rivers overtopping and overwhelmed drainage. (p54)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The River Rother overflowed its banks near Hasland Road causing internal flooding to properties either side of the river; flooding may have been influenced by nearby bridge capacity but the primary cause was the river overtopping. (p56)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 homes; 1 business [PAG] (p50)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 homes; 1 business [PAG,IMG] (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 commercial property; 4 residential properties (p56)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Hasland Road, Chesterfield",England,"River Rother passed beneath Hasland Road and caused internal flooding to properties at this location. [PAG] (p50)
