GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2327656,-1.4199831,"<div id=""html_828f02ef04ecfc4b3e7783100a1593ee"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Clayton Street, Chesterfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of properties during Storm Babet as part of the wider central Chesterfield flooding. (p50)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Clayton Street, located downstream of the Rother&ndash;Hipper confluence, experienced internal flooding to commercial premises. [PAG,IMG] (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties on or adjacent to Clayton Street, near the River Rother/Spital Brook, suffered internal flooding and were included in the River Rother at Central Chesterfield flood warning on 20 Oct 2023. [PAG,IMG] (p53)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overtopping of the River Hipper near Clayton Street Bridge caused floodwater to flow north down Clayton Street; subsequently the River Rother overflowed its left bank and internally flooded properties on the east side from the rear. Ten non&ndash;residential properties suffered internal flooding and flood depths exceeded approximately 1 m at parked vehicles. (p57)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Part of 49 homes and 30 businesses flooded in central Chesterfield (p50)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>ten businesses [PAG,IMG] (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>10 non&ndash;residential properties (p57)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Clayton Street, Chesterfield",England,"Internal flooding of properties during Storm Babet as part of the wider central Chesterfield flooding. (p50)
Clayton Street, located downstream of the Rother–Hipper confluence, experienced internal flooding to commercial premises. [PAG,IMG] (p51)
