GB-DBY,4,2023-10-19,53.2338201,-1.4200064,"<div id=""html_f64deaccf8727ae9211a4062cb125b72"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Hollis Lane, Chesterfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of properties in central Chesterfield that included Hollis Lane during Storm Babet, affecting residential and commercial premises. (p50)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Hollis Lane (together with nearby Hady Hill) experienced internal flooding of homes and businesses where the River Rother passes beneath the road. [PAG] (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties on Hollis Lane adjacent to the River Rother suffered internal flooding and were included in the River Rother at Central Chesterfield flood warning issued on 20 Oct 2023. [PAG,IMG] (p53)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A small number of properties on Hollis Lane were internally flooded during the event when rivers exceeded capacity and drainage was overwhelmed. (p54)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater from the River Rother accumulated at the low spot beneath the railway underpass on Hollis Lane, causing internal flooding of properties on the western side of the underpass; video evidence shows people evacuating on foot through floodwater and depths exceeded 1 m at this location. [PAG] (p57)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater from the River Rother accumulated at the low spot beneath the railway underpass on the western side, causing internal flooding to four homes and two businesses; footage shows people evacuating on foot through floodwater and depths exceeding 1 m at this location. [IMG,PAG] (p58)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>49 homes; 30 businesses (across central Chesterfield including Hollis Lane) (p50)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>four homes; five businesses (combined total for Hollis Lane and Hady Hill) [PAG] (p51)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>4 homes and 2 businesses [PAG] (p57)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>4 homes; 2 businesses [IMG,PAG] (p58)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Hollis Lane, Chesterfield",England,"Internal flooding of properties in central Chesterfield that included Hollis Lane during Storm Babet, affecting residential and commercial premises. (p50)
Hollis Lane (together with nearby Hady Hill) experienced internal flooding of homes and businesses where the River Rother passes beneath the road. [PAG] (p51)
