Floodwater from the River Rother accumulated at the low spot beneath the railway underpass on Hollis Lane, causing internal flooding of properties on the western side of the underpass; video evidence shows people evacuating on foot through floodwater and depths exceeded 1 m at this location. [PAG] (p57)
