GB-NNH,4,2016-03-09,52.3927151,-0.6951522,"<div id=""html_76c270eefd1cfb6ca479cad97ced32da"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ise Lodge</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties on the northern edge of the Ise Lodge estate (St Catherine's Road) experienced internal flooding; one property flooded internally. [MUL] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property [MUL] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Northamptonshire,Ise Lodge,England,Properties on the northern edge of the Ise Lodge estate (St Catherine's Road) experienced internal flooding; one property flooded internally. [MUL] (p9),1 property [MUL] (p9),GB-NNH_4_2016-03-09.html,GB-NNH_4_2016-03-09,Kettering flooding 09 Mar 2016,"Flood Investigation Report: St Catherine’s Road, Ise Lodge, Kettering, 9th March 2016",090/North Northamptonshire/22330/FIR/St-Catherines-Road/Kettering/Rev-03/161116.pdf
