GB-BKM,10,2014-01-01,51.5717637,-0.7767357,"<div id=""html_9eef7e8673eca544967af4b6586b9541"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>High Street, Marlow</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Basements on High Street flooded (reported as 'Basement floods, High Street'). [TAB] (p25)</p></div></div></body></div>",Buckinghamshire,"High Street, Marlow",England,"Basements on High Street flooded (reported as 'Basement floods, High Street'). [TAB] (p25)",,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01.html,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01,Marlow flooding January–February 2014,"Marlow, 9th January to 20th February 2014",018/Buckinghamshire County/018/2014/Buckinghamshire County/marlow-s19-report-2014/final.pdf
