Flooding in the St Peter Street area: two pumps were deployed by BFRS and sandbags were issued to the street as part of the response. [TAB,MUL] (p25)
Sandbags distributed to protect properties on St Peter's Street in response to flooding. [TAB,MUL] (p28)",,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01.html,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01,Marlow flooding January–February 2014,"Marlow, 9th January to 20th February 2014",018/Buckinghamshire County/018/2014/Buckinghamshire County/marlow-s19-report-2014/final.pdf
GB-BKM,10,2014-01-01,51.56914801521383,-0.7615815117206078,"<div id=""html_cdbf512db3bd0e30e875a16b5a632362"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Firview Close, Marlow</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Backing up of piped drains in the road and rising groundwater brought many properties close to flooding. Residents pumped water over an informal bund into the A404 drainage ditch to prevent the River Thames backing up the ditch and flooding properties; sewer problems were reported (residents did not report contaminated flood water). [PAG] (p21)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residents carried out pumping in Firview Close to manage floodwater. [TAB] (p24)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding at Firview Close with response actions: a pump was supplied to Firview Close and sandbags were delivered to the location. [TAB] (p25)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Sand bags were distributed to protect properties in response to flooding. [TAB,MUL] (p28)</p></div></div></body></div>",Buckinghamshire,"Firview Close, Marlow",England,"Backing up of piped drains in the road and rising groundwater brought many properties close to flooding. Residents pumped water over an informal bund into the A404 drainage ditch to prevent the River Thames backing up the ditch and flooding properties; sewer problems were reported (residents did not report contaminated flood water). [PAG] (p21)
Residents carried out pumping in Firview Close to manage floodwater. [TAB] (p24)
Flooding at Firview Close with response actions: a pump was supplied to Firview Close and sandbags were delivered to the location. [TAB] (p25)
Sand bags were distributed to protect properties in response to flooding. [TAB,MUL] (p28)",,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01.html,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01,Marlow flooding January–February 2014,"Marlow, 9th January to 20th February 2014",018/Buckinghamshire County/018/2014/Buckinghamshire County/marlow-s19-report-2014/final.pdf
