GB-BKM,10,2014-01-01,51.5744833,-0.7606853,"<div id=""html_aa77a668c9d9719b0ef2d1a62d63ddd4"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Savill Way, Marlow</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface&ndash;water flooding occurred because local piped drainage to the Newt Ditch was blocked, causing the area (Saville Way and The Acre) to flood from runoff that could not drain away. (p22)</p></div></div></body></div>",Buckinghamshire,"Savill Way, Marlow",England,"Surface–water flooding occurred because local piped drainage to the Newt Ditch was blocked, causing the area (Saville Way and The Acre) to flood from runoff that could not drain away. (p22)",,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01.html,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01,Marlow flooding January–February 2014,"Marlow, 9th January to 20th February 2014",018/Buckinghamshire County/018/2014/Buckinghamshire County/marlow-s19-report-2014/final.pdf
