GB-BKM,10,2014-01-01,51.7360131,-0.8324061,"<div id=""html_f5a4ca880aa7fce84c71569ef45143fb"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Mill Lane, Monks Risborough</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Mill Lane / Kingsmead received sandbags across January 2014 to protect properties from flooding; WDC distributed sandbags to the area as part of the response. [TAB,MUL] (p28)</p></div></div></body></div>",Buckinghamshire,"Mill Lane, Monks Risborough",England,"Mill Lane / Kingsmead received sandbags across January 2014 to protect properties from flooding; WDC distributed sandbags to the area as part of the response. [TAB,MUL] (p28)",,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01.html,GB-BKM_10_2014-01-01,Marlow flooding January–February 2014,"Marlow, 9th January to 20th February 2014",018/Buckinghamshire County/018/2014/Buckinghamshire County/marlow-s19-report-2014/final.pdf
