2 properties [PAG] (p65)",GB-BIR_1_2016-06-08_etc.html,GB-BIR_1_2016-06-08_etc,"Birmingham flooding 08 Jun 2016, Birmingham flooding 10 Jun 2016 and Birmingham flooding 16 Jun 2016","June 2016 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2016/Birmingham/S19/Flooding/Report///June/2016/R1.pdf
GB-BIR,1,2016-06-08,52.4796992,-1.9026911,"<div id=""html_a9a06a23dce00d51eeb0f22a157603a8"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Birmingham</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Storms on 8, 10 and 16 June 2016 caused widespread flooding to highways and properties in Birmingham, including internal property flooding, garden flooding and highway flooding; the city recorded hundreds of reported incidents and was the focus of 23 detailed area investigations. [PAG,MUL] (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Storms in June 2016 caused widespread flooding of highways and properties across Birmingham; the flooding prompted investigations by Birmingham City Council. [MUL] (p6)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Following the June 2016 storm events, 435 incidents of flooding were reported, including internal property flooding, external flooding to gardens and flooding to highways and other areas in the Birmingham area. [MUL] (p78)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>435 incidents of flooding reported; 23 areas identified with internal property flooding; over 700 flood survey responses [PAG,MUL] (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>435 incidents [MUL] (p78)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,Birmingham,England,"Storms on 8, 10 and 16 June 2016 caused widespread flooding to highways and properties in Birmingham, including internal property flooding, garden flooding and highway flooding; the city recorded hundreds of reported incidents and was the focus of 23 detailed area investigations. [PAG,MUL] (p5)
