GB-LIN,2,2014-08-08,53.567433,-0.1349932,"<div id=""html_32b433f87eca4f26dc218a6cf7261b07"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Mayfair Drive, Wybers Wood</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater entered from Timberley Drive at the rear of the properties and collected in the low spot on Mayfair Drive West, causing one property to flood internally and one externally. [PAG] (p10)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater entered properties: water collected in a low spot because Mayfair Drive is slightly lower than Timberley Drive and the main source of the water came through from Timberley Drive at the rear of the properties. [PAG] (p11)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property internally flooded; 1 property externally flooded [PAG] (p10)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property internally flooded; 1 property externally flooded [PAG] (p11)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lincolnshire,"Mayfair Drive, Wybers Wood",England,"Floodwater entered from Timberley Drive at the rear of the properties and collected in the low spot on Mayfair Drive West, causing one property to flood internally and one externally. [PAG] (p10)
