flood depths exceeding 2 m in the lowest spot on Meadow Road [PAG,IMG] (p32)",GB-DER_1_2019-11-08.html,GB-DER_1_2019-11-08,Derby flooding 08 Nov 2019 - 09 Nov 2019,Investigation Report into November 2019 Derwent Floods in Derby City,033/Derby/033/2014/Derby/2022-09-15-derby-section-19-report-p03.pdf
GB-DER,1,2019-11-08,52.9243555,-1.4695741,"<div id=""html_db684cd509e0a48eb3f09c3f9b44c78d"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Darwin Place, Little Chester</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Seepage through the flood wall caused flooding in Darwin Place. [PAG] (p31)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Seepage through the River Derwent flood wall caused inundation of Darwin Place. [PAG,IMG] (p32)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Recorded flood outlines from November 2019 extend south along Darwin Place; the area overlaps with zones identified as at risk from surface water flooding. [PAG,IMG] (p37)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>flood depths of up to 50 mm [PAG] (p31)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>flood depths of up to 50 mm [PAG,IMG] (p32)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derby,"Darwin Place, Little Chester",England,"Seepage through the flood wall caused flooding in Darwin Place. [PAG] (p31)
