GB-CRY,3,2015-08-01,51.3222379,-0.0920336,"<div id=""html_9828637ac552bb8066fdc1249ca6af75"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Godstone Road, Kenley</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding affected the road approaches to Purley Cross, including the A22 Godstone Road, with drainage capacity exceeded, overland flow onto the road and resulting travel disruption during the heavy rainfall event. (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Croydon,"Godstone Road, Kenley",England,"Surface water flooding affected the road approaches to Purley Cross, including the A22 Godstone Road, with drainage capacity exceeded, overland flow onto the road and resulting travel disruption during the heavy rainfall event. (p13)",,GB-CRY_3_2015-08-01.html,GB-CRY_3_2015-08-01,Croydon flooding August 2015,Croydon Flood Investigation Report – 24th August 2015,030/Croydon/030/2015/Croydon/flood-investigation-august15.pdf
GB-CRY,3,2015-08-01,51.3383723,-0.1028496,"<div id=""html_483f1780218ed5c1534af14c3a599f76"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Brancaster Lane, Croydon</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residential flooding reported at addresses on Brancaster Lane during the August 2015 event: 1 Brancaster Lane (residential flooding, unconfirmed, fire service attended) and 46 Brancaster Lane (external residential flooding with garage flooded). [TAB] (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Croydon,"Brancaster Lane, Croydon",England,"Residential flooding reported at addresses on Brancaster Lane during the August 2015 event: 1 Brancaster Lane (residential flooding, unconfirmed, fire service attended) and 46 Brancaster Lane (external residential flooding with garage flooded). [TAB] (p12)",,GB-CRY_3_2015-08-01.html,GB-CRY_3_2015-08-01,Croydon flooding August 2015,Croydon Flood Investigation Report – 24th August 2015,030/Croydon/030/2015/Croydon/flood-investigation-august15.pdf
