GB-CAM,20,2020-12-23,52.4519435,-0.1140352,"<div id=""html_3761bc1d0e2d465ec99bcf47668ce73f"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Field Road, Ramsey</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties experienced internal flooding; gardens and outbuildings were flooded. [TAB] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal property flooding reported; external flooding affecting gardens and outbuildings. [TAB,PAG] (p12)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of properties on Field Road as part of the Slade Dyke surface water flooding incident. [PAG,IMG] (p13)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties experienced internal flooding (reported depths up to c.30cm) and gardens/outbuildings flooded (up to c.90cm). Some residents were displaced. [TAB,PAG] (p14)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties experienced internal flooding and overland flow from the adjacent culverted watercourse; gardens and outbuildings inundated; some residents were displaced and the Fire Service attended to protect properties by pumping. [PAG,IMG] (p15)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The culverted section between Field Road and High Lode has limited capacity; high water levels in High Lode reduce discharge efficiency and, together with vegetation, debris and siltation, contribute to drainage problems and local flooding risk. (p21)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties [TAB] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>c.19 properties [TAB,PAG] (p12)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>c.19 properties [PAG,IMG] (p13)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Two residents reported having to leave premises for longer than 1 month [TAB,PAG] (p14)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Two residents reported having to leave premises for longer than 1 month. [PAG,IMG] (p15)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Field Road, Ramsey",England,"Properties experienced internal flooding; gardens and outbuildings were flooded. [TAB] (p11)
