GB-CAM,20,2020-12-23,52.4464457,-0.1098827,"<div id=""html_d8bd4c5fd5fada2dc4aced2f7f43194a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Wyatt Close, Ramsey</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>External flooding of gardens reported on Wyatt Close. [TAB] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties at Wyatt Close (outside Flood Zone 3) were affected by surface water flooding with flooding to gardens reported; basement flooding in this location was also reported as a result of high groundwater levels. [PAG] (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of (odd&ndash;numbered) properties up to c.30cm and flooding of gardens and outbuildings up to c.60cm; residents displaced (three reported up to 1 month; one reported longer than 1 month). [TAB] (p18)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>0 properties with internal flooding [TAB] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>up to c.30cm internal (odd&ndash;numbered properties); up to c.60cm gardens/outbuildings; Three residents displaced for up to 1 month; 1 resident displaced for longer than 1 month. [TAB] (p18)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Wyatt Close, Ramsey",England,"External flooding of gardens reported on Wyatt Close. [TAB] (p11)
