1,938 internal residential properties; 566 external residential properties; 296 internal commercial properties; 55 external commercial properties; 2,855 properties total affected in Leeds City Centre; internal flood depths 1 m to in excess of 2 m; direct economic impact £60.3 million; ~27,000 office workers trapped [TAB,PAG] (p33)
