20 EHV/HV incidents recorded at the Kirkstall site; 219 'at risk' substation inspections (Calder Valley and Leeds combined); 18 substations required replacement; 14 required maintenance; 49 required cleaning; 3,285 properties inspected in the West Yorkshire service recovery programme; 284 service termination cut–outs replaced; 190 services renewed; 53 properties disconnected on safety grounds (later reconnected) (p227)
1 RTU communication failure at Kirkstall due to flood water damage (evening 26 Dec 2015); 1,540 calls abandoned between 20:00 and 23:45 on 26 Dec 2015 when power cuts began affecting customers [IMG] (p232)
