ane community was affected by floods (November and December 2015); residents have worked to improve and implement flood defences and to establish a Flood Day Action Plan, liaising with LCC and the Environment Agency. [MUL] (p290)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>54 internal residential; 14 external residential; 5 internal commercial; 1 external commercial; 74 properties total (Otley aggregate across listed streets) (p107)</p></div></div></body></div>",Leeds,"Farnley Lane, Newall",England,"Farnley Lane was inundated by River Wharfe flooding during the Nov/Dec 2015 events; photographs show street–level flooding affecting roads and nearby properties in the Farnley Lane area. (p20)
