GB-NNH,12,2012-07-14,52.2745249,-0.7103945,"<div id=""html_9c83dbe105a1f93acee7c0ca1be9cc8b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Great Doddington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The A45 eastbound from Great Doddington (as the western endpoint) experienced surface water flowing over and accumulating on the carriageway as a result of intense rainfall, drainage inundation and a blockage. (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The stretch of the A45 eastbound between the village and the Wilby Way roundabout was affected by flooding &mdash; carriageway inundated by runoff and an inundated/blocked drainage network leading to closures and traffic disruption. [IMG] (p6)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Northamptonshire,Great Doddington,England,"The A45 eastbound from Great Doddington (as the western endpoint) experienced surface water flowing over and accumulating on the carriageway as a result of intense rainfall, drainage inundation and a blockage. (p4)
