GB-NNH,12,2012-07-14,52.263397,-0.7455269,"<div id=""html_fb2b69ac746793d6ec0d7f6632ba5701"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Earls Barton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Police closed the eastbound slip road and carriageway at Earls Barton and diversion routes were put in place due to flooding of the A45; closures contributed to traffic disruption. [IMG] (p6)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Northamptonshire,Earls Barton,England,Police closed the eastbound slip road and carriageway at Earls Barton and diversion routes were put in place due to flooding of the A45; closures contributed to traffic disruption. [IMG] (p6),,GB-NNH_12_2012-07-14.html,GB-NNH_12_2012-07-14,Northamptonshire flooding 14 Jul 2012,Flood Investigation Report: Flooding on the A45 Eastbound between Great Doddington and Wilby Way 14th July 2012,090/North Northamptonshire/A45-Flood-Investigaton-Report.pdf
