GB-NYK,4,2015-12-01,53.9825271,-1.3852499932684972,"<div id=""html_fbe715dfdde9a131da7846df6f35943a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Yorkshire</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Widespread and substantial late&ndash;December 2015 rainfall across West and North Yorkshire contributed to flooding in multiple communities during the 23&ndash;26 December event. [TAB] (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Yorkshire,Yorkshire,England,Widespread and substantial late–December 2015 rainfall across West and North Yorkshire contributed to flooding in multiple communities during the 23–26 December event. [TAB] (p8),,GB-NYK_4_2015-12-01.html,GB-NYK_4_2015-12-01,North Yorkshire flooding December 2015 - January 2016,Section 19 Reports on the December 2015 Flooding Events in North Yorkshire,089/North Yorkshire County/Section 19 Reports on the December 2015 Flooding Events in North Yo.pdf
GB-NYK,4,2015-12-01,54.377023,-1.6319342,"<div id=""html_32ddd95e8abcd0eeeb2bd43e4b30bdb3"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Catterick</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Closure of the A1 in the Catterick area as a consequence of the December 2015&ndash;January 2016 flooding events. (p1)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Yorkshire,Catterick,England,Closure of the A1 in the Catterick area as a consequence of the December 2015–January 2016 flooding events. (p1),,GB-NYK_4_2015-12-01.html,GB-NYK_4_2015-12-01,North Yorkshire flooding December 2015 - January 2016,Section 19 Reports on the December 2015 Flooding Events in North Yorkshire,089/North Yorkshire County/Section 19 Reports on the December 2015 Flooding Events in North Yo.pdf
