at least seven residential properties (p57)",GB-BKM_22_2020-12-23.html,GB-BKM_22_2020-12-23,Thornton flooding 23 Dec 2020,Thornton Section 19 Flood Investigation: Final Technical Report,018/Buckinghamshire County/018/2020/Buckinghamshire County/Thornton/Section/19/Flood/Investigation.pdf
GB-BKM,22,2020-12-23,52.0336802,-0.9402602,"<div id=""html_d6bc3d81b719e4b8b9761edb79435031"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Leckhampstead</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Impacted by flooding during the December 2020 event (affected by the same event nearby Thornton). (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Buckinghamshire,Leckhampstead,England,Impacted by flooding during the December 2020 event (affected by the same event nearby Thornton). (p12),,GB-BKM_22_2020-12-23.html,GB-BKM_22_2020-12-23,Thornton flooding 23 Dec 2020,Thornton Section 19 Flood Investigation: Final Technical Report,018/Buckinghamshire County/018/2020/Buckinghamshire County/Thornton/Section/19/Flood/Investigation.pdf
GB-BKM,22,2020-12-23,51.9955872,-0.9136531,"<div id=""html_89c865c41e97f3db483dd21f08d9dc1c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Thornborough</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Impacted by flooding during the December 2020 event (affected by the same event nearby Thornton). (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Buckinghamshire,Thornborough,England,Impacted by flooding during the December 2020 event (affected by the same event nearby Thornton). (p12),,GB-BKM_22_2020-12-23.html,GB-BKM_22_2020-12-23,Thornton flooding 23 Dec 2020,Thornton Section 19 Flood Investigation: Final Technical Report,018/Buckinghamshire County/018/2020/Buckinghamshire County/Thornton/Section/19/Flood/Investigation.pdf
GB-LAN,18,2022-01-01,53.7384481,-2.6690787,"<div id=""html_0f7fa7459f46f3c354da4daa9b440199"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Chorley Road, Walton-Le-Dale</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Chorley Road in Bamber Bridge was affected by flooding during the January 2022 event referenced in the document. (p1)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A number of homes on Chorley Road suffered internal flooding when a culverted local watercourse, which had been accidentally obstructed during nearby demolition works, backed up and overflowed into the public highway. Floodwater in the highway rose above property thresholds. The damaged and obstructed lengths of the culvert were later replaced, which remedied the problem. (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Damage to a culverted watercourse during demolition/site clearance caused a significant blockage that prevented normal flow and local highway drainage. Under heavy rainfall the public highway flooded, water breached thresholds of nearby homes and caused extensive flood damage to ground floors. Emergency out&ndash;of&ndash;hours response was required from the police and the local highway authority. The culvert was repaired and there have been no further instances of flooding since repairs were completed by the end of February 2022. (p6)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,"Chorley Road, Walton-Le-Dale",England,"Chorley Road in Bamber Bridge was affected by flooding during the January 2022 event referenced in the document. (p1)
A number of homes on Chorley Road suffered internal flooding when a culverted local watercourse, which had been accidentally obstructed during nearby demolition works, backed up and overflowed into the public highway. Floodwater in the highway rose above property thresholds. The damaged and obstructed lengths of the culvert were later replaced, which remedied the problem. (p3)
Damage to a culverted watercourse during demolition/site clearance caused a significant blockage that prevented normal flow and local highway drainage. Under heavy rainfall the public highway flooded, water breached thresholds of nearby homes and caused extensive flood damage to ground floors. Emergency out–of–hours response was required from the police and the local highway authority. The culvert was repaired and there have been no further instances of flooding since repairs were completed by the end of February 2022. (p6)",,GB-LAN_18_2022-01-01.html,GB-LAN_18_2022-01-01,Bamber Bridge flooding 01 Jan 2022 - 31 Jan 2022,"January 2022 Flooding In Lancashire: Chorley Road, Bamber Bridge, South Ribble",069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-chorley-road-bamber-bridge-january-2022.pdf
GB-LAN,18,2022-01-01,53.86117,-2.5650887,"<div id=""html_aa22ba14e0df031242ee608a596c2101"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Lancashire</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Lancashire experienced flooding during the January 2022 event discussed in the report. (p1)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Very localised flooding of houses caused by obstruction of the culvert carrying the local watercourse; local drainage system was overwhelmed where culvert had been damaged by unconsented works. [PAG] (p4)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Lancashire,England,"Lancashire experienced flooding during the January 2022 event discussed in the report. (p1)
