GB-LAN,18,2022-01-01,53.7271527,-2.7330066,"<div id=""html_7c54c776b7e544bb16b03788299a357e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>South Ribble</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The South Ribble district experienced flooding during the January 2022 event; the report headings identify Bamber Bridge and Chorley Road within this district as affected locations. (p1)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,South Ribble,England,The South Ribble district experienced flooding during the January 2022 event; the report headings identify Bamber Bridge and Chorley Road within this district as affected locations. (p1),,GB-LAN_18_2022-01-01.html,GB-LAN_18_2022-01-01,Bamber Bridge flooding 01 Jan 2022 - 31 Jan 2022,"January 2022 Flooding In Lancashire: Chorley Road, Bamber Bridge, South Ribble",069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-chorley-road-bamber-bridge-january-2022.pdf
GB-LAN,18,2022-01-01,53.72766879250155,-2.65937809527457,"<div id=""html_a96c37fc43389d5201c59fe3ffc73e46"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Bamber Bridge</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Bamber Bridge experienced flooding during the January 2022 event; Chorley Road in Bamber Bridge is specifically noted in the report headings. (p1)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Heavy rainfall overnight into 1 January 2022 and again on 8 January 2022 led to localised flooding in Bamber Bridge. Flooding of homes on Chorley Road occurred when a culverted watercourse backing up (due to an obstruction from demolition works) overflowed into the highway. (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Sections of public highway (notably Chorley Road) in Bamber Bridge flooded after a culvert was blocked. Floodwater breached thresholds of nearby homes, causing extensive ground&ndash;floor damage and necessitating emergency out&ndash;of&ndash;hours response by the police and local highway authority. The responsible parties repaired the culvert and no repeat flooding occurred after repairs (completed by end of February 2022). (p6)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Bamber Bridge,England,"Bamber Bridge experienced flooding during the January 2022 event; Chorley Road in Bamber Bridge is specifically noted in the report headings. (p1)
Heavy rainfall overnight into 1 January 2022 and again on 8 January 2022 led to localised flooding in Bamber Bridge. Flooding of homes on Chorley Road occurred when a culverted watercourse backing up (due to an obstruction from demolition works) overflowed into the highway. (p3)
Sections of public highway (notably Chorley Road) in Bamber Bridge flooded after a culvert was blocked. Floodwater breached thresholds of nearby homes, causing extensive ground–floor damage and necessitating emergency out–of–hours response by the police and local highway authority. The responsible parties repaired the culvert and no repeat flooding occurred after repairs (completed by end of February 2022). (p6)",,GB-LAN_18_2022-01-01.html,GB-LAN_18_2022-01-01,Bamber Bridge flooding 01 Jan 2022 - 31 Jan 2022,"January 2022 Flooding In Lancashire: Chorley Road, Bamber Bridge, South Ribble",069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-chorley-road-bamber-bridge-january-2022.pdf
GB-LAN,18,2022-01-01,53.74784,-2.6720357,"<div id=""html_8db64963982856497d8ab2abaf852405"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Walton-Le-Dale</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Heavy rainfall overnight into 1 January 2022 and again on 8 January 2022 contributed to localised flooding in the Walton&ndash;le&ndash;Dale area; the obstruction of a culverted local watercourse caused backing up and overflow into the highway, resulting in internal flooding of nearby homes (notably on Chorley Road). (p3)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Walton-Le-Dale,England,"Heavy rainfall overnight into 1 January 2022 and again on 8 January 2022 contributed to localised flooding in the Walton–le–Dale area; the obstruction of a culverted local watercourse caused backing up and overflow into the highway, resulting in internal flooding of nearby homes (notably on Chorley Road). (p3)",,GB-LAN_18_2022-01-01.html,GB-LAN_18_2022-01-01,Bamber Bridge flooding 01 Jan 2022 - 31 Jan 2022,"January 2022 Flooding In Lancashire: Chorley Road, Bamber Bridge, South Ribble",069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-chorley-road-bamber-bridge-january-2022.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.6231194,-0.8644808,"<div id=""html_a9c8c09f8c7db13b5b7875f9659640a4"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Crowle Moors</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Area&ndash;wide flooding that affected properties in the Crowle/Crowle Moors area &mdash; combination of excess foul/sewer flows and blocked riparian drainage that prevented water leaving the area, contributing to property flooding. (p11)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>five properties (p11)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,Crowle Moors,England,"Area–wide flooding that affected properties in the Crowle/Crowle Moors area — combination of excess foul/sewer flows and blocked riparian drainage that prevented water leaving the area, contributing to property flooding. (p11)",five properties (p11),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.6998568,-0.6348752,"<div id=""html_4d8af114cf3c14e03d06f42a05fee6f6"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Whitton Road, North Lincolnshire</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A property on Whitton Road experienced basement groundwater intrusion, resulting in internal flooding. (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>one property (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Whitton Road, North Lincolnshire",England,"A property on Whitton Road experienced basement groundwater intrusion, resulting in internal flooding. (p9)",one property (p9),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
