GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.6686133,-0.4434379,"<div id=""html_dc63c6b6c67f6c9ed2bf665116cb32e2"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Brigg Road, Barrow-Upon-Humber</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overland flow flooded a property adjacent to Brigg Road; a small volume of highway runoff from the adjacent Saxby Road may have influenced the event. LLFA identified riparian ownership/drainage issues related to the incident. [PAG,MUL] (p9)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A property adjacent to Brigg Road was flooded during the November 2019 event; the LLFA carried out a wet&ndash;weather inspection which confirmed the highway did not discharge water into the lane where the property is located. (p10)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property [PAG,MUL] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Brigg Road, Barrow-Upon-Humber",England,"Overland flow flooded a property adjacent to Brigg Road; a small volume of highway runoff from the adjacent Saxby Road may have influenced the event. LLFA identified riparian ownership/drainage issues related to the incident. [PAG,MUL] (p9)
