GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.63843,-0.7312061,"<div id=""html_05d9ab86cda89d95f0637479cf16d801"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Meredyke Road, Luddington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Two properties on Meredyke Road were flooded; causes suspected to be STW pump failure and overland flow from adjacent field. STW investigation found the surface water pumping station can be overwhelmed during storm conditions; LLFA liaised with STW and historical cleansing/investigations have been carried out previously. (p15)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 properties (p15)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Meredyke Road, Luddington",England,Two properties on Meredyke Road were flooded; causes suspected to be STW pump failure and overland flow from adjacent field. STW investigation found the surface water pumping station can be overwhelmed during storm conditions; LLFA liaised with STW and historical cleansing/investigations have been carried out previously. (p15),2 properties (p15),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.6943805,-0.3797577,"<div id=""html_a2e6dfd761b4f56b9e810a34dfcb96c5"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Marsh Lane, Barrow-Upon-Humber</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Two properties on Marsh Lane experienced internal flooding when the foul sewer/manhole to the rear became full and overflowed due to inundation of AWA's foul sewer by excess rainfall. (p16)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 properties (p16)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Marsh Lane, Barrow-Upon-Humber",England,Two properties on Marsh Lane experienced internal flooding when the foul sewer/manhole to the rear became full and overflowed due to inundation of AWA's foul sewer by excess rainfall. (p16),2 properties (p16),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
