GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.677541,-0.3743857,"<div id=""html_0f879f19ba45c2e74a481fb3aa90db0a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Beck Lane, Barrow-Upon-Humber</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Three properties on Beck Lane were flooded on 7 November 2019 when the River Beck overflowed after excessive rainfall; debris collecting on the trash screen at the B1206 culvert exacerbated the event. LLFA carried out modelling and investigated mitigation measures. (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Beck Lane, Barrow-Upon-Humber",England,Three properties on Beck Lane were flooded on 7 November 2019 when the River Beck overflowed after excessive rainfall; debris collecting on the trash screen at the B1206 culvert exacerbated the event. LLFA carried out modelling and investigated mitigation measures. (p17),3 properties (p17),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.4879302,-0.5333173,"<div id=""html_0abfe0f574e71c89208d04b278625f27"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>School Lane, Redbourne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>One property on School Lane flooded on 7 November 2019 as a result of the River Beck overflowing following excessive rainfall; event was exacerbated by debris at the B1206 culvert and prompted LLFA investigations and remedial works to a cracked culvert. (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"School Lane, Redbourne",England,One property on School Lane flooded on 7 November 2019 as a result of the River Beck overflowing following excessive rainfall; event was exacerbated by debris at the B1206 culvert and prompted LLFA investigations and remedial works to a cracked culvert. (p17),1 property (p17),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.4887641,-0.5303224,"<div id=""html_f8efacb1174161a2362ce7797ae2377e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Park Lane, Redbourne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>One property on Park Lane flooded on 7 November 2019 when the River Beck overflowed after heavy rainfall; LLFA identified contributing factors (debris at culvert) and undertook investigations and planned minor remedial works to local culverts. (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Park Lane, Redbourne",England,One property on Park Lane flooded on 7 November 2019 when the River Beck overflowed after heavy rainfall; LLFA identified contributing factors (debris at culvert) and undertook investigations and planned minor remedial works to local culverts. (p17),1 property (p17),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.4865056,-0.5365418,"<div id=""html_97de1e82378a5f1b20b99bfa6a798d98"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>High Street, Redbourne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Jet and CCTV investigation of the culvert under High Street (carried out following flooding in Redbourne) identified a crack in the northern culvert. Minor remedial works were planned to fix the crack. (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"High Street, Redbourne",England,Jet and CCTV investigation of the culvert under High Street (carried out following flooding in Redbourne) identified a crack in the northern culvert. Minor remedial works were planned to fix the crack. (p17),,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.5836065,-0.6600282,"<div id=""html_1d2237c14257fbcd743ef78af701dc22"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Brumby Hall Gardens, Scunthorpe</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Basement flooding experienced at a property on Brumby Hall Gardens caused by elevated groundwater levels; residents were advised to liaise with their insurers. (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties at Brumby Hall Gardens were affected by a local flooding incident; the LLFA advised residents to liaise with their insurers (private issue) and will continue to liaise with the water company (STW) to address the issue. (p18)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Brumby Hall Gardens, Scunthorpe",England,"Basement flooding experienced at a property on Brumby Hall Gardens caused by elevated groundwater levels; residents were advised to liaise with their insurers. (p17)
