GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.5734327,-0.6819033,"<div id=""html_440e2835bf2351cc01913f2217982a00"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Rochester Close, Scunthorpe</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding at a property on Rochester Close occurred because STW's surface water system became overwhelmed; LLFA liaised with STW and further investigations were to be completed by STW. (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Rochester Close, Scunthorpe",England,Flooding at a property on Rochester Close occurred because STW's surface water system became overwhelmed; LLFA liaised with STW and further investigations were to be completed by STW. (p17),1 property (p17),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.6769411,-0.5063963,"<div id=""html_66a9189733fc87c7548dd3eb0dbca305"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Farrishes Lane, South Ferriby</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding on Farrishes Lane flooded one property on 14 Nov 2019 due to excess surface water run&ndash;off from a blocked highway gully. The LLFA carried out jetting and CCTV, repaired a nearby surface water pipe, installed an additional gully and ACO drainage, and gas repairs were completed for a service found in a surface water sewer upstream. (p18)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p18)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Farrishes Lane, South Ferriby",England,"Flooding on Farrishes Lane flooded one property on 14 Nov 2019 due to excess surface water run–off from a blocked highway gully. The LLFA carried out jetting and CCTV, repaired a nearby surface water pipe, installed an additional gully and ACO drainage, and gas repairs were completed for a service found in a surface water sewer upstream. (p18)",1 property (p18),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.6265461,-0.2544181,"<div id=""html_9d7182315dbde63d8037ed73d8bd4143"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Town Street, South Killingholme</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Two properties on Town Street suffered internal flooding on 7 Nov 2019 attributed to a problem with the foul (AWA) sewer system exacerbated by surface run&ndash;off from impermeable car parks. Anglian Water investigated and private pipework faults were identified and resolved by residents. The two affected properties were added to the Flood Risk Register in April 2020 due to hydraulic incapacity. (p18)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 properties (p18)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Town Street, South Killingholme",England,Two properties on Town Street suffered internal flooding on 7 Nov 2019 attributed to a problem with the foul (AWA) sewer system exacerbated by surface run–off from impermeable car parks. Anglian Water investigated and private pipework faults were identified and resolved by residents. The two affected properties were added to the Flood Risk Register in April 2020 due to hydraulic incapacity. (p18),2 properties (p18),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.6192277,-0.3038393,"<div id=""html_b5d845894e893953bb6e616990bf88ef"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Carr Road, Ulceby</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding affected one property on Carr Road in Ulceby. The exact source is unknown; LLFA suggest overland flow from the rear of the property may have caused the flood and investigations are ongoing. (p19)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>one property (p19)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Carr Road, Ulceby",England,Flooding affected one property on Carr Road in Ulceby. The exact source is unknown; LLFA suggest overland flow from the rear of the property may have caused the flood and investigations are ongoing. (p19),one property (p19),GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01.html,GB-NLN_1_2019-11-01,North Lincolnshire flooding 01 Nov 2019 - 30 Nov 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Events of November 2019,086/North Lincolnshire/NLC-Section-19-Nov/2019-Floods-a.pdf
