GB-NLN,1,2019-11-01,53.676946512735896,-0.6285226577481675,"<div id=""html_224cc7b95d4f695b099f85e44ab2346c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Manor Court, West Halton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>One property on Manor Court flooded due to elevated groundwater levels combined with surface water run&ndash;off from higher ground. [PAG] (p19)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A property on Manor Court flooded due to elevated groundwater levels and surface water run&ndash;off from higher ground. (p20)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property [PAG] (p19)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p20)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Lincolnshire,"Manor Court, West Halton",England,"One property on Manor Court flooded due to elevated groundwater levels combined with surface water run–off from higher ground. [PAG] (p19)
