3 properties (29 Jul 2019); 10 properties (30–31 Jul 2019); 10 properties (1 Aug 2019) [PAG] (p15)",GB-LAN_22_2019-07-27.html,GB-LAN_22_2019-07-27,Lancashire flooding 27 Jul 2019 - 01 Aug 2019,27 July – 1 August 2019 Flooding In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation Report,069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-july-august-2019-flooding.pdf
GB-LAN,22,2019-07-27,53.793356,-2.894251,"<div id=""html_891d275a764cb41d4ed1b9c39f3a52d6"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Fylde</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties were flooded by heavy rainfall causing surface&ndash;water/urban flooding in western Fylde during the late July 2019 event. (p13)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (27 Jul 2019); part of 4 properties (across Fylde, Chorley and Preston) on 28 Jul 2019 (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Fylde,England,Properties were flooded by heavy rainfall causing surface–water/urban flooding in western Fylde during the late July 2019 event. (p13),"1 property (27 Jul 2019); part of 4 properties (across Fylde, Chorley and Preston) on 28 Jul 2019 (p13)",GB-LAN_22_2019-07-27.html,GB-LAN_22_2019-07-27,Lancashire flooding 27 Jul 2019 - 01 Aug 2019,27 July – 1 August 2019 Flooding In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation Report,069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-july-august-2019-flooding.pdf
