GB-LAN,22,2019-07-27,53.8790402,-2.1717795,"<div id=""html_69e9c99bf482b1d303c5b29f61a31ce1"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Pendle</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>One property in Pendle district flooded due to the heavy rain band affecting Lancashire during the late July 2019 event. (p13)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (28 Jul 2019) (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Pendle,England,One property in Pendle district flooded due to the heavy rain band affecting Lancashire during the late July 2019 event. (p13),1 property (28 Jul 2019) (p13),GB-LAN_22_2019-07-27.html,GB-LAN_22_2019-07-27,Lancashire flooding 27 Jul 2019 - 01 Aug 2019,27 July – 1 August 2019 Flooding In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation Report,069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-july-august-2019-flooding.pdf
