GB-DBY,7,2023-10-18,52.8971871,-1.330101,"<div id=""html_33ce7c648310c171f76fba66ce919d0e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Hind Avenue, Breaston</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties on/adjacent to Hind Avenue experienced internal flooding from nearby Golden Stream and a drainage ditch during Storm Babet, consistent with flooding of the west Breaston neighbourhood on the Golden Stream/Golden Brook floodplain. [PAG,IMG] (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of residential properties on Hind Avenue during the Storm Babet event, associated with high river levels and local surface water/urban flooding. [PAG,IMG] (p6)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater backed up from an obstructed box culvert and overgrown drainage ditch flowed from Gregory Avenue into Hind Avenue, inundating front gardens and properties; passing traffic pushed floodwater into properties. [IMG,PAG] (p7)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>49 residential properties and 2 non&ndash;residential properties suffered internal flooding in west Breaston (community&ndash;wide total) [PAG,IMG] (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>4 residential properties [PAG,IMG] (p6)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>4 properties [IMG,PAG] (p7)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Hind Avenue, Breaston",England,"Properties on/adjacent to Hind Avenue experienced internal flooding from nearby Golden Stream and a drainage ditch during Storm Babet, consistent with flooding of the west Breaston neighbourhood on the Golden Stream/Golden Brook floodplain. [PAG,IMG] (p4)
