 quant""><p>23 properties [PAG] (p12)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Part of 129 properties in Sandiacre that suffered internal flooding (p14)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Wentworth Street, Ilkeston",England,"Properties on or near Wentworth Street were impacted by internal flooding during Storm Babet, associated with nearby River Erewash inundation. (p8)
