A Flood Warning was issued for the Lower Stour at Iford Bridge Home Park on 09/07/2012, indicating potential river flooding at the home park. [TAB] (p16)",80 properties (p2),GB-DOR_4_2012-07-06.html,GB-DOR_4_2012-07-06,Dorset flooding 06 Jul 2012 - 13 Jul 2012,Dorset County Council July 2012 Flood Investigation Report,037/Dorset/037/2020/Dorset/July 2012 Flood Investigation Report.pdf
