Internal flooding of properties causing inundation of internal rooms and associated damage. [TAB] (p24)
Cluster of internal property flooding incidents concentrated in and around Weymouth; several urban neighbourhoods (e.g. Upwey and Broadwey, Littlemoor, Westham, Wey Valley, Melcombe Regis and Westham sub–areas) are shown as the most severely affected (darkest blue) on the map. [IMG] (p25)","7 properties (internal flooding in The Park District, Weymouth); internal depths up to 200mm; external depths up to 600mm (p19)
