GB-BIR,2,2018-05-27,52.4390615,-1.9316416,"<div id=""html_1846d1a68bf61c6631a428a6564f27ba"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Heeley Road, Stirchley</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Map indicates the breach location at the intersection of Heeley Road and Sladepool Farm Road, from which flood flow routes moved across adjacent streets and into nearby properties following the storm. [IMG] (p28)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,"Heeley Road, Stirchley",England,"Map indicates the breach location at the intersection of Heeley Road and Sladepool Farm Road, from which flood flow routes moved across adjacent streets and into nearby properties following the storm. [IMG] (p28)",,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27.html,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27,Birmingham flooding 27 May 2018,"May 2018 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2018/Birmingham/Flooding/Section/19/Investigation///May/2018//2.0/.pdf
