GB-BIR,2,2018-05-27,52.41172,-1.96343,"<div id=""html_d62773fd4430fc7619b77cd75bfd2078"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Northfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The southern blue region shown for the May 2018 storms spans Northfield, indicating the area experienced flooding during the intense storm on 27 May 2018. [IMG] (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,Northfield,England,"The southern blue region shown for the May 2018 storms spans Northfield, indicating the area experienced flooding during the intense storm on 27 May 2018. [IMG] (p8)",,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27.html,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27,Birmingham flooding 27 May 2018,"May 2018 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2018/Birmingham/Flooding/Section/19/Investigation///May/2018//2.0/.pdf
