GB-BIR,2,2018-05-27,52.460327,-1.9179097,"<div id=""html_160889a99c82d85197af2d69d5cbe50d"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Edgbaston</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Edgbaston lies within the south&ndash;west blue&ndash;shaded area on the May 2018 event map and was therefore affected by flooding from the intense storm on 27 May 2018. [IMG] (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,Edgbaston,England,Edgbaston lies within the south–west blue–shaded area on the May 2018 event map and was therefore affected by flooding from the intense storm on 27 May 2018. [IMG] (p8),,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27.html,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27,Birmingham flooding 27 May 2018,"May 2018 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2018/Birmingham/Flooding/Section/19/Investigation///May/2018//2.0/.pdf
