GB-BIR,2,2018-05-27,52.446533419675745,-1.90756441767966,"<div id=""html_99d0bfab7c81b9ba1911137c2a24fb2e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Moor Green</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Nine incidents of internal property flooding (including one school) occurred across the area; highways and gardens were flooded. Runoff from Highbury Park and the surrounding highway catchment followed local topography into the street network, producing flow routes through Moor Green and adjacent streets. (p80)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>9 properties; 1 school (p80)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,Moor Green,England,"Nine incidents of internal property flooding (including one school) occurred across the area; highways and gardens were flooded. Runoff from Highbury Park and the surrounding highway catchment followed local topography into the street network, producing flow routes through Moor Green and adjacent streets. (p80)",9 properties; 1 school (p80),GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27.html,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27,Birmingham flooding 27 May 2018,"May 2018 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2018/Birmingham/Flooding/Section/19/Investigation///May/2018//2.0/.pdf
GB-BIR,2,2018-05-27,52.45331,-1.8675067,"<div id=""html_207f7691d68a69b5ecab103a4817cf5c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Sparkhill</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding caused by the River Cole overtopping its channel and breaching, sending floodwater across surrounding land, highways, gardens and open spaces and causing internal property flooding in the area. (p90)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>31 properties (including 3 commercial properties) (p90)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,Sparkhill,England,"Flooding caused by the River Cole overtopping its channel and breaching, sending floodwater across surrounding land, highways, gardens and open spaces and causing internal property flooding in the area. (p90)",31 properties (including 3 commercial properties) (p90),GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27.html,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27,Birmingham flooding 27 May 2018,"May 2018 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2018/Birmingham/Flooding/Section/19/Investigation///May/2018//2.0/.pdf
GB-BIR,2,2018-05-27,52.4264696,-1.8647618,"<div id=""html_01cf7391adfafab22279171fd0352233"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Billesley</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Runoff from the storm on 27th May 2018 followed natural topography and the highway network, causing surface water to pond and result in internal flooding of properties on Ardencote Road within Billesley; garden flooding was also reported. The mapped flow route shows breach locations on a nearby ordinary watercourse with floodwaters moving broadly southward/southeast along adjacent streets. (p26)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties (p26)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,Billesley,England,"Runoff from the storm on 27th May 2018 followed natural topography and the highway network, causing surface water to pond and result in internal flooding of properties on Ardencote Road within Billesley; garden flooding was also reported. The mapped flow route shows breach locations on a nearby ordinary watercourse with floodwaters moving broadly southward/southeast along adjacent streets. (p26)",3 properties (p26),GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27.html,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27,Birmingham flooding 27 May 2018,"May 2018 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2018/Birmingham/Flooding/Section/19/Investigation///May/2018//2.0/.pdf
GB-BIR,2,2018-05-27,52.4497734811141,-1.910719711978233,"<div id=""html_2ead0f3b23bcef27a1214f683a61f630"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Selly Park North</h1><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>23 properties (internal flooding incidents) (p32)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,Selly Park North,England,,23 properties (internal flooding incidents) (p32),GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27.html,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27,Birmingham flooding 27 May 2018,"May 2018 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2018/Birmingham/Flooding/Section/19/Investigation///May/2018//2.0/.pdf
GB-BIR,2,2018-05-27,52.444046,-1.9204327,"<div id=""html_932a580876c1e2d1f86b638bcd7fe858"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Selly Park</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Selly Park (Selly Park North area) experienced internal property flooding (23 recorded incidents across the area), garden flooding and highway flooding as a result of overland flows and the breach of the nearby Bourn Brook during the storm. (p32)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>23 properties (internal flooding incidents) (p32)</p></div></div></body></div>",Birmingham,Selly Park,England,"Selly Park (Selly Park North area) experienced internal property flooding (23 recorded incidents across the area), garden flooding and highway flooding as a result of overland flows and the breach of the nearby Bourn Brook during the storm. (p32)",23 properties (internal flooding incidents) (p32),GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27.html,GB-BIR_2_2018-05-27,Birmingham flooding 27 May 2018,"May 2018 Flooding: Flood and Water Management Act, Section 19 Investigation",007/Birmingham/007/2018/Birmingham/Flooding/Section/19/Investigation///May/2018//2.0/.pdf
