GB-CAM,17,2020-12-01,52.5438342,0.0751492,"<div id=""html_ae0b9ec18f510171f0e93bf49b15c724"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Brewin Avenue, March</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water/drainage issues affected Brewin Avenue, including deterioration or loss of a highway ditch/watercourse on the southern side that contributed to localised flooding and required reinstatement to address overland flows and drainage connectivity. [TAB,PAG] (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Brewin Avenue, March",England,"Surface water/drainage issues affected Brewin Avenue, including deterioration or loss of a highway ditch/watercourse on the southern side that contributed to localised flooding and required reinstatement to address overland flows and drainage connectivity. [TAB,PAG] (p12)",,GB-CAM_17_2020-12-01.html,GB-CAM_17_2020-12-01,March flooding December 2020,Flood Investigation Report: March,021/Cambridgeshire County/021/2020/Cambridgeshire County/March-December-2020-Flood-Investigation-Report.pdf
GB-CAM,17,2020-12-01,52.5432245,0.0771975,"<div id=""html_4259902412fec0e43067282b0df5656b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Butt Avenue, March</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>High groundwater and blocked/insufficient drainage led to surface water ponding and overland flows affecting the highway. Highway drainage works were required, including reinstatement of a highway ditch on the southern side of Brewin Avenue/Butt Avenue and deployment of sandbags to clear drains and reduce flooding. [TAB,PAG] (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Butt Avenue, March",England,"High groundwater and blocked/insufficient drainage led to surface water ponding and overland flows affecting the highway. Highway drainage works were required, including reinstatement of a highway ditch on the southern side of Brewin Avenue/Butt Avenue and deployment of sandbags to clear drains and reduce flooding. [TAB,PAG] (p12)",,GB-CAM_17_2020-12-01.html,GB-CAM_17_2020-12-01,March flooding December 2020,Flood Investigation Report: March,021/Cambridgeshire County/021/2020/Cambridgeshire County/March-December-2020-Flood-Investigation-Report.pdf
