GB-CAM,17,2020-12-01,52.5440874,0.1127124,"<div id=""html_ba983d46676d9b303c4482241e085811"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Upwell Road, March</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>CCTV survey of the surface water system completed and silt and roots removed from the surface water system to address flooding&ndash;related blockages. (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Upwell Road, March",England,CCTV survey of the surface water system completed and silt and roots removed from the surface water system to address flooding–related blockages. (p13),,GB-CAM_17_2020-12-01.html,GB-CAM_17_2020-12-01,March flooding December 2020,Flood Investigation Report: March,021/Cambridgeshire County/021/2020/Cambridgeshire County/March-December-2020-Flood-Investigation-Report.pdf
