GB-IOW,3,2023-10-25,50.7289255,-1.1503493,"<div id=""html_f12389f3fb322997cee8ff5efdf53176"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>West Hill Road, Ryde</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The lower section of West Hill Road experienced flows from manholes and gullies travelling towards the lower&ndash;lying Simeon Recreation Ground as drainage became impeded. [TAB] (p18)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flows from West Hill Road were flowing towards the recreation ground during the event and the road is identified among those neighbouring the recreation ground where property flooding occurred. (p21)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flows on the lower part of West Hill Road travelled along the surface towards the lower&ndash;lying Simeon Recreation Ground as the drainage network became overloaded. (p37)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"West Hill Road, Ryde",England,"The lower section of West Hill Road experienced flows from manholes and gullies travelling towards the lower–lying Simeon Recreation Ground as drainage became impeded. [TAB] (p18)
