GB-HEF,15,2020-02-16,52.0942481,-2.7234994,"<div id=""html_01131cf2c72d178ec40de35c2591e61b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Church Road, Lyde</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Blocked drains and debris on Church Road and a culvert alongside Church Road filling to capacity were reported as sources/routes of floodwater that reached properties; culvert diameter changes (originally 450mm, extended as 375mm, downstream end 300mm) reduced capacity and may have contributed to flooding. (p2)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties [MUL] (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Herefordshire,"Church Road, Lyde",England,"Blocked drains and debris on Church Road and a culvert alongside Church Road filling to capacity were reported as sources/routes of floodwater that reached properties; culvert diameter changes (originally 450mm, extended as 375mm, downstream end 300mm) reduced capacity and may have contributed to flooding. (p2)",3 properties [MUL] (p2),GB-HEF_15_2020-02-16.html,GB-HEF_15_2020-02-16,Lyde flooding 16 Feb 2020,Herefordshire 2019/20 Section 19 Report: Lyde,055/Herefordshire County/14/Lyde.pdf
