GB-CON,3,2014-02-01,50.35311,-4.458305,"<div id=""html_dc98aedd7e1f4e8d656c4e9d64df4860"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>West Looe</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overtopping of quay&ndash;side defences led to flooding along the quay; properties flooded internally. (p13)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>30 properties (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,West Looe,England,Overtopping of quay–side defences led to flooding along the quay; properties flooded internally. (p13),30 properties (p13),GB-CON_3_2014-02-01_etc.html,GB-CON_3_2014-02-01_etc,,,
