GB-KHL,1,2012-08-25,53.78255,-0.338587,"<div id=""html_9bf82cec1326a97ce5401cbdd2c4685a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Coverdale, Bransholme</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Minor silt was removed from the Cotterdale surface water sewer and a soft blockage was cleared from a foul sewer. A flood flow route along the footpath network was identified and HCC is developing a capital scheme to install drainage, storage and a new connection to the surface water sewer to manage future flows. [TAB] (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kingston upon Hull,"Coverdale, Bransholme",England,"Minor silt was removed from the Cotterdale surface water sewer and a soft blockage was cleared from a foul sewer. A flood flow route along the footpath network was identified and HCC is developing a capital scheme to install drainage, storage and a new connection to the surface water sewer to manage future flows. [TAB] (p12)",,GB-KHL_1_2012-08-25.html,GB-KHL_1_2012-08-25,Kingston Upon Hull flooding 25 Aug 2012,Hull City Council Flood Investigation Report: City Wide Flash Flooding – August 2012,"064/Kingston upon Hull, City of/FloodInvestigationReportHeavyRainAugust2012.pdf"
