GB-BCP,1,2015-07-03,50.72089231046475,-1.9201528260233243,"<div id=""html_4a8af5dd87acfb7472c1a7b2092d89d9"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Talbot and Branksome Woods</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Multiple reported/observed incidents of internal (building) flooding and highway flooding were plotted within the ward on 3 July 2015. Clusters of internal (red) and highway (cyan) incidents are concentrated in the western and central parts of the ward; some external and mixed internal & external incidents also recorded. [IMG] (p27)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding incidents in this ward were recorded on 3rd July 2015 (red dots on the map). These incidents overlap with earlier reported/observed flooding (light blue), indicating parts of the ward are repeatedly affected. (p29)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Map shows observed flooding locations (red) within the ward on 3 July 2015 that overlap modelled 1&ndash;in&ndash;100&ndash;year predicted flood zones; indicates localised inundation of streets and low&ndash;lying areas and alignment with nearby watercourses. [IMG] (p31)</p></div></div></body></div>","Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole",Talbot and Branksome Woods,England,"Multiple reported/observed incidents of internal (building) flooding and highway flooding were plotted within the ward on 3 July 2015. Clusters of internal (red) and highway (cyan) incidents are concentrated in the western and central parts of the ward; some external and mixed internal & external incidents also recorded. [IMG] (p27)
