Map shows observed flooding locations (red) within the ward on 3 July 2015 that overlap modelled 1–in–100–year predicted flood zones; indicates localised inundation of streets and low–lying areas and alignment with nearby watercourses. [IMG] (p31)",,GB-BCP_1_2015-07-03.html,GB-BCP_1_2015-07-03,Bournemouth flooding 03 Jul 2015,Flooding In Bournemouth 3rd July 2015 Section 19 Report(Floods And Water Management Act 2010) for Flooding Advisory Group,"011/Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole/011/2015/Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole/Flood-Report-3rd-July-2015-Final.pdf"
GB-BCP,1,2015-07-03,50.726897,-1.8569807,"<div id=""html_3988d1486adc4e75369f11e2b80e82d4"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>East Cliff and Springbourne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The ward label &#8216;East Cliff and Springbourne&#8217; appears on the mapped area that shows observed flooding locations (red) and predicted flood zones nearby, indicating the ward was within the area affected by surface&ndash;water and watercourse flooding on 3 July 2015. [IMG] (p31)</p></div></div></body></div>","Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole",East Cliff and Springbourne,England,"The ward label ‘East Cliff and Springbourne’ appears on the mapped area that shows observed flooding locations (red) and predicted flood zones nearby, indicating the ward was within the area affected by surface–water and watercourse flooding on 3 July 2015. [IMG] (p31)",,GB-BCP_1_2015-07-03.html,GB-BCP_1_2015-07-03,Bournemouth flooding 03 Jul 2015,Flooding In Bournemouth 3rd July 2015 Section 19 Report(Floods And Water Management Act 2010) for Flooding Advisory Group,"011/Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole/011/2015/Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole/Flood-Report-3rd-July-2015-Final.pdf"
GB-BCP,1,2015-07-03,50.7250546,-1.8416326,"<div id=""html_1658e2a06425175124414832b7f1fbe5"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Boscombe West</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Observed surface&ndash;water flooding locations (red) within the ward on 3rd July 2015 as shown on the map; some observed flood points coincide with modelled 1&ndash;in&ndash;100&ndash;year (>150mm) predicted flood zones along low&ndash;lying corridors. [IMG] (p31)</p></div></div></body></div>","Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole",Boscombe West,England,Observed surface–water flooding locations (red) within the ward on 3rd July 2015 as shown on the map; some observed flood points coincide with modelled 1–in–100–year (>150mm) predicted flood zones along low–lying corridors. [IMG] (p31),,GB-BCP_1_2015-07-03.html,GB-BCP_1_2015-07-03,Bournemouth flooding 03 Jul 2015,Flooding In Bournemouth 3rd July 2015 Section 19 Report(Floods And Water Management Act 2010) for Flooding Advisory Group,"011/Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole/011/2015/Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole/Flood-Report-3rd-July-2015-Final.pdf"
GB-BCP,1,2015-07-03,50.76776612630613,-1.916877104774218,"<div id=""html_0e9fb56870f0a7c0e6dc0f17a8b35d3f"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Kinson South</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Multiple reported flood incidents clustered in Kinson South on 3rd July 2015. Internal and combined internal/external incidents were concentrated here, alongside external and highway flooding distributed across the ward. [IMG] (p26)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Clustered flooding incidents on 3 July 2015 concentrated in Kinson South are shown on the map, indicating local surface&ndash;water inundation and overlap with prior reported flooding at some locations. [IMG] (p28)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Actual flooding events on 3rd July 2015 are shown within the ward (red dots), with notable clustering in central and northern parts of Kinson South and partial overlap with predicted 1&ndash;in&ndash;100&ndash;year (>150mm) flood zones. [IMG] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>","Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole",Kinson South,England,"Multiple reported flood incidents clustered in Kinson South on 3rd July 2015. Internal and combined internal/external incidents were concentrated here, alongside external and highway flooding distributed across the ward. [IMG] (p26)
