GB-BCP,1,2015-07-03,50.770042991546,-1.9014718647687316,"<div id=""html_23f9b733e70ac6b9bd972b6152cc546a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Kinson North</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Reported flood incidents across the ward on 3rd July 2015, with external and highway flooding widely distributed; fewer internal incidents reported compared with neighbouring Kinson South. [IMG] (p26)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding incidents occurred within the ward on 3 July 2015; locations shown on the map indicate localised surface&ndash;water inundation contributing to repeated flood&ndash;prone spots when compared with previous reported incidents. [IMG] (p28)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Locations of flooding on 3 July 2015 are shown within the ward (red markers on the map); flooding clusters occur in the northern/central parts and partially overlap with predicted 1&ndash;in&ndash;100&ndash;year (>150 mm) flood zones. [IMG] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>","Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole",Kinson North,England,"Reported flood incidents across the ward on 3rd July 2015, with external and highway flooding widely distributed; fewer internal incidents reported compared with neighbouring Kinson South. [IMG] (p26)
