GB-DER,4,2014-07-19,52.9268175,-1.3985185,"<div id=""html_efe80a1d82f4f5711ca5ddda09f68099"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Sancroft Road, Spondon</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Drains to the same surface water sewer/outfall system feeding an unnamed tributary of the River Derwent and is part of the urban catchment implicated in the flooding event; therefore at risk of, and involved in, surface water/urban flooding when the system is overwhelmed. (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derby,"Sancroft Road, Spondon",England,"Drains to the same surface water sewer/outfall system feeding an unnamed tributary of the River Derwent and is part of the urban catchment implicated in the flooding event; therefore at risk of, and involved in, surface water/urban flooding when the system is overwhelmed. (p8)",,GB-DER_4_2014-07-19.html,GB-DER_4_2014-07-19,Spondon flooding 19 Jul 2014,"Flood Investigation Report: Sandringham Drive, Spondon 19th July 2014",033/Derby/033/2014/Derby/Sandringham-Drive-Spondon-S19-Report.pdf
