GB-LAN,25,2023-07-01,53.8611712,-2.5650945,"<div id=""html_dfb7ff6ce34b57d959f6228bb85ce5a4"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Lancashire</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Lancashire experienced flooding during the July 2023 flood event. (p1)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding incidents occurred within the county (Tincklers Lane incidents in June and July 2023). Lancashire County Council (local highways team) received reports and inspected nearby highway drainage assets, finding no obstructions but identifying the need to confirm ownership and maintenance responsibilities for recently&ndash;installed gullies. [PAG] (p6)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 flood incidents; 1 property affected by foul contamination [PAG] (p6)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Lancashire,England,"Lancashire experienced flooding during the July 2023 flood event. (p1)
