roperties (garden flooding to a maximum depth of c.30 cm); air bricks showing flow at 8&ndash;16 cm; one resident reported having to leave premises for 5&ndash;10 days [IMG,MUL] (p14)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>c.15cm (depth) [TAB] (p16)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Blenheim Close, Old Hurst",England,"Flooding significantly affected external premises (gardens) and caused internal flooding to at least one residential property on Blenheim Close. [TAB] (p10)
