GB-DBY,3,2023-10-18,53.344943263416155,-1.7759851447724944,"<div id=""html_3b64cbdd2879b0303f6ebaf536e47c30"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Mill Court</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Peakshole Water caused river flooding in Castleton during Storm Babet that led to internal flooding of properties in the village. (p52)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of residential and commercial holiday&ndash;let properties caused by Peakshole Water overtopping and surface water inundation. [IMG] (p54)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties flooded when water from Peakshole Water came through the drystone walls backing onto gardens of properties on Mill Court; this flow then moved onto Millbridge and Tricketts Close. (p55)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>24 residential properties; 5 non&ndash;residential properties (p52)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Part of 17 homes and 3 commercial holiday lets (these 20 properties were affected collectively across Millbridge, Trickett Close and Mill Court) [IMG] (p54)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,Mill Court,England,"Peakshole Water caused river flooding in Castleton during Storm Babet that led to internal flooding of properties in the village. (p52)
