GB-DBY,3,2023-10-18,53.066525252283256,-1.4660794753041733,"<div id=""html_f1216a33ec18a2bf11026ca7e1284698"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Drover's Way, Bullbridge</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residential properties on Drover's Way were flooded internally during the storm. (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of homes caused by River Amber&ndash;related flooding during Storm Babet. [PAG] (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Three homes upstream of Ridgeway on Drovers Way were flooded due to the River Amber exceeding channel capacity and overtopping its banks. (p10)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 homes flooded (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 homes [PAG] (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 homes flooded (p10)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Drover's Way, Bullbridge",England,"Residential properties on Drover's Way were flooded internally during the storm. (p7)
