GB-DBY,3,2023-10-18,52.9555334,-1.4514615,"<div id=""html_87d59e686d7263d3dec339d80c5c1eb6"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Rectory Lane, Breadsall</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Three homes on Refectory Lane were internally flooded when Dam Brook reached capacity and overtopped its banks during Storm Babet, allowing floodwater to enter properties adjacent to the brook. [IMG] (p29)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties adjacent to Rectory Lane lie within Flood Zone 2 along Dam Brook and were within the area of properties that were internally flooded during the event; surface water flooding also affected properties where local drainage could not discharge to Dam Brook. [PAG,IMG] (p30)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Three residential properties on Rectory Lane flooded internally on the afternoon/evening of 20 Oct 2023 as part of the community&ndash;wide flooding caused by nearby watercourses and overwhelmed drainage/sewer systems. (p32)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 homes [IMG] (p29)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties (p32)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Rectory Lane, Breadsall",England,"Three homes on Refectory Lane were internally flooded when Dam Brook reached capacity and overtopped its banks during Storm Babet, allowing floodwater to enter properties adjacent to the brook. [IMG] (p29)
