GB-DBY,3,2023-10-18,52.9869622,-1.4873544,"<div id=""html_6c85e10bbb2fd5218914d1dc665a2580"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Village Court, Duffield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residential properties on Village Court were internally flooded during the event; homes experienced internal flooding damage. [IMG,PAG] (p41)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater reached property thresholds around 14:04 on 20 October 2023 following overtopping of defence walls, and internal flooding of properties occurred. [PAG] (p44)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Defence walls were overtopped and flood water reached property thresholds around 14:04 on 20 October 2023, leading to internal flooding of homes on Village Court. (p45)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flood defence walls were overtopped at about 14:04 on 20 Oct 2023, causing floodwater to run across the tennis courts and into properties on Village Court (including the tennis club). [IMG,PAG] (p46)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>19 homes [IMG,PAG] (p41)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>23 homes (combined on Village Court and Ecclesbourne Avenue) [PAG] (p44)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>23 homes (across Village Court and Ecclesbourne Avenue) (p45)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Village Court, Duffield",England,"Residential properties on Village Court were internally flooded during the event; homes experienced internal flooding damage. [IMG,PAG] (p41)
