Multiple sources of flooding (Bradwell Brook, an unnamed watercourse and surface water) caused internal flooding of properties across the village during Storm Babet. Properties on Church Street, Brookside, Soft Water Lane and other streets were affected; flood warnings and alerts covered the village. [IMG,PAG] (p49)
