Flooding in the village linked to reduced culvert capacity under a property on Soft Water Lane (Bradwell Brook). Reported road flooding depths: Church Street near the bridge was reported as shin–deep and depths on Soft Water Lane were reported deeper. The Environment Agency issued a Flood Alert (19 Oct 2023 19:13) and a Flood Warning (20 Oct 2023 13:16) for Bradwell; EA operatives removed large blockages during the event and conducted CCTV surveys prior to Storm Babet. [PAG,MUL] (p51)","26 residential properties; 3 non–residential properties [IMG] (p47)
