GB-KEN,16,2019-06-10,51.3314413,0.3636834,"<div id=""html_d92bdf5150c48d2efe7a874c330bdb80"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>The Coppice, Vigo Village</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Foul sewer flooding caused internal flooding to properties; external flooding occurred at the lowest point in the road. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 properties reported internal flooding from foul sewer; 2 properties reported external flooding [TAB] (p3)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"The Coppice, Vigo Village",England,Foul sewer flooding caused internal flooding to properties; external flooding occurred at the lowest point in the road. [TAB] (p3),2 properties reported internal flooding from foul sewer; 2 properties reported external flooding [TAB] (p3),GB-KEN_16_2019-06-10_etc.html,GB-KEN_16_2019-06-10_etc,Gravesham flooding 10 Jun 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Vigo Village and Culverstone,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Vigo-and-Culverstone.pdf
GB-KEN,16,2019-06-10,51.3305858,0.3621576,"<div id=""html_0cc5747b3c2e4f8a0856a82cfc3a8a01"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Beech Mast, Vigo Village</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>External flooding occurred at the lowest points in the road, affecting properties. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flowed along Beech Mast as part of the flood pathway. Inspections found a damaged drainage pipe leading to a soakaway (tree root ingress identified), which would have reduced local drainage performance during the event. (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Beech Mast was surveyed and cleansed following the flood; the highway (11 gullies) had a damaged small silt&ndash;trap on a footpath. A damaged drain (coinciding with a BT trench reinstatement) was repaired with a replacement gully and new piped connection into the soakaway in June 2020 as part of flood recovery works. [TAB] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>6 properties reported external flooding [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>11 gullies; 1 damaged silt&ndash;trap [TAB] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Beech Mast, Vigo Village",England,"External flooding occurred at the lowest points in the road, affecting properties. [TAB] (p3)
