GB-KEN,16,2019-06-10,51.331962,0.3611345,"<div id=""html_3de5c66af914b0b592cbf11a9ebbf466"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Fern Down, Vigo Village</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overland flow (from Admers Woodland and Admers Wood Road) and foul sewer flooding affected properties, causing internal flooding. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flows reached and crossed into Ferndown Road (sic) after flowing from woodland and along footpaths. (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Cleansing of highway gullies undertaken immediately after the flood; inspections found no issues with the gullies. [TAB,PAG] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>9 properties internal [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>6 gullies [TAB,PAG] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Fern Down, Vigo Village",England,"Overland flow (from Admers Woodland and Admers Wood Road) and foul sewer flooding affected properties, causing internal flooding. [TAB] (p3)
