GB-KEN,16,2019-06-10,51.3313408,0.3602309,"<div id=""html_655b556146567924b964905db37beba5"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ash Keys, Vigo Village</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>External flooding affected properties, with two of those properties also reporting internal flooding. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>After the flood the 3 gullies on Ash Keys were cleansed; one gully was found to be not flowing and a CCTV survey was scheduled to identify the fault and assess the associated soakaway. [TAB] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties external; 2 properties internal [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 gullies; 1 gully not flowing [TAB] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Ash Keys, Vigo Village",England,"External flooding affected properties, with two of those properties also reporting internal flooding. [TAB] (p3)
