GB-KEN,16,2019-06-10,51.330412,0.3507855,"<div id=""html_e4c24ace10ee1d9e35a44d753c1878b9"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Timber Bank, Vigo Village</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Many properties flooded; foul (sewer) water entered from the rear of properties and external flooding occurred at lowest points in the road. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Highway flood water required attendance and a tanker to clear the highway; foul sewers were reported overflowing from manholes into rear gardens of properties. Inspections found defects in drainage (section of pipe, a silt trap and a soakaway connection) that affected drainage. (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Highway drainage serving Timber Bank was inspected after the flood; 50 gullies and 16 soakaways were investigated, defects (including tree root ingress, cracking and joint displacement) were identified and cleansing and repairs were scheduled or completed (including replacement of a small silt&ndash;trap with a larger gully pot and repair of a 27m damaged drain linking manholes). [TAB] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>36 properties flooded; 19 properties reported foul water flooding from rear; 17 properties external [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>one silt trap; one drainage connection into one of the 16 soakaways (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>50 gullies; 16 soakaways; 27m of damaged drain [TAB] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Timber Bank, Vigo Village",England,"Many properties flooded; foul (sewer) water entered from the rear of properties and external flooding occurred at lowest points in the road. [TAB] (p3)
Highway flood water required attendance and a tanker to clear the highway; foul sewers were reported overflowing from manholes into rear gardens of properties. Inspections found defects in drainage (section of pipe, a silt trap and a soakaway connection) that affected drainage. (p8)
