GB-KEN,16,2019-06-10,51.3291594,0.3534678,"<div id=""html_6eacfcd1a5736f26c145ca41cea38204"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Croftside, Vigo Village</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Water entered properties from land to the rear; internal flooding reported. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flows travelled along Beech Mast (and nearby routes) contributing to flooding pathways. Inspections found drainage defects: at Croftside a pipe connection to a soakaway was displaced and at Beech Mast the drainage pipe to a soakaway was damaged (likely from tree&ndash;root ingress), which may have reduced soakaway performance. (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Following the 10th June 2019 flood Kent Highways CCTV&ndash;surveyed the highway drainage for Croftside. The connection into the soakaway was found to be damaged (root ingress) and was repaired in June 2020 as part of post&ndash;flood recovery works. [TAB] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 properties; 1 property internal [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>6 gullies; 1 soakaway [TAB] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Croftside, Vigo Village",England,"Water entered properties from land to the rear; internal flooding reported. [TAB] (p3)
Surface water flows travelled along Beech Mast (and nearby routes) contributing to flooding pathways. Inspections found drainage defects: at Croftside a pipe connection to a soakaway was displaced and at Beech Mast the drainage pipe to a soakaway was damaged (likely from tree–root ingress), which may have reduced soakaway performance. (p8)
Following the 10th June 2019 flood Kent Highways CCTV–surveyed the highway drainage for Croftside. The connection into the soakaway was found to be damaged (root ingress) and was repaired in June 2020 as part of post–flood recovery works. [TAB] (p9)","2 properties; 1 property internal [TAB] (p3)
6 gullies; 1 soakaway [TAB] (p9)",GB-KEN_16_2019-06-10_etc.html,GB-KEN_16_2019-06-10_etc,Gravesham flooding 10 Jun 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Vigo Village and Culverstone,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Vigo-and-Culverstone.pdf
GB-KEN,16,2019-06-10,51.3332945,0.365976,"<div id=""html_79a57b6b83f77ce647ed7b0bb56a52de"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Highview, Vigo Village</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>External flooding affected multiple properties; some properties also suffered internal flooding. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Highview underwent cleansing in August 2019 as part of the flood response; all 68 gullies were cleansed and some root ingress was identified, with CCTV survey and root cutting scheduled. [TAB] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>17 properties external; 7 properties internal [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>68 gullies [TAB] (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Highview, Vigo Village",England,"External flooding affected multiple properties; some properties also suffered internal flooding. [TAB] (p3)
