GB-KEN,16,2019-06-10,51.3407289,0.3548746,"<div id=""html_76e8feedf15a167ac2fc852da975af48"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Rhododendron Avenue, Culverstone Green</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding at multiple properties; external flooding affected a property and its garage; the road surface was also flooded. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Five properties reported flooding: four properties suffered internal flooding; one property reported external flooding and garage flooding. (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flowed along Rhododendron Avenue causing road surface damage; internal flooding occurred to the basement of a property. (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Inspected as part of the post&ndash;flood response; the soakaway at the junction with Whitepost Lane was inspected and found to be in good condition and required no further work. [TAB] (p9)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Soakaway at the junction of Whitepost Lane and Rhododendron Avenue was inspected after the flood and found to be in good condition; no further work required. (p10)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>5 properties; 4 properties internal; 1 property external [TAB] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>5 properties; 4 properties internal; 1 property external (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>one property (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Rhododendron Avenue, Culverstone Green",England,"Internal flooding at multiple properties; external flooding affected a property and its garage; the road surface was also flooded. [TAB] (p3)
