GB-KEN,9,2021-07-25,51.1326735,0.4019509,"<div id=""html_d1d5b39504318b9d8d8b98d302544b5c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Marle Place Road, Horsmonden</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of at least one residential property (reported 8&ndash;10 cm of water); two additional properties reported flooding but internal/external not specified. [TAB] (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>KFRS attended a flooding incident at Marle Place Road during the 25 July 2021 event. Responders created channels to aid water flow away from properties, distributed sandbags and carried out pumping/draining actions as part of the local response. (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Listed in Appendix A as a road to which flood surveys were sent; flood surveys were distributed and responses recorded for this location. [TAB] (p16)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property; 2 properties [TAB] (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>One of 4 flooding incidents in Horsmonden attended by KFRS; part of the total of 18 properties pumped out by KFRS across those incidents (p11)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Marle Place Road, Horsmonden",England,"Internal flooding of at least one residential property (reported 8–10 cm of water); two additional properties reported flooding but internal/external not specified. [TAB] (p2)
