GB-KEN,9,2021-07-25,51.1365552,0.4354585,"<div id=""html_43e793bfdb9a7adb3fc40f1a66b5b9a3"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Olivers Court, Horsmonden</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Multiple residential properties experienced flooding: at least one internally and one externally; several other properties reported flooding. Fire & Rescue Service pumped floodwater from properties in this location. [TAB] (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A large log became stuck in the culvert beneath/between Olivers Court and Lamberts Place causing the southern watercourse to back up and overtop; floodwater flowed toward properties on Olivers Court. KFRS removed the log and the flood water began to clear. Map annotations show blockages at culvert entry/exit beneath Olivers Court. [IMG] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Culverted watercourses in the area contributed to drainage surcharge during the intense rainfall. The inlet to the northern culvert (land west of Olivers Court) had grills removed by the maintenance company and the culvert beneath Olivers Court was identified for further condition/suitability investigation. (p12)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Listed in Appendix A as a road to which flood surveys were sent; flood surveys were distributed and responses recorded for this location. [TAB] (p16)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property internal; 1 property external; 4 further properties reported; KFRS pumped floodwater from 10 properties [TAB] (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Olivers Court, Horsmonden",England,"Multiple residential properties experienced flooding: at least one internally and one externally; several other properties reported flooding. Fire & Rescue Service pumped floodwater from properties in this location. [TAB] (p2)
