approx. 350 properties flooded; approximately 220 evacuees transported; 1 casualty (asthma attack); damage to the top 50 cm of a 10 metres low floodwall; Two IDB high–volume pumps deployed to Boston (unable to operate due to insufficient hose lengths/couplings). (p24)
