GB-KEC,1,2021-07-12,51.4986135,-0.2031609,"<div id=""html_461124d6cf2e89781e035aa9c3b58c89"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Leighton House Museum</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding from intense rainfall entered the museum and flooded the electrical switch room. [TAB] (p79)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (museum) flooded [TAB] (p79)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kensington and Chelsea,Leighton House Museum,England,Flooding from intense rainfall entered the museum and flooded the electrical switch room. [TAB] (p79),1 property (museum) flooded [TAB] (p79),GB-KEC_1_2021-07-12.html,GB-KEC_1_2021-07-12,Kensington and Chelsea flooding 12 Jul 2021,Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea Section 19 Flood Investigation: 12 July 2021,062/Kensington and Chelsea/Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea Section 19 Flood Investigation 12 July 2021.pdf
GB-KEC,1,2021-07-12,51.5043073,-0.2123784,"<div id=""html_6ab33792ae691da93dba06f59dd5e51d"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Addisland Court</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Basements and the basement&ndash;level car park flooded; building pumps were overwhelmed, electricity short&ndash;circuited and boiler/electrics damaged. Flats were made uninhabitable and residents moved to temporary accommodation. [TAB] (p79)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>flood depths up to 3 m [TAB] (p79)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kensington and Chelsea,Addisland Court,England,"Basements and the basement–level car park flooded; building pumps were overwhelmed, electricity short–circuited and boiler/electrics damaged. Flats were made uninhabitable and residents moved to temporary accommodation. [TAB] (p79)",flood depths up to 3 m [TAB] (p79),GB-KEC_1_2021-07-12.html,GB-KEC_1_2021-07-12,Kensington and Chelsea flooding 12 Jul 2021,Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea Section 19 Flood Investigation: 12 July 2021,062/Kensington and Chelsea/Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea Section 19 Flood Investigation 12 July 2021.pdf
