Flooded due to overflowing highway drains and surcharged sewers, with water collecting in gardens and entering basements and internal areas. (p80)",,GB-KEC_1_2021-07-12.html,GB-KEC_1_2021-07-12,Kensington and Chelsea flooding 12 Jul 2021,Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea Section 19 Flood Investigation: 12 July 2021,062/Kensington and Chelsea/Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea Section 19 Flood Investigation 12 July 2021.pdf
