""><p>4 properties [TAB] (p74)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kensington and Chelsea,"Arundel Gardens, Notting Hill",England,"The street was affected by flooding on 12 July 2021; site visits involved meeting residents who reported impacts and observing ongoing community impacts. (p19)
