uant""><p>Approx. 75 cm average internal flood depth (reported by residents) [PAG,IMG] (p90)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kensington and Chelsea,"Napier Road, Kensington",England,"Napier Road was flooded during the 12th July 2021 event, experiencing surface water inundation of the street. [TAB] (p37)
