pth 70 cm [TAB] (p86)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kensington and Chelsea,"St Anns Villas, Notting Hill",England,"St Anns Villas was flooded during the 12th July 2021 event, experiencing surface water inundation on the street. [TAB] (p37)
