GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.559444,-0.4173986,"<div id=""html_9a754ec98516dc3111473461d80b90f2"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Clyfford Road, Ruislip</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding across the access road and into properties' gardens/frontages as drains were overwhelmed; contributed to the area&ndash;wide impacts on residential properties. (p8)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>23 houses; 20&ndash;50 properties (sandbags provided by LFB) (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,"Clyfford Road, Ruislip",England,Surface water flooding across the access road and into properties' gardens/frontages as drains were overwhelmed; contributed to the area–wide impacts on residential properties. (p8),23 houses; 20–50 properties (sandbags provided by LFB) (p8),GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5434208,-0.3976799,"<div id=""html_c66baeeeec111aefac303301ee42b621"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>West End Road, Hillingdon</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding of the access road and surrounding properties due to overwhelmed surface water sewer; the report notes previous reports of flooding on West End Road and that water built up at low points and at rear of some properties. [TAB] (p8)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>23 houses; 20&ndash;50 properties (sandbags provided by LFB) [TAB] (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,"West End Road, Hillingdon",England,Flooding of the access road and surrounding properties due to overwhelmed surface water sewer; the report notes previous reports of flooding on West End Road and that water built up at low points and at rear of some properties. [TAB] (p8),23 houses; 20–50 properties (sandbags provided by LFB) [TAB] (p8),GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5656975,-0.4427535,"<div id=""html_713249c5d762555efe89a2cf90d4018f"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>High Road Ickenham, Ickenham</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Road was flooded following surface water/ordinary watercourse overflow; vehicles observed driving through deep water. Flooding persisted for about 24 hours and approached nearby properties on Church Place and Tweedale Grove. (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,"High Road Ickenham, Ickenham",England,Road was flooded following surface water/ordinary watercourse overflow; vehicles observed driving through deep water. Flooding persisted for about 24 hours and approached nearby properties on Church Place and Tweedale Grove. (p12),,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5623647,-0.4368022,"<div id=""html_69a420385d83496fa79081fb93703bba"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Austins Lane, Ickenham</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Road flooding reported at this location associated with surface water/ordinary watercourse not draining to the Ickenham stream; contributed to local standing water around properties. (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,"Austins Lane, Ickenham",England,Road flooding reported at this location associated with surface water/ordinary watercourse not draining to the Ickenham stream; contributed to local standing water around properties. (p12),,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.56445340370508,-0.4418919659269921,"<div id=""html_ba364e38c4b6e348f2b605eea27ff111"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Church Place, Ickenham</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Houses on Church Place were reported as being nearly flooded due to surface water pooling on adjacent roads. [TAB] (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,"Church Place, Ickenham",England,Houses on Church Place were reported as being nearly flooded due to surface water pooling on adjacent roads. [TAB] (p12),,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5649645,-0.4400389,"<div id=""html_f6b39e32d2eb7126f100438f4ddeb802"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Tweeddale Grove, Ickenham</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Houses on Tweedale Grove were reported as being at risk and nearly flooded because water on nearby roads did not drain away. [TAB] (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,"Tweeddale Grove, Ickenham",England,Houses on Tweedale Grove were reported as being at risk and nearly flooded because water on nearby roads did not drain away. [TAB] (p12),,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5457653,-0.485021,"<div id=""html_6499f7eb4cda3f2f38388c2fb2b68990"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Rockingham Parade, Hillingdon</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flood water from the River Colne flowed across the road and into front gardens at Rockingham Parade; residents reported (unverified) ingress through airbricks. (p16)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,"Rockingham Parade, Hillingdon",England,Flood water from the River Colne flowed across the road and into front gardens at Rockingham Parade; residents reported (unverified) ingress through airbricks. (p16),,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5434969,-0.4475055,"<div id=""html_c61b6e8e45971c351d79aa8b02c82bb4"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Windsor Avenue, Hillingdon</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water accumulated on the road and flowed into front gardens and into some houses, resulting in internal flooding of properties. (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,"Windsor Avenue, Hillingdon",England,"Surface water accumulated on the road and flowed into front gardens and into some houses, resulting in internal flooding of properties. (p17)",,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.57528438695023,-0.42080260672149,"<div id=""html_28f86bccb027136811da9087c31daf71"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ruislip</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Ruislip area experienced surface water/urban flooding on 28 July after heavy rain overwhelmed surface water sewers. London Underground infrastructure in the Ruislip area was affected: nearby West Ruislip saw flooding, South Ruislip Station was flooded and closed, Ruislip Manor (Victoria Road) subway was flooded and Ruislip Station was closed for a period while engineers dealt with floodwater. (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Multiple roads in Ruislip (including Ruislip Gardens, Victoria Road, Bedford Road, Clyfford Road, Lea Crescent, Station Approach, Westfield Way, Cornwall Road and Pembroke Road) were reported as affected by flooding during the 28 July 2026 event. [TAB] (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Road and footpath at Station Approach (HA4 6TP) were flooded when the surface water sewer was overwhelmed and blocked (tree roots). Two people became stranded and required rescue; Council Highways used a tanker to remove water until Thames Water attended. (p10)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,Ruislip,England,"Ruislip area experienced surface water/urban flooding on 28 July after heavy rain overwhelmed surface water sewers. London Underground infrastructure in the Ruislip area was affected: nearby West Ruislip saw flooding, South Ruislip Station was flooded and closed, Ruislip Manor (Victoria Road) subway was flooded and Ruislip Station was closed for a period while engineers dealt with floodwater. (p4)
Multiple roads in Ruislip (including Ruislip Gardens, Victoria Road, Bedford Road, Clyfford Road, Lea Crescent, Station Approach, Westfield Way, Cornwall Road and Pembroke Road) were reported as affected by flooding during the 28 July 2026 event. [TAB] (p5)
Road and footpath at Station Approach (HA4 6TP) were flooded when the surface water sewer was overwhelmed and blocked (tree roots). Two people became stranded and required rescue; Council Highways used a tanker to remove water until Thames Water attended. (p10)",,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5465937,-0.369565,"<div id=""html_f16104bae7e2c8677e5771558a7754cf"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Northolt</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Northolt area reported flooding on 28 July due to heavy rain overwhelming surface water sewers. (p4)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,Northolt,England,Northolt area reported flooding on 28 July due to heavy rain overwhelming surface water sewers. (p4),,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5449509,-0.4816672,"<div id=""html_4769af227933bb459eec34bc594987ab"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Uxbridge</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Localised surface water flooding issues reported on 28 July associated with heavy rainfall overwhelming drainage. (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Multiple roads in Uxbridge (Cowley Road, The Lynch, Regents Avenue, Granville Road/Windsor Avenue, Turnpike Lane) were affected by surface water flooding, impacting the carriageways and access. [TAB] (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Area around Rockingham Parade and The Lynch in Uxbridge experienced fluvial flooding driven by high River Colne levels; surface water covered pedestrian routes and affected properties' front gardens. (p16)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Localized surface water flooding on Cowley Road caused transport disruption in Uxbridge (bus diversions and tailbacks). [TAB] (p18)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 road closure affecting bus services [TAB] (p18)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,Uxbridge,England,"Localised surface water flooding issues reported on 28 July associated with heavy rainfall overwhelming drainage. (p4)
