GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.4889317,-0.4755435,"<div id=""html_3568105d922130789997a37673c1147b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Harmondsworth</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Holloway Lane in Harmondsworth was affected by surface water flooding. [TAB] (p5)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,Harmondsworth,England,Holloway Lane in Harmondsworth was affected by surface water flooding. [TAB] (p5),,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.4884891,-0.4363028,"<div id=""html_cae7c1c48396b9b2b70bbfad3985af22"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Harlington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>High Street in Harlington experienced surface water flooding of the carriageway, causing local access disruption and traffic impacts. [TAB] (p5)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,Harlington,England,"High Street in Harlington experienced surface water flooding of the carriageway, causing local access disruption and traffic impacts. [TAB] (p5)",,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
