GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.56415564165698,-0.44315573469572056,"<div id=""html_91aa4c0e5462065563820677fcbb0e8c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ickenham</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Part of Ickenham (Derwent Avenue) experienced surface water flooding when the surface water sewer was overwhelmed; one home flooded internally and a road was inundated. [TAB] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Area of Ickenham (UB10) experienced surface water flooding on roads (High Road and Austins Lane) where water did not drain into the Ickenham stream, with standing water lasting about 24 hours and posing a risk to nearby houses. [TAB] (p12)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 home [TAB] (p11)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,Ickenham,England,"Part of Ickenham (Derwent Avenue) experienced surface water flooding when the surface water sewer was overwhelmed; one home flooded internally and a road was inundated. [TAB] (p11)
