GB-HIL,1,2026-07-28,51.5751352,-0.3709086,"<div id=""html_c2c567b0c1c4fd0ca396b4109a41c62e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Rayners Lane</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Rail tracks between Ruislip and Rayners Lane were submerged by floodwater, causing closure of the Metropolitan and Piccadilly lines on that section and resulting in rail service disruption. (p4)</p></div></div></body></div>",Hillingdon,Rayners Lane,England,"Rail tracks between Ruislip and Rayners Lane were submerged by floodwater, causing closure of the Metropolitan and Piccadilly lines on that section and resulting in rail service disruption. (p4)",,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28.html,GB-HIL_1_2026-07-28,Hillingdon flooding 28 Jul 2026,Flood Investigation Report: July 28th 2014,057/Hillingdon/Flood/Investigation/Report/July28th/2014 2.pdf
