GB-CBF,1,2016-06-07,51.976723,-0.2305199,"<div id=""html_0e763ce7297fc84fd73e08a56ce39cf4"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Letchworth</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Rural areas between Stotfold and Letchworth allowed debris and vegetation to enter Pix Brook; debris was found after the event and contributed to culvert blockage and raised upstream water levels, culminating in the brook exceeding capacity and out&ndash;of&ndash;channel flows at susceptible locations. (p27)</p></div></div></body></div>",Central Bedfordshire,Letchworth,England,"Rural areas between Stotfold and Letchworth allowed debris and vegetation to enter Pix Brook; debris was found after the event and contributed to culvert blockage and raised upstream water levels, culminating in the brook exceeding capacity and out–of–channel flows at susceptible locations. (p27)",,GB-CBF_1_2016-06-07.html,GB-CBF_1_2016-06-07,Central Bedfordshire flooding 07 Jun 2016 - 12 Jun 2016,"Flood Investigation Report: Aspley Guise, Cranfield, Dunstable, Stotfold",023/Central Bedfordshire/023/2016/Central Bedfordshire/flood-report-multiple-3/tcm3-21465.pdf
GB-LAN,2,2015-12-01,53.646394,-2.629455,"<div id=""html_3b17f519c403913a12c4faba48587fc1"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Chorley Football Club</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding: floodwater entered the interior of the club building. [TAB] (p25)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Chorley Football Club,England,Internal flooding: floodwater entered the interior of the club building. [TAB] (p25),,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01,Chorley District flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Chorley District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/chorley-final-report.pdf
GB-LAN,2,2015-12-01,53.65556480252085,-2.734468511327935,"<div id=""html_a974fd8f40d9b8840a7dfe8dd25d6a6e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>The Mill Race</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding was witnessed at The Mill Race; LCC Highways noted this was in part due to a restriction at the Yarrow River Bridge. [TAB] (p33)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,The Mill Race,England,Flooding was witnessed at The Mill Race; LCC Highways noted this was in part due to a restriction at the Yarrow River Bridge. [TAB] (p33),,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01,Chorley District flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Chorley District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/chorley-final-report.pdf
