GB-LAN,2,2015-12-01,53.6112935,-2.6050198,"<div id=""html_c25c050cca96123fbce7c5efc6cc4ffa"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Market Street, Adlington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Gullies outside a property on Market Street were cleaned as a response measure; one gully remains not running and options are under review. [TAB,MUL] (p15)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,"Market Street, Adlington",England,"Gullies outside a property on Market Street were cleaned as a response measure; one gully remains not running and options are under review. [TAB,MUL] (p15)",,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01,Chorley District flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Chorley District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/chorley-final-report.pdf
