GB-LAN,2,2015-12-01,53.6774087,-2.7935378,"<div id=""html_162801a545bba149814f1712e3f29a4e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>South Road, Bretherton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Investment secured to improve highway drainage on South Road in response to the flood event; funding secured and detailed design to be provided with works to be carried out when resources are available. [TAB] (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,"South Road, Bretherton",England,Investment secured to improve highway drainage on South Road in response to the flood event; funding secured and detailed design to be provided with works to be carried out when resources are available. [TAB] (p17),,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01,Chorley District flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Chorley District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/chorley-final-report.pdf
