GB-LAN,2,2015-12-01,53.661906,-2.7730849,"<div id=""html_32539c8bdb9be8766fb9a840fdf8bf1c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Out Lane, Croston</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding response measures were required during the event (sandbags delivered) and post&ndash;event drainage maintenance carried out (gullies cleaned), indicating Out Lane was impacted by the flood event. [TAB] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,"Out Lane, Croston",England,"Flooding response measures were required during the event (sandbags delivered) and post–event drainage maintenance carried out (gullies cleaned), indicating Out Lane was impacted by the flood event. [TAB] (p30)",,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01,Chorley District flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Chorley District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/chorley-final-report.pdf
