GB-LAN,2,2015-12-01,53.7056875,-2.6713947,"<div id=""html_90387b17b0ff8cedc8d2c47ec93c7b7e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Wigan Road, Clayton-Le-Woods</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flood&ndash;related impacts to the drainage system serving Wigan Road: sandbags were provided during the 26/12/2015 event; subsequent reactive gully cleaning and culvert root&ndash;cutting were carried out after the event; CCTV revealed root infestation and further connected drainage outfalls were identified ~200m north of Nell Lane. [TAB] (p31)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,"Wigan Road, Clayton-Le-Woods",England,Flood–related impacts to the drainage system serving Wigan Road: sandbags were provided during the 26/12/2015 event; subsequent reactive gully cleaning and culvert root–cutting were carried out after the event; CCTV revealed root infestation and further connected drainage outfalls were identified ~200m north of Nell Lane. [TAB] (p31),,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_2_2015-12-01,Chorley District flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Chorley District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/chorley-final-report.pdf
