GB-WNH,3,2019-10-01,52.2050429,-1.0570928,"<div id=""html_a1bba7cb88984bfe0ea0c264635d7e62"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Upper Stowe</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding has been reported at a residential property on Francis Row, Upper Stowe on more than one occasion in the last five years, prompting a Section 19 investigation. (p4)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding occurred in the village during heavy rainfall on 1 October 2019; surface water flowed to the southwest bend of Francis Row and the event resulted in internal flooding at a residential property in the village. [PAG] (p5)</p></div></div></body></div>",West Northamptonshire,Upper Stowe,England,"Internal flooding has been reported at a residential property on Francis Row, Upper Stowe on more than one occasion in the last five years, prompting a Section 19 investigation. (p4)
