Lancashire Fire and Rescue Service attended the Lowerhouse Lane area and requested assistance from Burnley Borough Council; the council provided prompt assistance during the flooding response. [PAG] (p13)
The 6 June 2016 (sic) rainfall caused particularly damaging flooding across Burnley district; adverse effects in the Lowerhouse area were exacerbated by defects in a historic culverted watercourse. (p17)",,GB-LAN_15_2016-06-08.html,GB-LAN_15_2016-06-08,Lancashire flooding 08 Jun 2016,8 June 2016 Flood In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation – Covering Report,069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-8-june-2016-flooding.pdf
