GB-CAM,16,2020-12-23,52.3143886,-0.1865002,"<div id=""html_8adb1ab7ff1ceaf2d1d7eb0f369085d8"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Berry Lane, Godmanchester</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>External highway flooding was reported on Berry Lane. [TAB] (p10)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>External flooding with highway flooding that cut off access to properties. [TAB,PAG] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>External (highway) inundation by surface water flooding. [TAB] (p13)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water backed up into Berry Lane from the adjacent brook when brook levels were elevated; a flapped outfall sits only just above normal water level which causes back&ndash;up of surface water into Berry Lane during high brook levels. [TAB,PAG] (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Berry Lane is subject to flooding risk; a proposal to raise the lane was evaluated to prevent future flooding (with consideration of displacement of flood water). The watercourse running north/south of Berry Lane was reviewed to ensure no obstructions to its outfall into the River Great Ouse. Flood Alert text was amended to include Berry Lane among roads likely to be affected at the alert level. (p18)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>10 properties [TAB,PAG] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>0 properties [TAB] (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Berry Lane, Godmanchester",England,"External highway flooding was reported on Berry Lane. [TAB] (p10)
