ernal); 1 property (external); 60 cm (internal) (p5)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>26 flood surveys sent; 3 flood surveys received [TAB] (p27)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>50 cm internal depth (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Leechcroft Avenue, Swanley",England,"Residential properties were flooded — reports include internal and external flooding; flood depths reported up to 60 cm internally during the October event. [TAB,MUL] (p3)
