approximately 30 cm internal flood depth (p13)",GB-KEN_14_2020-02-09.html,GB-KEN_14_2020-02-09,Five Oak Green flooding 09 Feb 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Five Oak Green,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Five-Oak-Green.pdf
GB-KEN,14,2020-02-09,51.1802221,0.3632885,"<div id=""html_e01f48483b75f36c5e21d83338e3cc82"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Badsell Road, Five Oak Green</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>5 properties flooded internally, with reports of up to 15 cm of floodwater within properties. [TAB] (p3)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>5 properties [TAB] (p3)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Badsell Road, Five Oak Green",England,"5 properties flooded internally, with reports of up to 15 cm of floodwater within properties. [TAB] (p3)",5 properties [TAB] (p3),GB-KEN_14_2020-02-09.html,GB-KEN_14_2020-02-09,Five Oak Green flooding 09 Feb 2020,Flood Investigation Report: Five Oak Green,063/Kent/Section-19-flooding-report-for-Five-Oak-Green.pdf
