GB-LAN,3,2017-11-22,53.8790402,-2.1717795,"<div id=""html_530f99da74eda24e91a830d51d6f8b88"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Pendle</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The indicative map of reported incidents on 22 November 2017 shows flooding reports occurring in the Pendle district. [IMG] (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Pendle,England,The indicative map of reported incidents on 22 November 2017 shows flooding reports occurring in the Pendle district. [IMG] (p13),,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22.html,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22,Lancashire flooding 22 Nov 2017 - 23 Nov 2017,22/23 November 2017 Floods In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation,069/Lancashire County/covering-report-nov-2017-section-19.pdf
