Community in Caton experienced flooding during the 22/23 November 2017 rainfall event; local people reported their experiences to RMAs and a recovery/drop–in meeting was held (at The Victoria Institute) where RMAs collected additional flood reports to inform investigations. (p15)",,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22.html,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22,Lancashire flooding 22 Nov 2017 - 23 Nov 2017,22/23 November 2017 Floods In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation,069/Lancashire County/covering-report-nov-2017-section-19.pdf
