GB-LAN,3,2017-11-22,54.18106605880378,-2.6123483446235958,"<div id=""html_151beb85b7c2cddbb802ac64eae4bb5a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Whittington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Whittington was one of the isolated villages affected by flooding as the rainfall track moved north&ndash;east up the Lune Valley. (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Whittington,England,Whittington was one of the isolated villages affected by flooding as the rainfall track moved north–east up the Lune Valley. (p12),,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22.html,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22,Lancashire flooding 22 Nov 2017 - 23 Nov 2017,22/23 November 2017 Floods In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation,069/Lancashire County/covering-report-nov-2017-section-19.pdf
GB-LAN,3,2017-11-22,54.1798867,-2.5182764,"<div id=""html_cd774a7a07e21ad3b70053ac0189374a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ireby</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Ireby was reached by the north&ndash;east travelling flood track and was identified among the locations affected. (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Ireby,England,Ireby was reached by the north–east travelling flood track and was identified among the locations affected. (p12),,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22.html,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22,Lancashire flooding 22 Nov 2017 - 23 Nov 2017,22/23 November 2017 Floods In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation,069/Lancashire County/covering-report-nov-2017-section-19.pdf
GB-LAN,3,2017-11-22,53.9978592,-2.785093,"<div id=""html_cae736ee16871717806c81702b7fe75d"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ellel</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Watercourses overtopped their banks causing high volumes of water to encroach into homes and outbuildings and to obstruct highways in the Ellel area. (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Ellel,England,Watercourses overtopped their banks causing high volumes of water to encroach into homes and outbuildings and to obstruct highways in the Ellel area. (p13),,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22.html,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22,Lancashire flooding 22 Nov 2017 - 23 Nov 2017,22/23 November 2017 Floods In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation,069/Lancashire County/covering-report-nov-2017-section-19.pdf
GB-LAN,3,2017-11-22,54.0378953,-2.7913711,"<div id=""html_691963bb34d178367f8d6349a65575fd"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Bowerham</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Bowerham (South Lancaster) was identified among the affected localities during the 22/23 November 2017 event; a community meeting was held at the Barton Road community centre and residents provided reports to RMAs for investigation. (p15)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Bowerham,England,Bowerham (South Lancaster) was identified among the affected localities during the 22/23 November 2017 event; a community meeting was held at the Barton Road community centre and residents provided reports to RMAs for investigation. (p15),,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22.html,GB-LAN_3_2017-11-22,Lancashire flooding 22 Nov 2017 - 23 Nov 2017,22/23 November 2017 Floods In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation,069/Lancashire County/covering-report-nov-2017-section-19.pdf
