GB-NNH,22,2020-12-23,52.5056204,-0.7017727,"<div id=""html_0623bc781a2cd6035885e631f793ac03"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Rockingham Road, Corby</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Church property on Rockingham Road was the subject of a Section 19 flood investigation by the Lead Local Flood Authority (North Northamptonshire Council). (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water from intense short&ndash;duration rainfall overwhelmed drainage and flowed to low points in and around properties on Rockingham Road, resulting in internal flooding of a church property at that location. (p6)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Location of the flooded church property; flooding at this address resulted in internal inundation of the building on site. (p8)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>one building (p6)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 building (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Northamptonshire,"Rockingham Road, Corby",England,"Church property on Rockingham Road was the subject of a Section 19 flood investigation by the Lead Local Flood Authority (North Northamptonshire Council). (p2)
