GB-KEN,17,2019-06-10,51.32979115526456,0.44560732065182546,"<div id=""html_47cfc22e975f89913478fcbb81285623"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>High Street, Snodland</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Water reached the property; garden was flooded. No confirmation that water entered the building. [TAB] (p2)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property affected [TAB] (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"High Street, Snodland",England,Water reached the property; garden was flooded. No confirmation that water entered the building. [TAB] (p2),1 property affected [TAB] (p2),GB-KEN_17_2019-06-10.html,GB-KEN_17_2019-06-10,Snodland flooding 10 Jun 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Snodland,063/Kent/Snodland-section-19-flood-investigation-report.pdf
GB-KEN,17,2019-06-10,51.3350873,0.4449505,"<div id=""html_d68017ea50cdd22f94b4367b0221f26c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Holborough Road, Snodland</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding to one property; water reached around 10 inches. [TAB] (p2)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property affected [TAB] (p2)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Holborough Road, Snodland",England,Internal flooding to one property; water reached around 10 inches. [TAB] (p2),1 property affected [TAB] (p2),GB-KEN_17_2019-06-10.html,GB-KEN_17_2019-06-10,Snodland flooding 10 Jun 2019,Flood Investigation Report: Snodland,063/Kent/Snodland-section-19-flood-investigation-report.pdf
GB-KEN,17,2019-06-10,51.324657,0.439313,"<div id=""html_75dcb1c484afac6d9e56bbbb50b51766"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>St Katherine's Lane, Snodland</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding to one property. [TAB] (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overland flow from the school playing field and runoff from roofs/carparks flowed onto the highway and into the school buildings. Floodwater entered the school affecting classrooms; sections of the flat roof collapsed and the privately owned rising main surcharged within the main building causing extensive damage to the property. Surface water also overwhelmed the highway drainage on St Katherines Lane. (p9)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Highway drainage and gullies were found blocked after the flood: 3 of the 18 gullies were full. A partially completed CCTV survey found a complete blockage within one section of the highway drainage system and numerous smaller defects; a full CCTV survey is outstanding. (p10)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property affected [TAB] (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>18 classrooms; one property; 6 inches water depth (p9)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 of the 18 gullies (p10)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"St Katherine's Lane, Snodland",England,"Internal flooding to one property. [TAB] (p2)
Overland flow from the school playing field and runoff from roofs/carparks flowed onto the highway and into the school buildings. Floodwater entered the school affecting classrooms; sections of the flat roof collapsed and the privately owned rising main surcharged within the main building causing extensive damage to the property. Surface water also overwhelmed the highway drainage on St Katherines Lane. (p9)
