Area adjacent to Scraptoft Brook experienced surface water inundation during the event; flood impact zones (red–outlined on the map) lie directly alongside the brook and extend into Abbots Road South properties and nearby streets. [IMG] (p31)
Surface–water flow route along garage access adjacent to the Scraptoft Brook affected Abbots Road South / St Marys Avenue, causing flooding to properties. [TAB] (p34)",,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22.html,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22,Leicester Unitary Authority flooding 22 Jun 2023,Flood Investigation Report of the Flood Event Thursday 22nd June 2023 (South and East Leicester City),071/Leicester/flood-investigation-report-22-06-2023-section-19/v2-0.pdf
