GB-LCE,1,2023-06-22,52.625335,-1.1051287,"<div id=""html_d5b9b7dd264359cbc60c21761d00ca4a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Hazelwood Road, Leicester Unitary Authority</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding associated with the Evington Brook affected Hazelwood Road; flood impact areas are marked adjacent to the brook and surface water flow routes indicate water spread into Hazelwood Road, threatening or impacting properties and local infrastructure close to the watercourse. [IMG] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Leicester,"Hazelwood Road, Leicester Unitary Authority",England,"Surface water flooding associated with the Evington Brook affected Hazelwood Road; flood impact areas are marked adjacent to the brook and surface water flow routes indicate water spread into Hazelwood Road, threatening or impacting properties and local infrastructure close to the watercourse. [IMG] (p30)",,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22.html,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22,Leicester Unitary Authority flooding 22 Jun 2023,Flood Investigation Report of the Flood Event Thursday 22nd June 2023 (South and East Leicester City),071/Leicester/flood-investigation-report-22-06-2023-section-19/v2-0.pdf
GB-LCE,1,2023-06-22,52.6263406,-1.1063608,"<div id=""html_3230fb99dd11c7268f27de9f630e6327"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Osmaston Road, Stoneygate</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding associated with the Evington Brook affected Osmaston Road; flood impact areas and flow routes are shown adjacent to the brook and indicate water ingress and accumulation on Osmaston Road, putting nearby properties and infrastructure at risk or impacted. [IMG] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Leicester,"Osmaston Road, Stoneygate",England,"Surface water flooding associated with the Evington Brook affected Osmaston Road; flood impact areas and flow routes are shown adjacent to the brook and indicate water ingress and accumulation on Osmaston Road, putting nearby properties and infrastructure at risk or impacted. [IMG] (p30)",,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22.html,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22,Leicester Unitary Authority flooding 22 Jun 2023,Flood Investigation Report of the Flood Event Thursday 22nd June 2023 (South and East Leicester City),071/Leicester/flood-investigation-report-22-06-2023-section-19/v2-0.pdf
GB-LCE,1,2023-06-22,52.6289751,-1.1028365,"<div id=""html_dbf2895d51f8125cecc2e4e8b665df36"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Staveley Road, Leicester Unitary Authority</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface&ndash;water flooding concentrated along and adjacent to the Evington Brook in the Staveley Road area. Flood Impact Areas are outlined near Hazelwood Road, Osmaston Road and Merlyn Road, with surface water following the brook north&ndash;to&ndash;south and spreading into adjacent streets. [IMG] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Leicester,"Staveley Road, Leicester Unitary Authority",England,"Surface–water flooding concentrated along and adjacent to the Evington Brook in the Staveley Road area. Flood Impact Areas are outlined near Hazelwood Road, Osmaston Road and Merlyn Road, with surface water following the brook north–to–south and spreading into adjacent streets. [IMG] (p30)",,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22.html,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22,Leicester Unitary Authority flooding 22 Jun 2023,Flood Investigation Report of the Flood Event Thursday 22nd June 2023 (South and East Leicester City),071/Leicester/flood-investigation-report-22-06-2023-section-19/v2-0.pdf
GB-LCE,1,2023-06-22,52.615953,-1.1241993,"<div id=""html_c848d7cf1d391e90f11c33d47e4e095c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Thurlow Road, Leicester Unitary Authority</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A Flood Impact Area is marked near the intersection of Queens Road and Thurlow Road, with surface&ndash;water flow directed into this area causing accumulation on Thurlow Road and nearby residential streets. [IMG] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Leicester,"Thurlow Road, Leicester Unitary Authority",England,"A Flood Impact Area is marked near the intersection of Queens Road and Thurlow Road, with surface–water flow directed into this area causing accumulation on Thurlow Road and nearby residential streets. [IMG] (p30)",,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22.html,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22,Leicester Unitary Authority flooding 22 Jun 2023,Flood Investigation Report of the Flood Event Thursday 22nd June 2023 (South and East Leicester City),071/Leicester/flood-investigation-report-22-06-2023-section-19/v2-0.pdf
GB-LCE,1,2023-06-22,52.6173997,-1.1201744,"<div id=""html_53ecca9672f6a4605a200f9357a663ad"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>St Leonards Road, Clarendon Park</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A Flood Impact Area is marked on St. Leonards Road, indicating surface&ndash;water accumulation and flooding of the street and nearby properties. [IMG] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Leicester,"St Leonards Road, Clarendon Park",England,"A Flood Impact Area is marked on St. Leonards Road, indicating surface–water accumulation and flooding of the street and nearby properties. [IMG] (p30)",,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22.html,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22,Leicester Unitary Authority flooding 22 Jun 2023,Flood Investigation Report of the Flood Event Thursday 22nd June 2023 (South and East Leicester City),071/Leicester/flood-investigation-report-22-06-2023-section-19/v2-0.pdf
