Evington Brook at Spinney Hills Park experienced a rapid rise in river level on the afternoon of 22/06/2023, peaking around 17:15 before gradually receding through the evening. [IMG] (p33)
Overland surface–water / pluvial flows along Deepdale and low spots (e.g. Rockingham Close) caused flooding to properties in the Evington ward. [TAB,PAG] (p34)",peak ≈ 1.2 m [IMG] (p33),GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22.html,GB-LCE_1_2023-06-22,Leicester Unitary Authority flooding 22 Jun 2023,Flood Investigation Report of the Flood Event Thursday 22nd June 2023 (South and East Leicester City),071/Leicester/flood-investigation-report-22-06-2023-section-19/v2-0.pdf
