GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.59278933423031,-2.2651950359338797,"<div id=""html_2a13705cb07a21e0ca840a67e45f88d0"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>J2 Business Park</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding to properties/units at J2 Business Park due to main river flooding. [TAB] (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A large cluster of properties adjacent to the main river near J2 Business Park were flooded; the flooded area lies within Flood Zone 3 indicating river&ndash;sourced flooding affecting nearby properties. [IMG] (p79)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Units on the industrial/business park were flooded when the River Roch overtopped a weir and flowed into the site. Flooding inundated business premises and all accesses to them (via shutters and doors); water was fast, sudden, muddy and polluted. Businesses leasing multiple units suffered large financial losses and some owners considered relocating afterwards. (p81)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>10 properties [TAB] (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>49&ndash;60 properties [IMG] (p79)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,J2 Business Park,England,"Internal flooding to properties/units at J2 Business Park due to main river flooding. [TAB] (p17)
A large cluster of properties adjacent to the main river near J2 Business Park were flooded; the flooded area lies within Flood Zone 3 indicating river–sourced flooding affecting nearby properties. [IMG] (p79)
