GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.5464684,-2.3634759,"<div id=""html_c4ef32ac8a5893b067d8797594152da9"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Langcliffe Place, Ringley</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flood marker and photo evidence show apartments on Stoneclough Rise (Langcliffe Place) were flooded, with water entering to a level that would have affected ground&ndash;floor windows and internal spaces. [IMG] (p44)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>apartments flooded up to 200mm [IMG] (p44)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,"Langcliffe Place, Ringley",England,"Flood marker and photo evidence show apartments on Stoneclough Rise (Langcliffe Place) were flooded, with water entering to a level that would have affected ground–floor windows and internal spaces. [IMG] (p44)",apartments flooded up to 200mm [IMG] (p44),GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
