GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.5738503,-2.4952239,"<div id=""html_ea8f957bf958529e4616442ff92a22d6"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ashridge Close, Lostock</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The culvert beneath Ashridge Close gardens was overwhelmed, leading to local flooding when the culvert/screen blocked; debris at the inlet exacerbated flooding. (p47)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,"Ashridge Close, Lostock",England,"The culvert beneath Ashridge Close gardens was overwhelmed, leading to local flooding when the culvert/screen blocked; debris at the inlet exacerbated flooding. (p47)",,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.5763371,-2.5012906,"<div id=""html_e18fb4e92b5155dcd768befe545f5b8c"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Regent Road, Horwich</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding occurred where the long culvert beneath Regent Road and the railway embankment was overwhelmed, contributing to inundation of adjacent properties when the culvert/screen blocked. (p47)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,"Regent Road, Horwich",England,"Flooding occurred where the long culvert beneath Regent Road and the railway embankment was overwhelmed, contributing to inundation of adjacent properties when the culvert/screen blocked. (p47)",,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
