GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.586356366579764,-2.526872037126084,"<div id=""html_f723d6a3824e5ffef57500e5adc07cd5"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Chorley New Road, Horwich</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Basement/cellar flooding to residential properties attributed likely to a surface water sewer. (p53)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>5 homes (p53)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,"Chorley New Road, Horwich",England,Basement/cellar flooding to residential properties attributed likely to a surface water sewer. (p53),5 homes (p53),GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
