GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.579591,-2.3091353,"<div id=""html_9b1bb1e1a42604e79c218a38601f219b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Warth Road, Bury</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties along Warth Road experienced flooding when water flowed from under the Metrolink; area identified as one of the main concentrations of the 671 flooded properties. [PAG] (p61)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Warth Road was inundated by floodwater from the River Irwell. The carriageway and street furniture were submerged and vehicles were partially or almost entirely underwater; flood flows entered the area (reported as flowing from under the Metrolink) and residential and commercial properties in the vicinity were flooded. (p62)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>671 properties flooded (most located along Warth Road and Radcliffe Road) (p62)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,"Warth Road, Bury",England,"Properties along Warth Road experienced flooding when water flowed from under the Metrolink; area identified as one of the main concentrations of the 671 flooded properties. [PAG] (p61)
Warth Road was inundated by floodwater from the River Irwell. The carriageway and street furniture were submerged and vehicles were partially or almost entirely underwater; flood flows entered the area (reported as flowing from under the Metrolink) and residential and commercial properties in the vicinity were flooded. (p62)",671 properties flooded (most located along Warth Road and Radcliffe Road) (p62),GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.5810203,-2.3028947,"<div id=""html_8c64b73a78a0273fd869b3aa54c34a24"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Radcliffe Road, Bury</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties along Radcliffe Road were flooded as part of the main cluster of 671 flooded properties; floodwater routed along this road from the river/adjacent flows. [PAG] (p61)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residential properties and front gardens on Radcliffe Road were flooded by water associated with the River Irwell event; floodwater flowed through nearby streets (York Street/Dumers Lane, Morris Street) affecting homes and businesses and causing both immediate and longer&ndash;term disruption to local businesses. (p62)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater from a blocked culverted watercourse/overflowing carriageway on Warth Fold Road flowed across Radcliffe Road onto farmland, causing inundation of the road and contributing to local flooding impacts. (p69)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,"Radcliffe Road, Bury",England,"Properties along Radcliffe Road were flooded as part of the main cluster of 671 flooded properties; floodwater routed along this road from the river/adjacent flows. [PAG] (p61)
Residential properties and front gardens on Radcliffe Road were flooded by water associated with the River Irwell event; floodwater flowed through nearby streets (York Street/Dumers Lane, Morris Street) affecting homes and businesses and causing both immediate and longer–term disruption to local businesses. (p62)
Floodwater from a blocked culverted watercourse/overflowing carriageway on Warth Fold Road flowed across Radcliffe Road onto farmland, causing inundation of the road and contributing to local flooding impacts. (p69)",,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
