GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.5730522,-2.2977402,"<div id=""html_65610bafcf024be7c37b675a95375e03"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Dumers Lane, Bury</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater flowed over the cleared site on York Street and along Dumers Lane, inundating the street and contributing to local property flooding in the Radcliffe area. (p61)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>671 properties flooded (total across affected locations including Dumers Lane) (p61)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,"Dumers Lane, Bury",England,"Floodwater flowed over the cleared site on York Street and along Dumers Lane, inundating the street and contributing to local property flooding in the Radcliffe area. (p61)",671 properties flooded (total across affected locations including Dumers Lane) (p61),GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
