GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.53240719377115,-1.9996887231695895,"<div id=""html_7ee77c8106411864ba2a3a446b67bdd3"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Greenfield</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding to properties caused by surface water flooding. [TAB] (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding caused internal flooding to residential properties in Greenfield. (p88)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties [TAB] (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties (p88)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,Greenfield,England,"Internal flooding to properties caused by surface water flooding. [TAB] (p17)
