GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.5480772,-2.6163892,"<div id=""html_17949d24ba2fb1573498151ef7cfab46"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Scholes</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding to a property caused by sewer flooding. [TAB] (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property [TAB] (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,Scholes,England,Internal flooding to a property caused by sewer flooding. [TAB] (p17),1 property [TAB] (p17),GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
GB-BOL,2,2015-12-26,53.5382578,-2.0733461,"<div id=""html_545c36c6691c80e4c488330d8b17c9ae"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Lees</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding to properties caused by surface water flooding. [TAB] (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding caused internal flooding to residential properties in Lees. (p88)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties [TAB] (p17)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties (p88)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bolton,Lees,England,"Internal flooding to properties caused by surface water flooding. [TAB] (p17)
