A flood warning was issued for Lilford Park Brook at Lilford and sandbags were distributed to previously identified drop–off points for use by the council and residents; Environment Agency gauge in the Lilford Park Basin recorded its highest level in 10 years (1.3 m higher than the previous highest). [PAG] (p156)",14 properties flooded [TAB] (p17),GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26.html,GB-BOL_2_2015-12-26,Greater Manchester flooding 26 Dec 2015,Flood Investigation Report: Greater Manchester 26 December 2015,010/Bolton/010/2015/Bolton/Boxing/Day/2015///Flood/report.pdf
