Prestolee was affected by very high river levels at the River Irwell (included in the same flood–warning area as Ringley Bridges) and localised bank failure nearby; future defensive options (a raised left–bank wall) were proposed to protect Prestolee following the event. (p45)","57 properties (Prestolee and Stoneclough) [TAB] (p17)
