GB-LAN,16,2016-08-21,53.90612885897809,-2.768732898475416,"<div id=""html_f693861d1a7a2111d0c4265984dc8d1e"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Garstang Flood Basin</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Activated by the Environment Agency at 05:30 on 22 Aug 2016 to manage runoff; reached full capacity at 15:30 on 22 Aug 2016 but River Wyre levels continued rising until 16:30 so flows exceeded the basin's capacity. (p14)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Garstang Flood Basin,England,Activated by the Environment Agency at 05:30 on 22 Aug 2016 to manage runoff; reached full capacity at 15:30 on 22 Aug 2016 but River Wyre levels continued rising until 16:30 so flows exceeded the basin's capacity. (p14),,GB-LAN_16_2016-08-21.html,GB-LAN_16_2016-08-21,Lancashire flooding 21 Aug 2016 - 23 Aug 2016,21-23 August 2016 Flooding In Lancashire: Section 19 Investigation Report,069/Lancashire County/section-19-flood-investigation-report-august-2016-flooding.pdf
