GB-IOW,2,2023-10-25,50.76444055427964,-1.2836171351979033,"<div id=""html_0a4c1d788042739854763f09fafff3d0"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Esplanade, East Cowes</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The Esplanade is specifically noted as regularly flooded by the Medina Estuary and the Solent during high tides and was one of the areas affected in the October 2023 event. Flooding was influenced by tidal inundation (high tide/tide locking) and by extreme rainfall leading to overloaded local drainage and combined sewer systems, contributing to road and nearby property flooding. (p33)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"Esplanade, East Cowes",England,"The Esplanade is specifically noted as regularly flooded by the Medina Estuary and the Solent during high tides and was one of the areas affected in the October 2023 event. Flooding was influenced by tidal inundation (high tide/tide locking) and by extreme rainfall leading to overloaded local drainage and combined sewer systems, contributing to road and nearby property flooding. (p33)",,GB-IOW_2_2023-10-25.html,GB-IOW_2_2023-10-25,East Cowes flooding 25 Oct 2023,East Cowes - Section 19 Flood Investigation,059/Isle of Wight/Section 19 flood investigation East Cowes Sept 2024.pdf
