Surface water (pluvial) runoff concentrated into topographic low points and along the estuary shoreline, causing flooding in and around the Ferry Terminal area and central East Cowes. Roads identified as being impacted by the October 2023 event include Dover Road, Well Road, Castle Street, Marsh Road and Link Road; the Well Road roundabout and central discharge points for watercourses/surface water routes were also affected. [IMG] (p19)
