GB-CON,1,2012-10-17,50.330814,-4.5125237,"<div id=""html_c9396b39b1520bca8fea8ef87bf6f6f7"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>The Warren, Polperro</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>A blocked culvert caused surface water flooding to lower properties on The Warren and restricted access to some properties. Impacts were described as minor but assessment was difficult because many properties are holiday homes. (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>At least 6 properties (total across Polperro) (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cornwall,"The Warren, Polperro",England,A blocked culvert caused surface water flooding to lower properties on The Warren and restricted access to some properties. Impacts were described as minor but assessment was difficult because many properties are holiday homes. (p17),At least 6 properties (total across Polperro) (p17),GB-CON_1_2012-10-17_etc.html,GB-CON_1_2012-10-17_etc,Cornwall flooding 17 Oct 2012 - 22 Dec 2012,Flood Investigation Reports 2012,027/Cornwall/027/2012/Cornwall/flood-investigation-report-2012.pdf
