GB-KEN,4,2015-08-24,51.1315473,0.2633986,"<div id=""html_29906b631693a6da5eadb9c401be639d"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Mount Pleasant Road, Tunbridge Wells</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Highway flooded and at least one commercial property suffered internal flooding. [TAB,PAG] (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding was reported on Mount Pleasant Road, near Tunbridge Wells railway station (marked on Figure 1), and is identified as a location under investigation for the 24 August 2015 event. [IMG] (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Highway flooded with water collecting at the lowest point, reaching depths of up to 0.3m; water flowed through doorways into a nearby commercial property causing flooding to the ground floor and basement. [IMG,PAG] (p26)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 commercial property [TAB,PAG] (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>one commercial property; 0.3m depth [IMG,PAG] (p26)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Mount Pleasant Road, Tunbridge Wells",England,"Highway flooded and at least one commercial property suffered internal flooding. [TAB,PAG] (p7)
