Public combined sewer capacity was exceeded during the 24 August 2015 event, causing flooding across the town; a concrete blockage in a combined sewer lateral (recovered from the pipe) likely increased the extent of flooding. Internal flooding of properties in the area between Cumberland Walk, Nevill Park and Warwick Park was reported on 13 Aug, 16 Sep and 21 Sep (subsequent events). [MUL] (p18)
