GB-DBY,5,2023-10-18,53.0159171,-1.735558,"<div id=""html_4d01c5d7fae62046d1fb9b0fb40d50e7"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Station Road, Ashbourne</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flow routes mapped for Storm Babet indicate Henmore Brook overtopped or escaped and directed floodwater toward the area around Station Road; the map highlights areas near Station Road as points where water escaped the brook during the event. [IMG] (p7)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Station Road, Ashbourne",England,Flow routes mapped for Storm Babet indicate Henmore Brook overtopped or escaped and directed floodwater toward the area around Station Road; the map highlights areas near Station Road as points where water escaped the brook during the event. [IMG] (p7),,GB-DBY_5_2023-10-18.html,GB-DBY_5_2023-10-18,Derbyshire flooding 18 Oct 2023 - 21 Oct 2023,Derbyshire County Council Section 19 Investigation Report – Storm Babet 18/10/23 – 21/10/23,034/Derbyshire County/034/2023/Derbyshire County/section-5-dove-catchment-final-storm-babet-dcc-section-19-report.pdf
