10)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>5 homes; 3 commercial properties (including properties on Uttoxeter Road) [PAG,IMG] (p11)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>7 properties internally flooded; internal flood depth almost 1 m at some properties [PAG] (p12)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>7 properties internally flooded on Uttoxeter Road [PAG,IMG] (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Uttoxeter Road, Hilton",England,"Internal flooding of residential properties and a business located on Uttoxeter Road in Hilton, caused by overtopping/overflow from the local watercourse (Hilton Brook / relief channel). [IMG] (p9)
