GB-DBY,5,2023-10-18,52.8728235,-1.6387888,"<div id=""html_2848d76eeae1894671bb6849c1c546b3"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Main Street, Hilton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Portion of Main Street lies within the Environment Agency Flood Warning Area and adjacent Flood Zone 3 along Hilton Brook; areas around Main Street are identified as having high surface water flood risk and are within the zones where properties in Hilton experienced internal flooding during Storm Babet. This places Main Street within the area directly affected by river and surface&ndash;water flooding risk during the event (exact properties on Main Street not individually named). [PAG,IMG] (p10)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>4 residential properties; 2 commercial properties (these flooded properties are within the Hilton community as a whole) [PAG,IMG] (p10)</p></div></div></body></div>",Derbyshire,"Main Street, Hilton",England,"Portion of Main Street lies within the Environment Agency Flood Warning Area and adjacent Flood Zone 3 along Hilton Brook; areas around Main Street are identified as having high surface water flood risk and are within the zones where properties in Hilton experienced internal flooding during Storm Babet. This places Main Street within the area directly affected by river and surface–water flooding risk during the event (exact properties on Main Street not individually named). [PAG,IMG] (p10)","4 residential properties; 2 commercial properties (these flooded properties are within the Hilton community as a whole) [PAG,IMG] (p10)",GB-DBY_5_2023-10-18.html,GB-DBY_5_2023-10-18,Derbyshire flooding 18 Oct 2023 - 21 Oct 2023,Derbyshire County Council Section 19 Investigation Report – Storm Babet 18/10/23 – 21/10/23,034/Derbyshire County/034/2023/Derbyshire County/section-5-dove-catchment-final-storm-babet-dcc-section-19-report.pdf
