Property flooding caused by bourne water surcharging from a culvert in Dale Road. [TAB] (p26)
Floodwater flowed from Dale Road toward Foxley Hill Road causing inundation of the street and flooding at the rear of residential properties (photographed at Liddell Court). Sandbags were deployed to protect buildings. [IMG] (p34)
