water supply served by the WTW that pumping was protecting) [IMG] (p31)</p></div></div></body></div>",Croydon,"Godstone Road, Kenley",England,"Residential properties on Godstone Road were affected by flooding associated with the Caterham Bourne event, driven primarily by exceptional groundwater rise and with combined influences from surface water and sewers. (p6)
