GB-CRY,1,2013-12-01,51.3427789,-0.106881,"<div id=""html_a111cac8f2b0761ffa6849b063607af2"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Purley Park Road, Purley</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Residential properties on Lansdown Road and Purley Park Road were flooded due to exceptionally high groundwater levels; surface water and surcharging sewers also contributed to the flooding. (p6)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Garden flooding caused by very high groundwater levels. [TAB] (p26)</p></div></div></body></div>",Croydon,"Purley Park Road, Purley",England,"Residential properties on Lansdown Road and Purley Park Road were flooded due to exceptionally high groundwater levels; surface water and surcharging sewers also contributed to the flooding. (p6)
