GB-KEN,8,2018-05-29,51.3749384,0.7220485,"<div id=""html_da711ece9f57e8d8fb46f7f461e4281a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Meadow Brown View, Iwade</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding to residential properties on Meadow Brown View. [TAB] (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overland flow from an adjacent field overtopped a small bund and flowed onto the road, causing surface water flooding that affected property exteriors and led to floodwater entering garages. (p16)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding occurred when water from an adjacent field flowed over a low bund (designed to protect the road) that was overwhelmed, allowing water onto Meadow Brown View. (p21)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Meadow Brown View was affected by overland surface water flow from adjacent fields; the developer failed to install the required drainage channel to intercept this overland flow, a breach passed to the local planning authority. (p38)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 properties [TAB] (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>5 properties affected externally; 3 properties with floodwater entered garages (p16)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Meadow Brown View, Iwade",England,"Internal flooding to residential properties on Meadow Brown View. [TAB] (p7)
Overland flow from an adjacent field overtopped a small bund and flowed onto the road, causing surface water flooding that affected property exteriors and led to floodwater entering garages. (p16)
