GB-KEN,8,2018-05-29,51.3458546,0.7565813,"<div id=""html_399826cfc099d3349d7b8e0440c9181a"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Hugh Price Close, Murston</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Gullies opposite No.57 cleansed and confirmed free&ndash;flowing during post&ndash;flood maintenance. [TAB] (p35)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Hugh Price Close, Murston",England,Gullies opposite No.57 cleansed and confirmed free–flowing during post–flood maintenance. [TAB] (p35),,GB-KEN_8_2018-05-29.html,GB-KEN_8_2018-05-29,Swale flooding 29 May 2018,Flood Investigation Report: Flooding Affecting the Swale Area On 29 May 2018,063/Kent/Flooding-report-affecting-the-Swale-area-of-Kent-on-29-May-2018.pdf
GB-KEN,8,2018-05-29,51.3536053,0.7193351,"<div id=""html_2e02d95f7c2b43ebbbace59ce5d36ea5"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Olivine Close, Milton Regis</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Gullies on London Road (between Staplehurst Road and Sandford Road) and at Monarch Drive, Olivine Close, Park Drive and Prince Charles Avenue were cleansed and returned to free flowing condition as part of post&ndash;flood drainage maintenance. (p35)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,"Olivine Close, Milton Regis",England,"Gullies on London Road (between Staplehurst Road and Sandford Road) and at Monarch Drive, Olivine Close, Park Drive and Prince Charles Avenue were cleansed and returned to free flowing condition as part of post–flood drainage maintenance. (p35)",,GB-KEN_8_2018-05-29.html,GB-KEN_8_2018-05-29,Swale flooding 29 May 2018,Flood Investigation Report: Flooding Affecting the Swale Area On 29 May 2018,063/Kent/Flooding-report-affecting-the-Swale-area-of-Kent-on-29-May-2018.pdf
