GB-KEN,8,2018-05-29,51.3329943,0.7651554,"<div id=""html_b1a1002827e3a65c1ae648a066b9b344"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Bapchild</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding and external flooding affected properties on The Street in Bapchild; one property suffered internal flooding and two other properties were flooded. (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Three properties on The Street were flooded when intense rainfall&ndash;generated runoff collected in a dry valley and on the street; low property thresholds allowed water to overtop thresholds and bow waves from passing vehicles exacerbated the flooding. (p32)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property internal flooding; 2 properties flooded (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties (p32)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,Bapchild,England,"Internal flooding and external flooding affected properties on The Street in Bapchild; one property suffered internal flooding and two other properties were flooded. (p8)
Three properties on The Street were flooded when intense rainfall–generated runoff collected in a dry valley and on the street; low property thresholds allowed water to overtop thresholds and bow waves from passing vehicles exacerbated the flooding. (p32)","1 property internal flooding; 2 properties flooded (p8)
