GB-KEN,8,2018-05-29,51.3093931,0.6919511,"<div id=""html_605a52cd28789e631080e4d4a9329ee1"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Bredgar</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Experienced localised surface water flooding during the intense rainfall event, caused by rapid runoff and overwhelmed drainage leading to water collecting in low points. (p32)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Rural run&ndash;off entered and overwhelmed the local drainage and a receiving ditch; village overflow and debris&ndash;blocked drains increased flows and caused property flooding. (p33)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>2 properties (p33)</p></div></div></body></div>",Kent,Bredgar,England,"Experienced localised surface water flooding during the intense rainfall event, caused by rapid runoff and overwhelmed drainage leading to water collecting in low points. (p32)
