GB-CAM,4,2014-08-08,52.2614263,0.0692658,"<div id=""html_3e0aeaf3baa8edce9b334c4a53289dab"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Oakington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding occurred in Oakington locations listed in the Formal Flood Investigation Report: Cambridge Road, Kettles Close and Arcadia Gardens (and also Longstanton Road, Orchard Way, The Broadway, Water Lane are listed as locations of the incident). The incident was reported in the Formal Flood Investigation (Reference FI/14/000046). (p2)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Experienced widespread flooding during the 8&ndash;9 August 2014 extreme rainfall event: drainage networks and receiving watercourses (including Oakington Brook) were overwhelmed, causing internal flooding to properties and external inundation; property level protection was partially installed for some properties but reported not to have operated as expected. [IMG,TAB,PAG] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Extreme rainfall on 8&ndash;9 August 2014 caused internal flooding of properties and external flooding to additional properties; community disruption and follow&ndash;up investigations and meetings were required. (p4)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>57 properties flooded internally; approximately 60 additional properties externally flooded; 5 to 60 cm (depths reported inside properties) [IMG,TAB,PAG] (p3)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>57 properties (internal flooded); 60 properties (external flooded) (p4)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,Oakington,England,"Flooding occurred in Oakington locations listed in the Formal Flood Investigation Report: Cambridge Road, Kettles Close and Arcadia Gardens (and also Longstanton Road, Orchard Way, The Broadway, Water Lane are listed as locations of the incident). The incident was reported in the Formal Flood Investigation (Reference FI/14/000046). (p2)
