Extreme rainfall on 8–9 August 2014 caused internal flooding of properties and external flooding to additional properties; community disruption and follow–up investigations and meetings were required. (p4)","57 properties flooded internally; approximately 60 additional properties externally flooded; 5 to 60 cm (depths reported inside properties) [IMG,TAB,PAG] (p3)
