GB-CAM,15,2020-12-23,52.2974849,-0.258883,"<div id=""html_e19d087bc54d35d07d234edda8cad2f5"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Taylors Lane, Buckden</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Properties reported with internal flooding and external flooding to gardens. [TAB] (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of residential properties reported by the Parish Council. [TAB,PAG] (p9)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding when local watercourses exceeded capacity; Anglian Water assets were overwhelmed causing foul sewer backup; internal flooding of properties and local road flooding that contributed to transport disruption (northern underpass flooded, road between Buckden Marina and the level crossing cut off an exit from the village). [PAG,IMG] (p10)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Surface water flooding as watercourses exceeded channel capacity causing properties to flood internally (up to specified depths) and gardens to flood; road access was cut off in the area when nearby roads/underpass flooded. [TAB] (p11)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 properties (internal) [TAB] (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>c.8 properties [TAB,PAG] (p9)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>c.8 properties [PAG,IMG] (p10)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>Properties internally up to a depth of 60cm; Gardens up to a depth of 91cm; 6 residents reported having to leave their properties for longer than 1 month [TAB] (p11)</p></div></div></body></div>",Cambridgeshire,"Taylors Lane, Buckden",England,"Properties reported with internal flooding and external flooding to gardens. [TAB] (p8)
