GB-LAN,5,2015-12-01,53.755695,-2.8527226,"<div id=""html_4df35a3820a17fc9e79c9338e1905c32"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Freckleton</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Location (Lower Lane in Freckleton) experienced surface water flooding including internal flooding of a commercial property and repeated external flooding events. [MUL] (p13)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 commercial property; 6 external flooding incidents [MUL] (p13)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Freckleton,England,Location (Lower Lane in Freckleton) experienced surface water flooding including internal flooding of a commercial property and repeated external flooding events. [MUL] (p13),1 commercial property; 6 external flooding incidents [MUL] (p13),GB-LAN_5_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_5_2015-12-01,Fylde flooding December 2015,Fylde District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/fylde-final-report.pdf
