Residential properties experienced internal flooding. (p37)
Five properties experienced internal flooding (reported up to 5 cm internally). Damage included subfloor, insulation, skirting board, floor coverings and low wall damage requiring replacement. Flooding originated from surface water runoff from the fields immediately to the rear/south of the properties. (p45)
