GB-IOW,4,2023-10-25,50.6906054,-1.3129354,"<div id=""html_a2039a65e8b881c94950d196f2285153"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Castle Street, Gunville</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The ford on Castle Street was observed flooded (photographs showing the ford looking north in October 2023 and looking south in February 2024). [MUL] (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Received a flood&ndash;related emergency call requiring flood rescue response. [TAB] (p35)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>High&ndash;velocity flow at the ford exceeded the flood barrier and flowed north up Castle Street; the Lukely Brook flowed out of bank to nearby properties. Surface water runoff from Carisbrook Road also contributed to flows reaching Castle Street. (p48)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>High&ndash;velocity flows at the Castle Street ford exceeded the flood barrier and flowed north along Castle Street, causing the Lukely Brook to flow out of bank and affect nearby properties. Surface&ndash;water runoff from Carisbrooke Road also contributed to flows onto Castle Street. [PAG,IMG] (p51)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 call [TAB] (p35)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"Castle Street, Gunville",England,"The ford on Castle Street was observed flooded (photographs showing the ford looking north in October 2023 and looking south in February 2024). [MUL] (p8)
Received a flood–related emergency call requiring flood rescue response. [TAB] (p35)
High–velocity flow at the ford exceeded the flood barrier and flowed north up Castle Street; the Lukely Brook flowed out of bank to nearby properties. Surface water runoff from Carisbrook Road also contributed to flows reaching Castle Street. (p48)
High–velocity flows at the Castle Street ford exceeded the flood barrier and flowed north along Castle Street, causing the Lukely Brook to flow out of bank and affect nearby properties. Surface–water runoff from Carisbrooke Road also contributed to flows onto Castle Street. [PAG,IMG] (p51)",1 call [TAB] (p35),GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25.html,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25,Newport flooding 25 Oct 2023,Newport Section 19 Flood Investigation,059/Isle of Wight/Section 19 flood investigation report Newport September 2024.pdf
GB-IOW,4,2023-10-25,50.6922056,-1.3082565,"<div id=""html_2a3c9601407ae4f7f148bd8c8583805d"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Carisbrooke Road, Newport</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Rear garden flooding of a Carisbrooke Road property (photograph shows rear garden flooding). (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"Carisbrooke Road, Newport",England,Rear garden flooding of a Carisbrooke Road property (photograph shows rear garden flooding). (p8),,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25.html,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25,Newport flooding 25 Oct 2023,Newport Section 19 Flood Investigation,059/Isle of Wight/Section 19 flood investigation report Newport September 2024.pdf
GB-IOW,4,2023-10-25,50.6908823,-1.3096033,"<div id=""html_cc5104904145c31ed623d317a21a96d7"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Spring Lane, Gunville</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Flooding observed on Spring Lane (photograph shows flooding looking southeast). (p8)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The Lukely Brook flowed over Spring Lane via a ford; water exceeded the ford/channel and flowed northwards toward Carisbrooke Road, indicating fluvial channel exceedance at this location. (p48)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Floodwater from the Lukely Brook exceeded the ford/channel and flowed across Spring Lane, producing muddy, fast&ndash;moving water that covered the carriageway and impeded vehicle and pedestrian access. [PAG,IMG] (p52)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"Spring Lane, Gunville",England,"Flooding observed on Spring Lane (photograph shows flooding looking southeast). (p8)
The Lukely Brook flowed over Spring Lane via a ford; water exceeded the ford/channel and flowed northwards toward Carisbrooke Road, indicating fluvial channel exceedance at this location. (p48)
Floodwater from the Lukely Brook exceeded the ford/channel and flowed across Spring Lane, producing muddy, fast–moving water that covered the carriageway and impeded vehicle and pedestrian access. [PAG,IMG] (p52)",,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25.html,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25,Newport flooding 25 Oct 2023,Newport Section 19 Flood Investigation,059/Isle of Wight/Section 19 flood investigation report Newport September 2024.pdf
