GB-IOW,4,2023-10-25,50.7007475,-1.2950553,"<div id=""html_8537e2f96c028fd12dfcc0620d3edcb5"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Lugley Street, Newport</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Sandbags were made available at the Lugley Street car park in Newport; Island Roads attended sites following resident calls after the 25 October flood and an employee attended the following day to unblock a drain. [TAB,MUL] (p35)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"Lugley Street, Newport",England,"Sandbags were made available at the Lugley Street car park in Newport; Island Roads attended sites following resident calls after the 25 October flood and an employee attended the following day to unblock a drain. [TAB,MUL] (p35)",,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25.html,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25,Newport flooding 25 Oct 2023,Newport Section 19 Flood Investigation,059/Isle of Wight/Section 19 flood investigation report Newport September 2024.pdf
GB-IOW,4,2023-10-25,50.696417,-1.281713,"<div id=""html_dd13146abc34a1ef02c97ef5c4ed57c1"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Garden Way, Newport</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Identified as an additional area of interest following the 25 October 2023 flooding event; subject to localised flood incidents during that event. Source&ndash;Pathway&ndash;Receptor model was not produced due to fewer reports of internal flooding and insufficient information to determine detailed flood mechanisms. (p37)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Fluvial flooding affected properties along Garden Way when the Pan Stream exceeded channel capacity; flooding originated from the Pan Stream and inundated surrounding properties. (p53)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"Garden Way, Newport",England,"Identified as an additional area of interest following the 25 October 2023 flooding event; subject to localised flood incidents during that event. Source–Pathway–Receptor model was not produced due to fewer reports of internal flooding and insufficient information to determine detailed flood mechanisms. (p37)
