GB-IOW,4,2023-10-25,50.6981281,-1.2892815,"<div id=""html_852ab4e6960925715b406fbc98a78607"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Furrlongs, Newport</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Listed alongside Mill Court as an additional area of interest for the 25 October 2023 flooding event; experienced localised flooding with insufficient internal flooding reports to enable a detailed Source&ndash;Pathway&ndash;Receptor model. (p37)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"Furrlongs, Newport",England,Listed alongside Mill Court as an additional area of interest for the 25 October 2023 flooding event; experienced localised flooding with insufficient internal flooding reports to enable a detailed Source–Pathway–Receptor model. (p37),,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25.html,GB-IOW_4_2023-10-25,Newport flooding 25 Oct 2023,Newport Section 19 Flood Investigation,059/Isle of Wight/Section 19 flood investigation report Newport September 2024.pdf
GB-IOW,4,2023-10-25,50.6985896,-1.3017514,"<div id=""html_63468dc2b5207094bf90795d9018adf8"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Caesars Road, Newport</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Identified in the report as an additional area of interest requiring Source&ndash;Pathway&ndash;Receptor analysis following the 25 October 2023 Newport flooding; part of the localised flood incidents referenced. (p37)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Lukely Brook overtopped/entered rear gardens on the north side of Caesars Road, flooding rear gardens and causing minor garden damage; levels were influenced by tidal conditions affecting drainage. [PAG] (p58)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Minor flood damage to rear gardens of properties on the north side where gardens back onto Lukely Brook; residents reported stress and ongoing anxiety related to subsequent rainfall and flood alerts. [PAG,IMG] (p59)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>up to 400mm in height [PAG] (p58)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>up to 400mm in height [PAG,IMG] (p59)</p></div></div></body></div>",Isle of Wight,"Caesars Road, Newport",England,"Identified in the report as an additional area of interest requiring Source–Pathway–Receptor analysis following the 25 October 2023 Newport flooding; part of the localised flood incidents referenced. (p37)
