GB-LAN,10,2015-12-26,53.7730282,-2.7947687,"<div id=""html_bf9ada7e195fe259f7e1d2375ccc5d51"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Lea Town</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding occurred in the community; one property (St Mary's RC Primary School) suffered internal flooding. (p12)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p12)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Lea Town,England,Internal flooding occurred in the community; one property (St Mary's RC Primary School) suffered internal flooding. (p12),1 property (p12),GB-LAN_10_2015-12-26.html,GB-LAN_10_2015-12-26,Preston flooding 26 Dec 2015,Preston District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/preston-final-report.pdf
GB-LAN,10,2015-12-26,53.779111,-2.7236044,"<div id=""html_f6ff135ce6d64f5517ffb402c2bb2e41"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Cadley</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>One property suffered internal flooding (internal water ingress to the dwelling). (p14)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 property (p14)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Cadley,England,One property suffered internal flooding (internal water ingress to the dwelling). (p14),1 property (p14),GB-LAN_10_2015-12-26.html,GB-LAN_10_2015-12-26,Preston flooding 26 Dec 2015,Preston District Flood Report Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/preston-final-report.pdf
