GB-BDF,2,2020-12-01,52.2730673,-0.6026703,"<div id=""html_ff9475c5cc172bf27ce8ceefd7bb4117"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Rushden Road, Bedford</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Rushden Road in Wymington was inundated with floodwater (nighttime photo shows water covering the road with visible ripples and currents), making the road impassable and contributing to obstruction of response efforts; left debris and siltation requiring cleanup. (p9)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,"Rushden Road, Bedford",England,"Rushden Road in Wymington was inundated with floodwater (nighttime photo shows water covering the road with visible ripples and currents), making the road impassable and contributing to obstruction of response efforts; left debris and siltation requiring cleanup. (p9)",,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-01.html,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-01,Bedford flooding December 2020,"Flood Investigation Report, Locations: Various across Bedford Borough, Flood Event: December 2020",005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Oct/2021.pdf
