GB-BDF,2,2020-12-01,52.2528751,-0.4758245,"<div id=""html_347297254bb63385d92df2bb8c2004db"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Riseley</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Internal flooding of a commercial property in Riseley caused by surface water; High Street reported impassable. [TAB,PAG] (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>River flooding affected Riseley on 23/12/2020 associated with Riseley Brook; a Flood Warning for Riseley (and Pertenhall) was issued on 23/12/2020 at 19:04. [TAB] (p14)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>LLFA officers communicated with the existing Community Flood Group; an Emergency Assistance Centre was stood up at Riseley to provide shelter and assistance on 23 December 2020. [PAG] (p16)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 commercial property [TAB,PAG] (p7)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,Riseley,England,"Internal flooding of a commercial property in Riseley caused by surface water; High Street reported impassable. [TAB,PAG] (p7)
