GB-BDF,2,2020-12-01,52.2687495,-0.601502,"<div id=""html_e9b5f4251088c8b64496aa7e00d6cabb"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Wymington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overflow of an unnamed ordinary watercourse (tributary to the River Nene) resulted in internal flooding of a commercial property and made Poddington Road impassable. [TAB,PAG] (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Rushden Road was inundated with flowing floodwater, with visible ripples and currents across the carriageway; the flooding caused road inundation and disrupted travel and access, hindering response and highways teams. [IMG] (p9)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>1 commercial [TAB,PAG] (p7)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,Wymington,England,"Overflow of an unnamed ordinary watercourse (tributary to the River Nene) resulted in internal flooding of a commercial property and made Poddington Road impassable. [TAB,PAG] (p7)
