GB-BDF,2,2020-12-23,52.1166865,-0.5061461,"<div id=""html_dcf5bd82d3429393039affa48d61fb60"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Mill Lane, Kempston</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The river crossing beneath Mill Lane is to be investigated to determine if there are constrictions to river flow that could contribute to flooding; landowner liaison was proposed to agree next steps. [TAB] (p23)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,"Mill Lane, Kempston",England,The river crossing beneath Mill Lane is to be investigated to determine if there are constrictions to river flow that could contribute to flooding; landowner liaison was proposed to agree next steps. [TAB] (p23),,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23,Bedford flooding 23 Dec 2020 - 26 Dec 2020,"Flood Investigation Report, Locations: Various across Bedford Borough, Flood Event: December 2020",005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Oct/2021.pdf
GB-BDF,2,2020-12-23,52.2008777,-0.6101819,"<div id=""html_9031f85e1e869caec22c6fb6d78d8bc9"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>The Green, Harrold</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The culvert at The Green watercourse required a capacity assessment to identify improvement works after flooding affected nearby properties; flood protection measures for affected properties were to be investigated. [TAB] (p26)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,"The Green, Harrold",England,The culvert at The Green watercourse required a capacity assessment to identify improvement works after flooding affected nearby properties; flood protection measures for affected properties were to be investigated. [TAB] (p26),,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23,Bedford flooding 23 Dec 2020 - 26 Dec 2020,"Flood Investigation Report, Locations: Various across Bedford Borough, Flood Event: December 2020",005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Oct/2021.pdf
GB-BDF,2,2020-12-23,52.2538568,-0.6220011,"<div id=""html_f17bb682fb904f6686600bb26f4b07b2"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>High Street, Podington</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The culvert running beneath High Street was identified as a factor influencing local flood levels; an investigation of the culvert&#8217;s condition and an assessment of its capacity were recommended to set inspection/maintenance regimes and reduce flood risk. [TAB] (p22)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,"High Street, Podington",England,The culvert running beneath High Street was identified as a factor influencing local flood levels; an investigation of the culvert’s condition and an assessment of its capacity were recommended to set inspection/maintenance regimes and reduce flood risk. [TAB] (p22),,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23,Bedford flooding 23 Dec 2020 - 26 Dec 2020,"Flood Investigation Report, Locations: Various across Bedford Borough, Flood Event: December 2020",005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Oct/2021.pdf
GB-BDF,2,2020-12-23,52.2891964,-0.5179477,"<div id=""html_f8ed46cbbf9c633f181e60999d966767"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>High Street, Yelden</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Gullies on High Street were silted/blocked as a result of the flood and were subsequently cleared of siltation and blockages (remedial works completed in March 2021). [TAB] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,"High Street, Yelden",England,Gullies on High Street were silted/blocked as a result of the flood and were subsequently cleared of siltation and blockages (remedial works completed in March 2021). [TAB] (p30),,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23,Bedford flooding 23 Dec 2020 - 26 Dec 2020,"Flood Investigation Report, Locations: Various across Bedford Borough, Flood Event: December 2020",005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Oct/2021.pdf
GB-BDF,2,2020-12-23,52.2805983,-0.4515456,"<div id=""html_e4c5bbce7b93526d0013ca9ea314474b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>High Street, Swineshead</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Blocked highway drainage and culverts caused flooding along High Street; drainage and culvert clearance works were completed for the length of High Street in May 2021 as a direct response to the flooding problems identified. [TAB] (p33)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,"High Street, Swineshead",England,Blocked highway drainage and culverts caused flooding along High Street; drainage and culvert clearance works were completed for the length of High Street in May 2021 as a direct response to the flooding problems identified. [TAB] (p33),,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23,Bedford flooding 23 Dec 2020 - 26 Dec 2020,"Flood Investigation Report, Locations: Various across Bedford Borough, Flood Event: December 2020",005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Oct/2021.pdf
