Named in the Environment Agency Flood Warning for the River Great Ouse (24/12/2020 21:11) and therefore affected by river flooding associated with the 23–26 December 2020 event. [TAB] (p14)",,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23,Bedford flooding 23 Dec 2020 - 26 Dec 2020,"Flood Investigation Report, Locations: Various across Bedford Borough, Flood Event: December 2020",005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Oct/2021.pdf
