Harrold experienced flooding that affected highway drainage and local watercourses. Response actions include clearance of blocked highway drains (e.g. around Orchard Lane), setting up a community flood group with flood kit and plan, investigations and maintenance of nearby watercourses and culverts, and proposals for capacity improvements and a flood warning system. [TAB] (p21)
