, plus consideration of upstream NFM measures. [TAB] (p31)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>5 residential [TAB] (p7)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>3 streets [TAB] (p30)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,Yelden,England,"Flooding of the River Till led to internal flooding of residential properties and made the High Street impassable. [TAB] (p7)
