GB-BDF,2,2020-12-23,52.3106236,-0.457456,"<div id=""html_3dda5237b0536f34f62c29ef903a6463"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Lower Dean</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>River Till&ndash;related flooding prompted a Flood Warning for Lower Dean on 23/12/2020 (Flood Warning issued 23/12/2020 16:57), indicating river flooding affected Lower Dean. [TAB] (p14)</p></div></div></body></div>",Bedford,Lower Dean,England,"River Till–related flooding prompted a Flood Warning for Lower Dean on 23/12/2020 (Flood Warning issued 23/12/2020 16:57), indicating river flooding affected Lower Dean. [TAB] (p14)",,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23.html,GB-BDF_2_2020-12-23,Bedford flooding 23 Dec 2020 - 26 Dec 2020,"Flood Investigation Report, Locations: Various across Bedford Borough, Flood Event: December 2020",005/Bedford/005/2021/Bedford/Bedford/Oct/2021.pdf
