GB-NNH,35,2014-08-10,52.5656255,-0.5188416,"<div id=""html_41f1278ab96f1d2d2a2d486eb0422e80"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Willow Lane, King's Cliffe</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Planning documents for the development on this site (between Willow Lane and Fineshade Close Wood Road) indicate soakaways appear to fail in certain storm durations and drainage calculations omit impermeable areas contributing to soakaways; these drainage shortcomings contributed to surface water drainage failure during the flood event. (p15)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Associated with highway drainage and road&ndash;gully drainage concerns; identified for investigation of main drainage arrangements due to risk of surface water runoff overwhelming highway drainage and creating flood risk to the road and nearby properties. (p26)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Northamptonshire,"Willow Lane, King's Cliffe",England,"Planning documents for the development on this site (between Willow Lane and Fineshade Close Wood Road) indicate soakaways appear to fail in certain storm durations and drainage calculations omit impermeable areas contributing to soakaways; these drainage shortcomings contributed to surface water drainage failure during the flood event. (p15)
Associated with highway drainage and road–gully drainage concerns; identified for investigation of main drainage arrangements due to risk of surface water runoff overwhelming highway drainage and creating flood risk to the road and nearby properties. (p26)",,GB-NNH_35_2014-08-10.html,GB-NNH_35_2014-08-10,King's Cliffe flooding 10 Aug 2014,"Flood Investigation Report: Sovereign Grange, Wood Road, Kings Cliffe, 10th August 2014",090/North Northamptonshire/Kings-Cliffe/021015-2.pdf
