GB-NNH,35,2014-08-10,52.5656473,-0.5171617,"<div id=""html_e263a708ef3fc3a2eb08315544f32e99"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>King's Forest, King's Cliffe</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Included in the area for investigation of existing main drainage arrangements and road gully serving Wood Road and adjacent streets, implying exposure to surface water/highway runoff issues and potential flooding of roads/properties; recommended remedial actions include drainage investigation and improvements. (p26)</p></div></div></body></div>",North Northamptonshire,"King's Forest, King's Cliffe",England,"Included in the area for investigation of existing main drainage arrangements and road gully serving Wood Road and adjacent streets, implying exposure to surface water/highway runoff issues and potential flooding of roads/properties; recommended remedial actions include drainage investigation and improvements. (p26)",,GB-NNH_35_2014-08-10.html,GB-NNH_35_2014-08-10,King's Cliffe flooding 10 Aug 2014,"Flood Investigation Report: Sovereign Grange, Wood Road, Kings Cliffe, 10th August 2014",090/North Northamptonshire/Kings-Cliffe/021015-2.pdf
