GB-LAN,27,2015-12-01,53.7408403,-2.5677883,"<div id=""html_f88cb9da49b8afc350403fcb1d3dc33b"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>River Darwen</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>The River Darwen overtopped its banks at the Cann Bridge area and was identified as the primary source of flooding that caused internal flooding to properties in Higher Walton on 26 December 2015. [TAB,PAG] (p15)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Overtopped its banks and caused internal flooding to properties in Higher Walton (Cann Bridge and Higher Walton Road areas). [TAB] (p16)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Identified as the source of flood risk in Higher Walton; Environment Agency will investigate measures to reduce flood risk from the river following the event. [TAB,PAG] (p17)</p></div><i>Quantified impacts</i><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>12 properties [TAB,PAG] (p15)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>16 properties [TAB] (p16)</p></div><div class=""nugget-popup quant""><p>4 properties [TAB,PAG] (p17)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,River Darwen,England,"The River Darwen overtopped its banks at the Cann Bridge area and was identified as the primary source of flooding that caused internal flooding to properties in Higher Walton on 26 December 2015. [TAB,PAG] (p15)
Overtopped its banks and caused internal flooding to properties in Higher Walton (Cann Bridge and Higher Walton Road areas). [TAB] (p16)
Identified as the source of flood risk in Higher Walton; Environment Agency will investigate measures to reduce flood risk from the river following the event. [TAB,PAG] (p17)","12 properties [TAB,PAG] (p15)
16 properties [TAB] (p16)
4 properties [TAB,PAG] (p17)",GB-LAN_27_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_27_2015-12-01,South Ribble flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,South Ribble District Flood Report: Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/south-ribble-final-report.pdf
