GB-LAN,12,2015-12-01,53.81359304893992,-2.5320952047206924,"<div id=""html_86dddb863c9a4a08f10f6515d8683de9"" style=""width: 100.0%; height: 100.0%;""><head><meta charset=""utf-8""><link href=""../../../../output/html/style.css"" rel=""stylesheet""/></head><body class=""readout""><div><h1 class='h-popup'>Ribchester</h1><div class=""nugget-popup""><p>Demountable flood barriers were deployed in Ribchester during the December 2015 floods as part of the response to reduce flooding impacts on properties and infrastructure. [TAB] (p8)</p></div></div></body></div>",Lancashire,Ribchester,England,Demountable flood barriers were deployed in Ribchester during the December 2015 floods as part of the response to reduce flooding impacts on properties and infrastructure. [TAB] (p8),,GB-LAN_12_2015-12-01.html,GB-LAN_12_2015-12-01,Rossendale flooding 01 Dec 2015 - 31 Dec 2015,Rossendale District Flood Report: Recommended Actions,069/Lancashire County/rossendale-final-report.pdf
